  <para style="h">Ezekiyeli</para>
  <para style="toc1">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana Ezekiyeli</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ezekiyeli</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ezk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Igitabu c’uwavugishwa n’Imana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ezekiyeli</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EZK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Iyo Ezekiyeli yeretswe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 1:1" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo itatu, mu kwezi kwawo kwa kane, no ku musi wakwo wa gatanu, igihe nari nkiri mu bajanywe ari inyagano hafi y’uruzi Kebari i Babiloni, amajuru yarugurutse, maze mbona ivyo Imana inyeretse.<verse eid="EZK 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 1:2" />Ivyo vyabaye ku musi ugira gatanu w’ukwo kwezi, hari mu mwaka ugira gatanu umwami Yehoyakimu ari mu kinyago. <verse eid="EZK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 1:3" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri Ezekiyeli umuherezi, mwene Buzi, ari hafi y’uruzi Kebari, mu gihugu c’Abanyababiloni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Abakaludaya</char></note>. Ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kwari kuri we.<verse eid="EZK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 1:4" />Ngize gutya mbona umuyaga w’igihuhusi uje uturutse mu buraruko, mbona n’igicu kinini cane kivamwo imiravyo, gikikujwe n’umuco mwinshi. Hagati muri uwo muriro hasa n’icuma gica ibibatsi kubera umuriro, <verse eid="EZK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 1:5" />kandi muri uwo muriro habonekamwo ibinyabuzima bine. Vyaboneka bifise imero nk’iy’umuntu, <verse eid="EZK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 1:6" />ariko kimwe cose cari gifise mu maso hane n’amababa ane. <verse eid="EZK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 1:7" />Amaguru yavyo yari agororotse, ibirenge vyavyo vyari bimeze nk’ivy’inyana, bigakayangana nk’umwakaka uhinguwe neza. <verse eid="EZK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 1:8" />Musi ya ya mababa yavyo ku mpande zine zose, vyari bifise amaboko nk’ay’umuntu. Vyose uko ari bine vyari bifise mu maso hane n’amababa ane kimwe cose cisangije. <verse eid="EZK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 1:9" />Amababa ya kimwe cose yakora ku mababa y’ikindi. Kimwe cose mu kugenda caguma kija imbere, mu kugenda ntivyahindukira.<verse eid="EZK 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 1:10" />Mu maso havyo hari hameze uku: kimwe cose muri ivyo bine, cari gifise mu maso hasa n’ah’umuntu, kandi ku ruhande rw’i buryo kimwe cose cari gifise mu maso nk’ah’intare, ku ruhande rw’i bubamfu kikagira mu maso nk’ah’impfizi; ku rw’inyuma vyose vyari bifise mu maso nk’ah’inkona. <verse eid="EZK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 1:11" />Uko ni ko mu maso havyo hari hameze. Kimwe cose cari gifise amababa abiri ashanje aja hejuru kandi ibaba ryose ryakora kw’ibaba ry’ikindi ku mpande zose, kikongera kikagira ayandi abiri apfuka umubiri waco. <verse eid="EZK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 1:12" />Kimwe cose cagenda gitumbereye imbere yaco. Aho hose impwemu ishatse kuja, vyaca bijayo bitarinze guhindukira. <verse eid="EZK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 1:13" />Ivyo binyabuzima vyari bifise ishusho nk’iy’amakara yaka, canke na ho bigasa n’ibimuri. Uwo muriro waja imbere n’inyuma hagati muri vyo warabonesha cane, kandi wavamwo imiravyo. <verse eid="EZK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 1:14" />Ivyo binyabuzima vyaragendagenda imbere n’inyuma bimeze nk’imiravyo.<verse eid="EZK 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 1:15" />Nkiriko ndaraba ivyo binyabuzima, nca mbona ipine rishika hasi, i ruhande ya hamwe mu maso hane havyo. <verse eid="EZK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 1:16" />Ayo mapine uko yasa n’uko yari yubatse vyari bimeze gutya: yakayangana nk’amabuye y’agaciro yitwa topazi kandi yose uko ari ane yarasa. Vyari bimeze nk’aho ipine rimwe ryinjira mu rindi. <verse eid="EZK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 1:17" />Kandi mu kugenda, vyashobora kuja mu mpande zavyo zose uko ari zine, ntivyarinda guhindukira iyo biriko biragenda. <verse eid="EZK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 1:18" />Amaringi y’ayo mapine yagera hejuru hateye ubwoba, kandi yari yuzuyeko amaso impande zose.<verse eid="EZK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 1:19" />Iyo ivyo binyabuzima bigiye, ya mapine ari ku mpande zavyo na yo yaca agenda, kandi iyo bigurutse, na yo yaraguruka. <verse eid="EZK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 1:20" />Iyo impwemu y’ivyo binyabuzima yaja, ni yo n’ayo mapine yaja, kandi ayo mapine yahagurukana n’iyo mpwemu, kuko impwemu y’ivyo binyabuzima yari muri ayo mapine. <verse eid="EZK 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 1:21" />Ivyo binyabuzima bigiye, n’amapine yaragenda, bihagaze na yo agahagarara; ibinyabuzima bivuye hasi, ya mapine yavana hasi na vyo, kuko mpwemu w’ivyo binyabuzima yari muri ayo mapine.<verse eid="EZK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 1:22" />Hejuru y’umutwe w’ikinyabuzima cose hari ikimeze nk’igicu gikayangana nk’ikiyo, kandi giteye ubwoba. <verse eid="EZK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 1:23" />Musi y’ico gicu hari amababa ashanje, ibaba ryose rya kimwe rigakora ku ry’ikindi, kandi kimwekimwe cose cari gifise amababa abiri apfuka umutumba waco. <verse eid="EZK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 1:24" />Iyo ivyo binyabuzima bigurutse, narumva urwamo rw’amababa yavyo; rwari rumeze nk’urw’amazi asuma, canke nk’ijwi ry’Iyishoboravyose, canke nk’urwamo rw’ingabo nyinshi. Bihagaze, vyaca bimanura amababa yavyo.<verse eid="EZK 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 1:25" />Nca numva ijwi rivuye mw’ijuru rivugira hejuru y’imitwe yavyo, aho vyari bihagaze vyamanuye amababa yavyo. <verse eid="EZK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 1:26" />Hejuru y’ico gicu cari giherereye ku mitwe yavyo hari igisa n’intebe y’ubwami ikozwe mw’ibuye ry’agaciro ryitwa lapisi lazuli, kandi kuri iyo ntebe hari uwufise ishusho nk’iy’umuntu. <verse eid="EZK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 1:27" />Mbona ko uhereye nko mu rukenyerero, uduga hejuru, hasa n’icuma gitukujwe n’umuriro, umenga hakikujwe n’umuriro, kandi kuva ngaho umanuka na ho hasa n’umuriro, kandi ikibengebenge cari kimukikije. <verse eid="EZK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 1:28" />Kurya umunywamazi uboneka umeze ku gicu ku musi imvura igomba kugwa, ni ko ugukayangana kwari kumukikuje kwari kumeze.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 1:28">Uko ni ko nabonye ibisa n’ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Ndabibonye nikubita hasi nubamye, maze numva ijwi ry’uwuvuga.<verse eid="EZK 1:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EZK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ihamagarwa rya Ezekiyeli ngo abe uwuvugishwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 2:1" />Arambarira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, haguruka mvugane nawe.” <verse eid="EZK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 2:2" />Akivuga, Mpwemu aca anzamwo, arampagurutsa ndahagarara, maze nca ndumva uwariko aramvugisha.<verse eid="EZK 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 2:3" />Ambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, ndagutumye ku Bisirayeli, kw’ihanga ry’abagarariji, ryangararije; bo hamwe na ba sekuruza babo bamye bangarariza gushika n’uwu musi. <verse eid="EZK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 2:4" />Abo bantu ndakurungitseko ni abantu bashira isoni, kandi bakomantaye imitima. Genda ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze.’ <verse eid="EZK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 2:5" />Bemeye kukwumviriza canke banse, kuko ari abagarariji, ivyo ari vyo vyose bazomenya ko uwuvugishwa n’Imana yabagendeye. <verse eid="EZK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 2:6" />Ariko wewe mwana w’umuntu, ntuzobatinye, canke ngo utinye amajambo yabo. Ntuzotinye naho uzoba uri hagati mu gisuru canke mu mahwa, ukaba muri za sikoropiyo. Ntuzotinye ivyo bavuga, canke ngo bagutere ubwoba, naho ari inzu y’abagarariji. <verse eid="EZK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 2:7" />Uzobabwire ijambo ryanje, bemeye kuryumviriza canke batemeye kuryumvirize, kuko ari abagarariji. <verse eid="EZK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 2:8" />Ariko wewe, mwana w’umuntu, wumvirize ivyo ndakubwiye. Ntuzogararize nka bo. Asama, urye ico ndaguhaye.”<verse eid="EZK 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 2:9" />Ngize gutya mbona ukuboko kuramvuye kuza aho ndi. Kwari gufise igitabu, <verse eid="EZK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 2:10" />kukizingururira imbere yanje. Mu mpapuro zaco hari handitsemwo amajambo yo gucura intimba, amaganya n’amarira.<verse eid="EZK 2:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EZK 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 3:1" />Maze arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, rya ibiri imbere yawe, rya uyu muzingo w’igitabu; hanyuma ugende uvugane n’Abisirayeli.” <verse eid="EZK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 3:2" />Maze ndasama, na we ampereza uwo muzingo w’igitabu ngo ndakirye.<verse eid="EZK 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 3:3" />Arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, rya iki gitabu ndaguhaye, ucuzuze inda yawe.” Nuko ndakirya, kandi casosa nk’ubuki mu kanwa kanje.<verse eid="EZK 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 3:4" />Hanyuma aca ambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, genda rero ku nzu ya Isirayeli ubabwire amajambo yanje. <verse eid="EZK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 3:5" />Sinkurungitse ku bantu b’ururimi utazi canke rugoye, ariko nkurungitse ku nzu ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 3:6" />Sinkurungitse ku bantu b’ururimi utazi canke rudatahuritse, bavuga amajambo udatahura. Kuko ndazi iyo mba ari bo nkurungitseko bokwumvirije. <verse eid="EZK 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 3:7" />Ariko Abisirayeli ntibazokwumviriza, kuko badashaka kunyumviriza. Bose bakomantaje umutima kandi ni intagondwa. <verse eid="EZK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 3:8" />Ariko na wewe, nzoguha kugira uruhanga rukomantaye nk’urwabo, nkugire uwutagonda izosi nka bo. <verse eid="EZK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 3:9" />Uruhanga rwawe nzorukomeza nk’ibuye, rukomere nk’umunana. Ntuze ubatinye canke ngo bagutere ubwoba, naho ari abagarariji.”<verse eid="EZK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 3:10" />Yongera arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, ntega ugutwi, ushire ku mutima amajambo nkubwira. <verse eid="EZK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 3:11" />Genda kuri benewanyu bari mu kinyago, uvugane na bo. Ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze,’ bavyumviriza canke batavyumviriza, upfe kubabwira.”<verse eid="EZK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 3:12" />Maze Mpwemu arampagurutsa, nca numva ijwi risamirana cane inyuma yanje, rivuga riti: “Ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bushimagizwe muri kino kibanza.” <verse eid="EZK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 3:13" />Rwari urwamo rw’amababa ya vya binyabuzima akoranyeko, n’irya ya mapine, hamwe na rya jwi risamirana cane. <verse eid="EZK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 3:14" />Mpwemu aca aranterura ankura ngaho, ngenda nuzuye umururazi n’umubabaro mu mutima, ariko ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kwari kuri jewe n’inkomezi nyishi. <verse eid="EZK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 3:15" />Nca nja ku bari mu kinyago i Telavivu, hafi y’uruzi Kebari. Hanyuma aho nyene baba, nicara hagati yabo imisi indwi, nuzuye agahinda mu mutima.<verse eid="EZK 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ezekiyeli ahabwa igikorwa co kuba umuteramyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 3:16" />Inyuma y’imisi indwi, Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rinzako, <verse eid="EZK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 3:17" />riti: “Mwana w’umuntu, nakugize umuteramyi w’inzu ya Isirayeli; none rero niwumve amajambo nkubwira, uheze ubaburire. <verse eid="EZK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 3:18" />Ninabwira umunyakibi nti: ‘Nta kabuza uzopfa,’ hanyuma nawe ntumuburire canke ngo umuhanure, umwinginge ave mu nzira ziwe mbi, kugira ngo ukize ubuzima bwiwe, uwo munyakibi azopfa azize ivyaha vyiwe, ariko amaraso yiwe nzoyaguharurako. <verse eid="EZK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 3:19" />Ariko niwaburira umunyakibi hanyuma ntave mu bibi vyiwe no mu ngeso ziwe mbi, azopfa azize ivyaha vyiwe, ariko weho uzoba ukijije ubugingo bwawe.<verse eid="EZK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 3:20" />Kandi abagororotsi nibava mu bugororotsi bwabo, bagakora ibibi, hanyuma ngashira igitsitaza imbere yabo, bazopfa. Bitumwe n’uko utababuriye, bazokwicwa n’ivyaha vyabo. Ibikorwa vyiza vyose bakoze ntibizokwibukwa, kandi amaraso yabo nzoyaguharurako. <verse eid="EZK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 3:21" />Ariko niwaburira abagororotsi ntibakore ivyaha, nta kabuza bazobaho, kuko bazoba bakwumviye, kandi nawe ubwawe uzoba wikijije.”<verse eid="EZK 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 3:22" />Maze ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kunkorako aho nyene, ambwira ati: “Haguruka usohoke uje mu kiyaya, ico ndahakubwirira.” <verse eid="EZK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 3:23" />Nuko ndahaguruka nja mu kiyaya. Ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwari ngaho, bumeze nk’ubwo naboneye i ruhande y’uruzi Kebari, ndaheza nubama hasi.<verse eid="EZK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 3:24" />Maze Mpwemu anzamwo, arampagurutsa. Aramvugisha ambwira ati: “Genda wiyugaranire mu nzu yawe. <verse eid="EZK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 3:25" />Kandi wewe, mwana w’umuntu, bazokubohesha imigozi, ntuzoshobora no gusohoka ngo uje mu bantu. <verse eid="EZK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 3:26" />Ururimi rwawe nzorubohera mu kanwa kawe, kugira ngo uzokwame unumye, ntushobore kubakankamira kuko ari inzu y’abagarariji. <verse eid="EZK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 3:27" />Ariko ninagutuma, nzokwugurura akanwa kawe, ushobore kubabwira uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze.’ Abazoshaka kukwumviriza uzobareke bakwumviririze, abazokwanka uzobareke, kuko ari abagarariji.<verse eid="EZK 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EZK 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekiyeli yerekwa ivy’igisagara ca Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 4:1" />Mwana w’umuntu, fata ibumba urikuremwo itafari, urishire imbere yawe, urishushanyeko igisagara ca Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 4:2" />Ucerekane gikikujwe n’ingabo zigiteye, wubake ivyo kwuririrako, n’amakambi y’ingabo zigiteye, ugikikuze n’ibigwanisho. <verse eid="EZK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 4:3" />Maze ufate ikarayi y’icuma uyigire nk’igihome c’icuma gihagaze hagati yawe n’igisagara, hanyuma uhindukire ugihange amaso, umere nk’uwugiteye. Ico kizobera inzu ya Isirayeli ikimenyetso c’imburi.<verse eid="EZK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 4:4" />Hanyuma uryamire urubavu rw’i bubamfu, wishireko ivyaha vy’inzu ya Isirayeli. Uzokwishirako ivyaha vyabo imisi uzomara uryamiye urwo rubavu. <verse eid="EZK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 4:5" />Nakugeneye imisi ingana n’imyaka bamaze mu vyaha vyabo. Nuko rero uzokwishirako ivyaha vy’inzu ya Isirayeli imisi amajana atatu na mirongo icenda.<verse eid="EZK 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 4:6" />Ivyo niwabiheza, uzoheze uhindukire, uryamire urubavu rw’i buryo, wikorere ivyaha vy’ab’inzu ya Yuda. Nakugereye imisi mirongo ine, umusi umwe mu gishingo c’umwaka. <verse eid="EZK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 4:7" />Maze uzohindukiza amaso yawe urabe ukwugarizwa kwa Yerusalemu hanyuma ubangure ukuboko kwawe kutambaye impuzu, uce uhavugishwako ivyo kurandurwa. <verse eid="EZK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 4:8" />Nzokubohesha imigozi, kugira ngo ntuzoshobore guhindukira uva ku ruhande rumwe uja ku rundi imbere y’uko uheza imisi yo kwugariza kwawe.<verse eid="EZK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 4:9" />Kandi rondera ingano, sayiri, ibiharage, inkore, amasaka n’uburo, ubishire mu bushinguro, maze abe ari vyo ucumbamwo imikate yawe. Ni vyo uzorya mu misi amajana atatu na mirongo icenda uzoba uryamiye urubavu rumwe. <verse eid="EZK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 4:10" />Uzoja urafata igice c’uwo mukate gipima shekeli mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amagarama 230.</char></note> abe ari co urya ku musi ku musi no ku gihe kanaka cashinzwe. <verse eid="EZK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 4:11" />Amazi na yo nyene uzoyanywa ayapimye; uzonywa ica gatandatu c’ingero hini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’igice c’ilitiro.</char></note> ku musi, kandi uyanywere ku gihe kanaka cashinzwe. <verse eid="EZK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 4:12" />Uzorya umutsima w’ingano; uzowokereze mu maso y’abantu, ucanishije umwanda mukuru w’abantu wumye.” <verse eid="EZK 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 4:13" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Uko ni ko Abisirayeli bazorya indya zihumanye mu mahanga nzobirukaniramwo.”<verse eid="EZK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 4:14" />Nanje ndavuga nti: “Ntibikabe, ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji! Sinigeze nihumanya. Kuva nkiri muto gushika ubu, sinigenze ndya igikoko cipfiriye gutyo, canke icishwe n’inyamaswa. Nta kintu gihumanye cigeze cinjira mu kanwa kanje.”<verse eid="EZK 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 4:15" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuga ati: “Reka nkureke utekeshe indya zawe igishwemu c’amase mu gishingo c’umwanda mukuru w’abantu.”<verse eid="EZK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 4:16" />Yongera kumbwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, ngiye gutuma i Yerusalemu hakena indya. Abantu bazorya ivyokurya bapimiwe bahagaritse umutima. Bazonywa n’amazi bagerewe bihebuye. <verse eid="EZK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 4:17" />Ivyokurya n’amazi bizokena, kandi bose bazodendebukirwa, bacike intege kubera ivyaha vyabo.<verse eid="EZK 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EZK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza rw’Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 5:1" />Mwana w’umuntu, fata inkota ikarishe cane, uyikoreshe nk’urwembe, wiharangure umutwe, wimwe n’ubwanwa. Hanyuma ufate uwo mushatsi uwugaburemwo ibice bitatu hanyuma ufate umunzane upime ivyo bice bitatu bingana. <verse eid="EZK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 5:2" />Maze imisi yawe yo kwugariza igisagara niyahera, uzoturirire mu gisagara igice kimwe c’umushatsi, ikindi ca gatatu ugicagaguze inkota, uzungurutse igisagara cose, ikindi na co ugishwiragize mu muyaga, kuko nzoshwiragiriza abantu banje n’inkota. <verse eid="EZK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 5:3" />Ariko ufate umushatsi mukeya uwupfundike ku mutamana wawe. <verse eid="EZK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 5:4" />Maze wongere ufate udushatsi dukeya kuri wo, uduterere mu muriro dushe duherengetere. Umuriro uzova muri two uzodomeka inzu ya Isirayeli yose.<verse eid="EZK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 5:5" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: ‘Uku ni ko bizogendera Yerusalemu, igisagara nashize hagati y’amahanga, ndagikikuza amahanga menshi. <verse eid="EZK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 5:6" />Ariko caragararije ivyagezwe n’amabwirizwa vyanje gusumvya ayandi mahanga yose agikikuje. Cataye ivyagezwe vyanje, canka gukurikiza amategeko yanje.’<verse eid="EZK 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 5:7" />Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze ati: ‘Mwangararije gusumba ayandi mahanga yose, mwanka gukurikiza amabwirizwa yanje no kugendera mu vyagezwe vyanje, mbere ntimwashoboye no gushika ku rugezo amahanga abakikuje ariko.<verse eid="EZK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 5:8" />Kubera ivyo, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze ati: Jewe ubwanje mbaye umwansi wawe, ewe Yerusalemu, kandi nzoguhanira ku mugaragaro, amahanga arorera. <verse eid="EZK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 5:9" />Kandi kubera ibigirwamana vyawe vyo kwankwa urunuka, biri muri wewe, nzoguhana uko ntigeze mpana, kandi uburyo ntazosubira guhana. <verse eid="EZK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 5:10" />Ku bw’ivyo muri mwebwe abavyeyi bazorya abana babo, abana barye abavyeyi babo. Nzobahana, kandi amasigarira yo muri mwebwe nzoyasanzaza atwarwe n’umuyaga.’ <verse eid="EZK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 5:11" />Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze ati: ‘Indahiro ni jewe nyene, ko mwahumanishije Ingoro yanje ibishushanyo vyanyu hamwe n’ibizira mukora, jewe ubwanje nzobakurako ubuntu bwanje, kandi nta n’umwe nzogirira imbabazi ngo ndamukingire. <verse eid="EZK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 5:12" />Ica gatatu c’abantu bawe bazokwicwa n’akaranda canke bicwe n’inzara; ikindi ca gatatu kizomarwa n’inkota ivuye inyuma y’igisagara canyu, ikindi na co gishwiragizwe n’umuyaga, bakurikirwe n’inkota, ibamare.<verse eid="EZK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 5:13" />Ishavu ryanje rizoheza risubire hasi, kandi uburake bwanje buturure, kuko nzoba nihoye. Ninamara kubasukako uburake bwanje, bazomenya ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> navuganye uburake.<verse eid="EZK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 5:14" />Nzokugira umusaka n’akajoreza ku banyamahanga bagukikuje, no mu maso y’abahita. <verse eid="EZK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 5:15" />Uzoba igitutsi n’agatwengo, akarorero kabi n’akajoreza mu mahanga agukikuje, ninagucira urubanza mu burake, nkagukankamirana umujinya mwinshi, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 5:16" />Ninakurasisha umwampi wanje wica ugatikiza, ari co kigoyi, nzoba ndawurashe kugira ngo ndakurandure. Nzokugwizako ikigoyi, nzibire n’ahazanana ivyokurya hose. <verse eid="EZK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 5:17" />Nzokurungikira inzara n’inyamaswa zo mw’ishamba, kandi zizosiga utagira ikibondo. Ivyago n’ugusesa amaraso bizogukubura, kandi nzozana inkota kuri wewe. Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mbivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 5:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EZK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyago ku misozi ya Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 6:1" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambwira ijambo ati: <verse eid="EZK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 6:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, hanga amaso imisozi ya Isirayeli, uyivugishweko, <verse eid="EZK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 6:3" />uvuga uti: ‘Yemwe mwa misozi ya Isirayeli, nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji. Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji abwiye imisozi n’imitumba, ibiyaya n’imyonga: Ehe ngiye kubateza inkota, nsambure n’ibibanza musengeramwo ibigirwamana vyo ku mpinga z’imisozi. <verse eid="EZK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 6:4" />Ibicaniro vyanyu bizosenyurwa, n’ivyo mwaturirirako ibimota neza bicike umukungugu; kandi abantu bawe nzobicira imbere y’ibigirwamana vyawe. <verse eid="EZK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 6:5" />Imivyimba y’Abisirayeli nzoyirambika imbere y’ibigirwamana vyabo, amagufa yabo ndayashwiragize hirya no hino y’ibicaniro vyawe. <verse eid="EZK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 6:6" />Aho muba hose, ibisagara vyanyu nzobisiga ari imisaka, n’ibibanza musengeramwo vyo ku mpinga z’imisozi bizosenyurwe, kugira ngo ibicaniro vyanyu bizobe akahebwe n’imisaka, ibigirwamana vyanyu bimenagurwe bikurweho, ibicaniro vyanyu vyo guturira ibimota neza bijanjagurwe, n’ibikorwa vy’amaboko yanyu bikurweho. <verse eid="EZK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 6:7" />Hagati muri mwebwe, abakomeretse ni ho bazopfira, maze muzoca mumenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 6:8" />Ariko nzosigaza bakeya, bo muri mwebwe bazocika kw’icumu, igihe muzosanzarira mu mahanga yo kw’isi yose. <verse eid="EZK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 6:9" />Maze mu mahanga iyo bazoba bari, aho bazoba bajanywe ari inyagano, bazonyibuka, bibuke ingene nababazwa n’umutima w’ubusambanyi wari muri bo, watumye bahindukira bakanta, hamwe n’amaso yabo yatuma bipfuza ibigirwamana vyabo. Bazokwicuza ibibi bakoze hamwe n’ibikorwa bizira bakoze vyose. <verse eid="EZK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 6:10" />Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi ko mu kubabwira ko nzobateza ivyago kutari ukubatera ubwoba gusa.<verse eid="EZK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 6:11" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Kubita amashi ku yandi wongere udide imigere hasi, uvuge uti: Yooo! Kubera ibikorwa bibi kandi vyo kwankwa Abisirayeli bakoze, bazomarwa n’inkota, ikigoyi n’akaranda. <verse eid="EZK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 6:12" />Uwuri kure azokwicwa n’ingwara y’ikiza, uwuri hafi yicwe n’inkota, kandi uwuzocika kw’icumu akazigamwa na we azokwicwa n’ikigoyi. Uko ni ko nzobasukako uburake bwanje. <verse eid="EZK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 6:13" />Bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nibasanga imivyimba y’abantu babo yandagaye mu bigirwamana vyabo, hirya no hino y’ibicaniro vyabo, ku dusozi twose tureture no mu mataba y’imisozi, musi y’ibiti vy’imyungo n’imirinzi, aho bahora baturirira ibimota neza ibigirwamana vyabo. <verse eid="EZK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 6:14" />Nanje nzobaramvurirako ukuboko kwanje, igihugu cabo ndagihindure agahinga, kuva ku bugaragwa gushika i Ribulahi, aho baba hose. Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 6:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="EZK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Iherezo rirashitse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 7:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 7:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, ibi ni vyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji abwiye igihugu ca Isirayeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:2">Umuhero! Umuhero uraje</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:2">ku mpande zine z’igihugu!<verse eid="EZK 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 7:3" />None ubu na ho ushitse kuri wewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:3">kandi nzokwimarirako ishavu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:3">Nzogucira urubanza ku ngeso zawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:3">maze nguhanire ibizira vyose wakoze.<verse eid="EZK 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 7:4" />Sinzokugirira impuhwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:4">kandi nta we nzosigaza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:4">Nta kabuza nzobahanira ingeso zanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:4">n’ibizira vyakorewe muri mwebwe.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 7:4">Ni ho muzomenyera ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 7:5" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:5">Ibara ritari bwigere ribaho!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:5">Raba, riraje!<verse eid="EZK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 7:6" />Umuhero urashitse!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:6">Umuhero urashitse!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:6">Uje kubamara!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:6">Ng’uwo urashitse!<verse eid="EZK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 7:7" />Uguhona kuragushikiriye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:7">kuragushitseko wa muntu we uba muri iki gihugu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:7">Igihe kirashitse! Umusi uri hafi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:7">Ni umusi w’agatengo, si uwo kunezerererwa ku misozi.<verse eid="EZK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 7:8" />Ngira ndagusukeko uburake bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:8">ndakwimarireko ishavu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:8">nzogucira urubanza ruhwanye n’ingeso zawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:8">nguhanire ibibi n’ibizira vyose wakoze.<verse eid="EZK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 7:9" />Sinzokugirira impuhwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:9">kandi nta we nzosigaza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:9">nzoguhemba ibikwiranye n’ingeso zawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:9">hamwe n’ibibi n’ibizira vyose biri muri wewe.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 7:9">Ni ho uzomenyera ko ari jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ngukubise.<verse eid="EZK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 7:10" />Raba, uwo musi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:10">Raba, uraje!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:10">Uguhona kuradutse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:10">inkoni yo kugukubita irashuritse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:10">ubwibone bwawe na bwo busheshe amashurwe!<verse eid="EZK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 7:11" />Umuryano ubaye mwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:11">ubaye nk’inkoni yo guhana ikibi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:11">Nta n’umwe wo muri aba bantu atazoshikirwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:11">nta n’umwe wo muri iryo sinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:11">canke ubutunzi bwabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:11">canke ibintu vy’agaciro bitazoshikirwa.<verse eid="EZK 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 7:12" />Igihe kirashitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:12">wa musi uraje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:12">Umuguzi ntanezerwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:12">kandi n’uwugurisha ntababare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:12">kuko uburake bwanje bubashitseko bose.<verse eid="EZK 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 7:13" />Umudandaza ntazokwongera kubona</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:13">ibidandazwa yadandaje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:13">naho we n’uwamuguriye bosigara ari bazima.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:13">Kuko ivyerekanywe vyerekeye abo bantu bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:13">ntibizohinduka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:13">Kubera ivyaha vyabo, nta n’umwe muri bo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:13">azokiza ubuzima bwiwe.<verse eid="EZK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 7:14" />Bamaze kuvuza inzamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:14">mbere ibintu vyose vyateguwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:14">ariko nta n’umwe azoja ku rugamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:14">kuko uburake bwanje buri kuri iryo koraniro.<verse eid="EZK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 7:15" />Inyuma y’igisagara hari inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:15">mu gisagara na ho hari akaranda n’inzara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:15">Abari mu gihugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:15">bazokwicwa n’inkota;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:15">abari mu gisagarara na bo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:15">bazomarwa n’inzara n’akaranda.<verse eid="EZK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 7:16" />Abazocika kw’icumu bagahunga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:16">bazokwirukira ku misozi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:16">Kurya kw’inuma zo mu biyaya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:16">bazoguguza baboroga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:16">umwe wese arizwa n’ivyaha vyiwe.<verse eid="EZK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 7:17" />Amaboko yose azocika inkokora avemwo inkomezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:17">amavi na yo aregarege acike nk’amazi.<verse eid="EZK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 7:18" />Bazokwambara amagunira,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:18">bambikwe gucika ivutu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:18">Mu maso habo hazokwuzura ibimaramare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:18">kandi imitwe yabo izoharangurwa.<verse eid="EZK 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 7:19" />Bazosanzaza ifeza zabo mw’ibarabara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:19">kandi inzahabu zabo zizofatwa nk’ibintu bihumanye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:19">Inzahabu n’ifeza vyabo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:19">ntibizoshobora kubakiza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:19">ku musi w’uburake bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:19">Ntibizobamara inzara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:19">canke ngo vyuzuze inda zabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:19">kuko ari vyo vyatumye baja mu vyaha.<verse eid="EZK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 7:20" />Ivyo bashazisha vy’igiciro vyabateye ubwibone,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:20">babikoramwo ibigirwamana vyankwa urunuka.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:20">Babikuyemwo amashusho ateye isoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:20">ni co gituma nzobihindura ibihumanye kuri bo.<verse eid="EZK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 7:21" />Ubutunzi bwabo nzobugabira abanyamahanga babunyage,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:21">abanyakibi bo kw’isi babusahure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:21">bongere babuhumanye.<verse eid="EZK 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 7:22" />Abantu nzobanyegeza mu nyonga hanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:22">abanyazi na bo baze bahumanye igihugu nakunze.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:22">Bazocinjira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:22">hanyuma bagihumanye.<verse eid="EZK 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 7:23" />Nimutegure iminyororo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:23">Kuko igihugu cuzuye ugusesa amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:23">n’igisagara kikaba cuzuye umuryano.<verse eid="EZK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 7:24" />Nzozana ihanga rirusha ayandi kuba ribi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:24">ryigarurire amazu yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:24">Nzomara ubwibone bw’abahambaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:24">mpumanye insengero zabo.<verse eid="EZK 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 7:25" />Ibirandura umutima nivyaza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:25">bazorondera amahoro batari buyaronke.<verse eid="EZK 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 7:26" />Icago kizokurwaho n’ikindi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:26">igihuha kibisikanye n’ikindi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:26">Bazobaza abavugishwa b’ibinyoma ivyo beretswe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:26">inyigisho z’ivyagezwe z’abaherezi zizobura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:26">co kimwe n’impanuro z’abakurambere.<verse eid="EZK 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 7:27" />Umwami azogandara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:27">umuganwa yihebure, amaboko y’abanyagihugu adendebukirwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 7:27">Nzobahana nk’uko ingeso zabo ziri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 7:27">ndabacire urubanza nkurikije amategeko yabo.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 7:27">Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="EZK 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="EZK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Ibigirwamana mu Ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 8:1" />Mu mwaka ugira gatandatu, mu kwezi kwa gatandatu, ku musi wakwo wa gatanu, nari nicaye mu nzu yanje, kandi abatware b’Abayuda bari bicaye imbere yanje, maze ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji kunzako. <verse eid="EZK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 8:2" />Ngize gutya mbona ishusho isa n’iy’umuntu. Kuva ahaboneka nko mu rukenyerero rwiwe kumanuka, hasa n’umuriro, haruguru na ho hasa n’icuma gica ibibatsi. <verse eid="EZK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 8:3" />Agorora ikintu gisa n’ukuboko, amfata umushatsi. Maze Mpwemu aca arandugana hagati y’isi n’ijuru, ndi muri ukwo kwerekwa n’Imana, anjana i Yerusalemu, mu rwinjiriro rw’irembo ryo mu buraruko mu rugo imbere, ahari hateretse ikigirwamana gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> apfuha. <verse eid="EZK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 8:4" />Ubwo nyene imbere yanje, haca haza ubwiza bw’Imana ya Isirayeli, bwari bumeze nk’ubwo nabonye mu kiyaya.<verse eid="EZK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 8:5" />Nuko arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, raba mu buraruko.” Ndavyeyo, nca mbona muri rwa rwinjiriro rw’irembo uja ku gicaniro hari ca kigirwamana gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> araka.<verse eid="EZK 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 8:6" />Arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, urabona ivyo bariko barakora, ibizira bihambaye Abisirayeli bakora, ibizira bizontuma nigira kure y’Ingoro yanje? Ariko bandanya wegere urabona n’ibindi bizira biruta ivyo.”<verse eid="EZK 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 8:7" />Nuko aca anjana ku rwinjiriro rw’urugo. Ngize gutya, mbona igitoboro mu ruhome. <verse eid="EZK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 8:8" />Maze arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, niwimbe muri urwo ruhome.” Nanje ndimba, nca mbona urwinjiriro.<verse eid="EZK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 8:9" />Aca arambwira ati: “Injira urabe amabi n’ibizira bariko barahakorera.” <verse eid="EZK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 8:10" />Nuko ndinjira ndaraba, mbona bashushanije ku mpome zose ubwoko bwose bw’ibikwega inda hasi n’ibikoko bihumanye hamwe n’ibigirwamana vyose vy’inzu ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 8:11" />Imbere yavyo hari hahagaze abatware b’Abisirayeli mirongo indwi, kandi Yahazaniya mwene Shafani yari ahagararanye na bo. Umwe wese yari afise icotezo mu minwe, kandi umwotsi w’ibimota neza wariko uraduga.<verse eid="EZK 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 8:12" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, wabonye ivyo abatware b’Abisirayeli bakorera mu mwijima, umwe wese i ruhande y’ibishushanyo vyiwe? Bibwira bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntatubona, iki gihugu yaragihevye.’ ” <verse eid="EZK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 8:13" />Yongera ambwira ati: “Uraza kubona n’ibindi bizira bikomeye bakora.”<verse eid="EZK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 8:14" />Hanyuma aca anjana ku rwinjiriro amaja mu buraruko bw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, nca mbona abagore bicayeho, baririra igishusho c’imana yitwa Tamuzi. <verse eid="EZK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 8:15" />Arambwira ati: “Ivyo wabibonye ga mwana w’umuntu? Uraza kubona n’ibindi bizira biruta ivyo.”<verse eid="EZK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 8:16" />Nuko aca anyinjiza imbere mu rugo rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Mu rwinjiriro rwayo, hagati y’umuryango n’igicaniro c’umwakaka, hari abagabo mirongo ibiri na batanu. Bari bateye umugongo urusengero, baraba mu buseruko, bunamira izuba.<verse eid="EZK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 8:17" />Arambaza ati: “Ivyo wabibonye ga mwana w’umuntu? Mbega ab’inzu ya Yuda bibaza ko gukorera ibizira nk’ibi ngaha ari ibintu bisanzwe? Igihugu cabo bakacuzuzamwo umuryano, bagatuma mbandanya nuzura uburake? Ehe raba ingene bashira inengo ku zuru ngo bandatse. <verse eid="EZK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 8:18" />Ni co gituma nanje nzobarakira; sinzobarabana ijisho ry’imbabazi, kandi nta n’umwe ntazoshikira. Naho bazontakambira mu matwi n’ijwi rirenga, sinzobumva.”<verse eid="EZK 8:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="EZK 9" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza ku basenga ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 9:1" />Maze numva <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahamagara n’ijwi rirenga, avuga ati: “Nzanira hano abagabo bateguwe ngo bahane ico gisagara, bazanane n’ibigwanisho vyabo mu minwe.” <verse eid="EZK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 9:2" />Nuko nca mbona abagabo batandatu bazananye mw’irembo ryo haruguru rirabana no mu buraruko, umwe wese afise ikigwanisho cica mu minwe. Muri bo harimwo umugabo yari yambaye impuzu zera derere, afise mu rukenyerero ibikoresho vyo kwandika. Baraza bahagarara i ruhande ya ca gicaniro c’umwakaka.<verse eid="EZK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 9:3" />Maze ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli buraduga buvuye ku bakerubi aho bwari buri, buja mu rwinjiriro rw’Ingoro. <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ahamagara wa mugabo yari yambaye impuzu zera derere, yari afise mu rukenyerero ibikoresho vyo kwandika, <verse eid="EZK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 9:4" />amubwira ati: “Nyuragira hagati mu gisagara ca Yerusalemu, ushire ikimenyetso mu ruhanga rw’abo bose bababara, bagacura intimba kubera ibizira bikorerwa muri iki gisagara.”<verse eid="EZK 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 9:5" />Nkiriko ndumviriza, numva abwiye abandi ati: “Nimumukurikire mu gisagara, mwice ata mbabazi n’impuhwe uwo wese musanga atariko ikimenyetso. <verse eid="EZK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 9:6" />Mwice abatama, imisore, inkumi, abagore n’abana. Ariko ntimukore ku muntu n’umwe ariko ikimenyetso. Muhere mu Ngoro yanje.” Nuko baca bahera ku batama bari imbere y’Ingoro.<verse eid="EZK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 9:7" />Yongera ababwira ati: “Nimuhumanye Ingoro, urugo rwayo murwuzuze imivyimba. Nimugende!” Nuko barasohoka baca mu gisagara bagenda barica nk’uko bari babwiwe. <verse eid="EZK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 9:8" />Bariko barica, nari nsigaye ndi jenyene, nca nikubita hasi nubamye, ndatakamba n’ijwi rirenga nti: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, mbega ugira utikize amasigarira ya Isirayeli, mu gusuka uburake bwawe kuri Yerusalemu?”<verse eid="EZK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 9:9" />Aranyishura ati: “Ivyaha vy’inzu ya Isirayeli n’ivya Yuda vyabaye umurengera; igihugu cuzuye amaraso, umugwa na wo wuzuye akarenganyo. Bibwira bati: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yarataye kino gihugu; <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ntatubona.’ <verse eid="EZK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 9:10" />None rero sinzobarabisha ijisho ry’impuhwe, kandi nta n’umwe nzosigaza, ahubwo nzomanurira ku mitwe yabo ivyo bakoze vyose.”<verse eid="EZK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 9:11" />Maze wa muntu yari yambaye impuzu zera derere afise mu rukenyerero ibikoresho vyo kwandika agaruka kuvuga inkuru ati: “Nakoze ivyo wantumye.”<verse eid="EZK 9:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="EZK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ubwiza bw’Imana buva ku Ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 10:1" />Ngize gutya mbona ikimeze nk’intebe y’ubwami isa n’ibuye ry’agaciro ryitwa lapisi lazuli iri hejuru y’imitwe ya ba bakerubi. <verse eid="EZK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 10:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira wa muntu yari yambaye impuzu zera derere ati: “Ja hagati mu mapine ari musi y’abakerubi. Wuzuze amashi yawe amakara yaka, hanyuma uyashwiragize mu gisagara.” Nuko aragenda abikora ndamuraba.<verse eid="EZK 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 10:3" />Ico gihe ba bakerubi bari bahagaze ku ruhande rwo hepfo y’Ingoro igihe uwo mugabo yinjira muri ayo mapine, hanyuma igicu c’ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> gica cuzura imbere mu Ngoro. <verse eid="EZK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 10:4" />Maze bwa bwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buraduga buva ku bakerubi buja mu rwinjiriro rw’Ingoro. Ca gicu gica cuzura Ingoro, inyubakwa yose yuzura ugukayangana kw’ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 10:5" />Ugukubita kw’amababa ya ba bakerubi kwumvikana gushika kure hanze mu rugo, kumeze nk’ijwi ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana Mushoboravyose iyo avuze.<verse eid="EZK 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 10:6" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> abarira wa muntu yari yambaye impuzu zera derere ati: “Fata umuriro wo musi y’amapine no hagati y’abakerubi.” Wa muntu aragenda ahagarara i ruhande ya ya mapine. <verse eid="EZK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 10:7" />Maze umukerubi umwe agorora ukuboko azana amakara yaka ayakuye mu muriro wariko urakira hagati muri bo; aca ayashira mu biganza vya wa muntu yari yambaye impuzu zera, na we arayakira, arasohoka. <verse eid="EZK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 10:8" />Musi y’amababa y’abakerubi hari ibimeze nk’amaboko y’umuntu.<verse eid="EZK 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 10:9" />Ngize gutya mbona amapine ane i ruhande y’abakerubi, rimwerimwe i ruhande y’umukerubi umwe; ayo mapine yarakayangana nk’akabuye k’igiciro kitwa topazi. <verse eid="EZK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 10:10" />Kandi uyaravye, ayo mapine yose uko ari ane yarasa; rimwerimwe ryose rimeze nk’aho ryinjira mu rindi. <verse eid="EZK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 10:11" />Abakerubi mu kugenda, bashobora kuja mu mpande zine zose bitewe n’aho baba baraba; ayo mapine ntiyarinda guhindukira abakerubi bariko baragenda. Bashobora kuja iyo baraba, batiriwe barahindukira. <verse eid="EZK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 10:12" />Abakerubi bari buzuyeko amaso ku mubiri wose harimwo n’umugongo, amaboko n’amababa; co kimwe n’ayo mapine. <verse eid="EZK 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 10:13" />Ndahava numva ko ayo mapine yitwa: “Nyawizunguriza.” <verse eid="EZK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 10:14" />Umukerubi umwe wese yari afise mu maso amashusho ane: ishusho ya mbere yari iy’umukerubi, iya kabiri yari iy’umuntu, iya gatatu yari iy’intare, iya kane yari iy’inkona.<verse eid="EZK 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 10:15" />Maze ba bakerubi barahaguruka. Abo ni vyo vya binyabuzima nari nabonye ku ruzi Kebari. <verse eid="EZK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 10:16" />Iyo abo bakerubi bagiye, ya mapine yajana na bo; kandi iyo bagoroye amababa ngo bave hasi, ya mapine ntiyabavako. <verse eid="EZK 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 10:17" />Abakerubi bahagaze, amapine na yo yarahagarara; bahagurutse agahagurukana na bo, kuko impwemu y’ivyo binyabuzima yari muri ayo mapine.<verse eid="EZK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 10:18" />Maze ubwiza bw’Uhoraho buva mu rwinjiriro rw’Ingoro, buhagarara hejuru ya ba bakerubi. <verse eid="EZK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 10:19" />Abo bakerubi basanza amababa mbona, barahagurutse bava hasi. Bagiye, ya mapine ajana na bo. Bahagarara mu rwinjiriro rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rutumbereye mu buseruko, kandi ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli bwari hejuru yabo.<verse eid="EZK 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 10:20" />Ivyo ni vyo binyabuzima nari nabonye biri musi y’Imana ya Isirayeli ndi ku ruzi Kebari, nca ndatahura ko bari abakerubi. <verse eid="EZK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 10:21" />Umwe wese yari afise amababa ane, kandi musi y’amababa yabo hari ibimeze nk’amaboko y’umuntu. <verse eid="EZK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 10:22" />Mu maso habo hasa n’ah’abo nari nabonye ndi ku ruzi Kebari. Umwe wese yagenda atumbereye imbere yiwe.<verse eid="EZK 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="EZK 11" />
  <para style="s1">Urubanza rw’Imana kuri Yerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 11:1" />Maze Mpwemu aranterura, anjana mu rwinjiriro rw’Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ruraba mu buseruko. Aho mu rwinjiriro hari abagabo mirongo ibiri na batanu, kandi muri bo mbonamwo Yahazaniya mwene Azuri na Pelatiya mwene Benaya, bari abatware barongora abantu. <verse eid="EZK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 11:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, abo bagabo ni abategura ibikorwa bibi muri iki gisagara, kandi bakagira inama mbi abandi. <verse eid="EZK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 11:3" />Bavuga ngo: ‘Mbega amazu yacu si ho agiheza kwubakwa? Iki gisagara cacu kimeze nk’inkono kandi natwe tumeze nk’inyama ziri muri iyo nkono.’ <verse eid="EZK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 11:4" />Nuko rero genda uvugishwe ibibi bizobashikako; vugishwa, ewe mwana w’umuntu.”<verse eid="EZK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 11:5" />Hanyuma Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aza kuri jewe, ambwira ngo mvuge nti: “Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: ‘Ivyo ni vyo muriko muravuga, mwebwe abarongozi muri Isirayeli, ariko, ndazi ivyo mwiyumvira mu mitima yanyu. <verse eid="EZK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 11:6" />Mwishe abantu benshi muri kino gisagara, amabarabara muyuzuza imivyimba.<verse eid="EZK 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 11:7" />Kubera ivyo, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Imivyimba mwandagaje ahantu hose ni inyama; iki gisagara na co ni inkono. Ariko mwebwe muzokurwa muri iyo nkono. <verse eid="EZK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 11:8" />Mutinya inkota, ariko ni yo nzobateza, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze. <verse eid="EZK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 11:9" />Nzobasohora ndabakure muri iki gisagara, ndabahereze abanyamahanga babampanire. <verse eid="EZK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 11:10" />Muzomarwa n’inkota, kandi nzobacira urubanza muri ku mbibe za Isirayeli, ni ho muzomenyera ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 11:11" />Iki gisagara ntikizobabera nk’inkono, kandi na mwebwe ntimuzoba nk’inyama muri yo; nzobacira urubanza muri ku mbibe za Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 11:12" />Namwe muzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kuko mwanse gukurikiza amabwirizwa yanje canke ngo mugendere mu vyagezwe vyanje, ariko mukishushanya n’imigenzo y’amahanga abakikuje.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 11:13" />Nkiriko ndavugishwa, Pelatiya mwene Benaya aca arapfa. Maze nca ngwa nubamye, nkoma induru n’ijwi rirenga nti: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji! Mbega ugomba uherengeteze amasigarira ya Isirayeli?”<verse eid="EZK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imana isezerana ko Abisirayeli bazogarukanwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 11:14" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 11:15" />“Mwana w’umuntu, abantu b’i Yerusalemu baravuze kuri benewanyu bajanywe ari inyagano hamwe n’Abisirayeli bose, ngo: ‘Bari kure cane y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni twebwe twahawe iki gihugu ngo kibe umugabane wacu.’<verse eid="EZK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 11:16" />None rero genda ubwire abari mu kinyago uti: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze ati: Naho nabarungitse kure mu mahanga, nkabashwiragizayo, nzobabera urusengero muri ayo mahanga igihe cose muzomara muri mu kinyago.’<verse eid="EZK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 11:17" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nzobegeranya ndabazane ndabakuye mu bihugu mwashwiragiriyemwo, ndabasubize mu gihugu ca Isirayeli.’<verse eid="EZK 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 11:18" />Bazokigarukamwo, bagikuremwo ibishushanyo vyose hamwe n’ibigirwamana vy’ibizira. <verse eid="EZK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 11:19" />Nzobaha umutima umwe, ndabashiremwo impwemu nsha. Nzobakuramwo umutima w’ibuye ndabahe umutima w’inyama. <verse eid="EZK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 11:20" />Bazokurikiza amabwirizwa yanje, bagendere mu vyagezwe vyanje. Bazoba abantu banje, nanje nzoba Imana yabo. <verse eid="EZK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 11:21" />Ariko abeguriye imitima yabo ibishushanyo n’ibigirwamana vy’ibizira, nzobahanira ivyo bakoze vyose, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze.”<verse eid="EZK 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 11:22" />Maze ba bakerubi bakurikirwa n’amapine baca basanza amababa, kandi ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli bwari hejuru yabo. <verse eid="EZK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 11:23" />Bwa bwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> buca buva hejuru y’igisagara, buhagarara ku musozi uherereye mu buseruko bw’igisagara. <verse eid="EZK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 11:24" />Maze Mpwemu aranterura anjana mu bari mu kinyago i Babiloni, ndi mw’iyerekwa mpawe na Mpwemu w’Imana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 11:24">Hanyuma iryo yerekwa narimwo rirahera. <verse eid="EZK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 11:25" />Maze nca mbwira abari mu kinyago ivyo <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yanyeretse vyose.<verse eid="EZK 11:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="EZK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekiyeli ahabwa ikigereranyo co guhunga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 12:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 12:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, uba mu bantu b’abagarariji. Bafise amaso ariko ntibabona, bafise amatwi ariko ntibumva, kuko ari abantu b’abagarariji.<verse eid="EZK 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 12:3" />None rero, mwana w’umuntu, tekera ibintu vyawe kugira uhunge, kandi ugende ku murango, bakubona, uve aho uba wimukire ahandi. Kumbure bazotahura n’aho ari abagarariji. <verse eid="EZK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 12:4" />Uhengere ku murango usohore utwawe, ubikore bakubona, usohore ibintu vyawe, utekere kurya kw’uwuhunga. Maze ku mugoroba, usohoke bakuraba, ugende kurya kw’abahunga. <verse eid="EZK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 12:5" />Utobore igihome bakuraba, kibe ari co ucishamwo utwawe. <verse eid="EZK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 12:6" />Ubishire ku rutugu bakuraba, ubijane hatabona. Witwikire mu maso kugira ngo ntugende uraraba igihugu uvuyemwo, kuko nakugize nk’ikimenyetso ku Bisirayeli.”<verse eid="EZK 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 12:7" />Nuko ndabigenza uko nabwiwe. Mpengera ari ku murango nsohora ibintu vyanje, ndatekera ngo mpunge. Maze ku mugoroba ntobora uruhome n’amaboko, nsohora ibintu vyanje hatabona, ndabishira ku rutugu, ndagenda bandaba.<verse eid="EZK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 12:8" />Bukeye <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> antumako ijambo ryiwe ati: <verse eid="EZK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 12:9" />“Mwana w’umuntu, mbega Abisirayeli, ba bantu b’abagarariji, ntibigeze bakubaza bati: ‘Ivyo uriko ukora ni ibiki?’<verse eid="EZK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 12:10" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ubu buhanuzi ni imburi ku muganwa w’i Yerusalemu hamwe n’ab’inzu ya Isirayeli bose baba ngaho.’ <verse eid="EZK 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 12:11" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Ndi ikimenyetso kuri mwebwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 12:11">Ivyo nagize ni vyo bazokorerwa. Bazojanwa mu mahanga nk’inyagano.’<verse eid="EZK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 12:12" />Umuganwa wo muri bo azoshira utuntu twiwe ku bitugu ahunge, kandi bazomucira igitoboro mu ruhome acemwo. Azokwitwikira mu maso kugira ngo ntabone igihugu ahunze. <verse eid="EZK 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 12:13" />Nanje nzomurekurirako urusenga, kandi azofatwa mu mutego wanje awugwemwo; nzomutwara i Babiloni mu gihugu c’Abakaludaya, ariko ntazokibona, kandi ni co azogwamwo. <verse eid="EZK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 12:14" />Nzosanzariza mu miyaga yose abamukikuje, abacungera ubuzima bwiwe hamwe n’ingabo ziwe zose, mpeze ndabirukeko n’inkota.<verse eid="EZK 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 12:15" />Bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ninabashwiragiza mu mahanga no mu bihugu bitandukanye. <verse eid="EZK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 12:16" />Ariko nzokwisigariza bamwe, ndabarinde inkota, inzara n’akaranda, kugira ngo mu mahanga yose bazojamwo bazokwame bicuza ibizira bakoze. Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="EZK 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 12:17" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 12:18" />“Mwana w’umuntu, ivyokurya vyawe ubirye uhinda agashitsi, n’amazi yawe uyanywe ufise ubwoba. <verse eid="EZK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 12:19" />Abo muri iki gihugu ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze ku baba i Yerusalemu no mu gihugu ca Isirayeli: bazorya ivyokurya vyabo bahagaritse imitima, amazi yabo bayanywe bihebuye, kuko igihugu kigiye gusangangurwa, kinyagwe ivyo cari gifise vyose, kubera umuryano w’abahaba bose. <verse eid="EZK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 12:20" />Ibisagara abantu babamwo bizosigara ari imisaka, igihugu na co gisigare ari agahinga. Aho ni ho muzomenyera ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyo vyago ntibizoteba gushika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 12:21" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 12:22" />“Mwana w’umuntu, mbega uwu mugani mufise mu gihugu ca Isirayeli uvuga ngo: ‘Imisi irashira, ivyavugishijwe ntibishike,’ usigura iki? <verse eid="EZK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 12:23" />Genda ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ngiye gushira iherezo kuri uwo mwibutsa, ntuzosubira gukoreshwa mu Bisirayeli.’ Genda ubabwire uti: ‘Igihe kiregereje, aho ivyavugishijwe vyose bizoshika. <verse eid="EZK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 12:24" />Nta ndoto z’ibinyoma canke ubupfumu bwo kuryohereza abantu bizosubira kuvugwa mu Bisirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 12:25" />Ariko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nzovuga, kandi ivyo nzovuga bizoshika bidatevye. Kuko mu gihe cawe, wewe wa nzu y’ubugarariji, nzoshitsa ivyo navuze vyose, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 12:26" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 12:27" />“Mwana w’umuntu, Abisirayeli bariko bavuga bati: ‘Ivyo yerekwa ni ibizoba mu myaka myinshi iri mbere, ivyo avugishwa ni ivya kazoza ka kure.’<verse eid="EZK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 12:28" />None rero babwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nta jambo na rimwe navuze rigitevye gushika; ivyo navuze vyose bizoshika, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="EZK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi ku bavugishwa b’ibinyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 13:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 13:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, vugishwa ubwire abavugishwa b’ibinyoma ba Isirayeli bariko baravugishwa muri iki gihe. Bwira abo bariko baravugishwa ivyo biyumviriye uti: ‘Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>! <verse eid="EZK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 13:3" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Baragowe abavugishwa b’ibipfu, bakurikiza ivyo biyumviriye, ata co beretswe! <verse eid="EZK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 13:4" />Ewe Isirayeli, abavugishwa bawe bameze nk’imfyisi ziyerera mu bihomoka vy’amazu. <verse eid="EZK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 13:5" />Ntibigeze baduga ngo baje kuzibira ibihengeri vy’uruzitiro, ngo barusanure kubw’Abisirayeli kugira ngo ruze rube ruhagaze neza ku musi w’urugamba w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 13:6" />Ivyo berekwa si ivy’ukuri kandi n’ivyo babaragurira ni ibinyoma. Mbere n’aho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> atigeze abatuma, bavuga ngo: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuze,” kandi bakitega ko ashitsa ivyo bavuze. <verse eid="EZK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 13:7" />Mbega inzozi mwarose si ibinyoma kandi indagu zanyu muvuga si ububeshi, igihe muvuga muti: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aravuze,” kandi ata na kimwe navuze?<verse eid="EZK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 13:8" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Kubera amajambo yanyu y’ububeshi n’inzozi z’ibinyoma, nzobagwanya, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze. <verse eid="EZK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 13:9" />Ukuboko kwanje kuzogwanya abavugishwa berekwa ibitari vyo, bakaragura ibinyoma. Ntibazoba mw’ikoraniro ry’ubwoko bwanje, ntibazoharurwa mu bana ba Isirayeli, canke ngo binjire mu gihugu ca Isirayeli. Ni ho muzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji.<verse eid="EZK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 13:10" />Ko bazimiza abantu banje, bakavuga ngo: “Ni amahoro” kandi ata yariho, ni nk’aho abantu boba bubatse uruhome rudakomeye, maze abo bavugishwa bakarusiga ishwagara. <verse eid="EZK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 13:11" />Nuko rero, bwira abo basiga uruhome ko rugiye guhenuka. Hazogwa imvura y’isegenya, kandi nzorungika n’urubura ruhunguruke, hamwe n’umuyaga w’igihuhusi birusenyure. <verse eid="EZK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 13:12" />None uruhome nirwasenyuka, mbega abantu ntibazobabaza bati: Ya shwagara mwarusigako iri he?’<verse eid="EZK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 13:13" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze ati: ‘Mu burake bwanje, nzosuka umuyaga w’igihuhusi, ishavu ryanje rirungike urubura n’isegenya, bigwe bifise umukuba wo gusambura. <verse eid="EZK 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 13:14" />Nzosenyagura uruhome mwasize irangi ryera, ndaruryamike hasi, umushinge warwo usigare hejuru. Nirwahenuka, muzorutikiriramwo; kandi muzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 13:15" />Nuko nzoba nimariye ishavu kuri urwo ruzitiro no ku barusize iryo rangi. Nzobabwira nti: Uruzitiro ruragiye, kandi n’abarusize ishwagara bajanye na rwo, <verse eid="EZK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 13:16" />ni bo bavugishwa b’ibinyoma ba Isirayeli bavugishwa ibinyoma i Yerusalemu, bakerekwa ivy’amahoro kuri ho kandi ata yariho, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze.’<verse eid="EZK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 13:17" />Ubu na ho, mwana w’umuntu, burira abakobwa b’ubwoko bwanyu bavugishwa ivyo biyumviriye. Vugishwa ubaburire <verse eid="EZK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 13:18" />ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Haragowe abagore bajishira udukomo tw’ubukonikoni ku maboko yabo, bakibaririra imyitwikiro y’uburebure butandukanye ku mitwe yabo kugira ngo bikwegereko abantu. Mbega mwibaza ko muzokwikwegerako ubuzima bw’abantu banje mutikwegeye ukuranduka kwanyu? <verse eid="EZK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 13:19" />Mwarangayishije mu bantu banje kubera urushi rw’ingano n’akamanyu k’umutsima. Mwahenze abantu banje bumvirije ibinyoma vyanyu, mwica abatopfuye, mukingira abari bakwiye gupfa.<verse eid="EZK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 13:20" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nzogwanya ubukomo bw’ubukonikoni bwanyu mufatisha abantu banje nk’inyoni, ndabucagagurire ku maboko yanyu; nzobohora abantu mwateze nk’inyoni. <verse eid="EZK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 13:21" />Nzotabagura imyitwikiro iri ku mitwe yanyu, nkize abantu banje mu maboko yanyu, kandi ntibazosubira kugwa musi y’ububasha bwanyu. Ni ho muzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 13:22" />Kubera mwaciye intege imitima y’abagororotsi n’ibinyoma vyanyu, igihe jewe ubwanje ntari nabateye imibabaro, kandi kubera mutera intege abanyakibi ngo ntibave mu nzira zabo mbi ngo bakize ubuzima bwabo, <verse eid="EZK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 13:23" />ntimuzosubira kugira izo nzozi z’ibinyoma, canke ngo musubire kuragura. Nzokiza abantu banje ndabakure mu maboko yanyu. Ni ho namwe muzomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 13:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="EZK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi ku basenga ibigirwamana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 14:1" />Bamwe mu batware b’Abisirayeli baza aho ndi bicara imbere yanje. <verse eid="EZK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 14:2" />Maze ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 14:3" />“Mwana w’umuntu, aba bantu bateretse ibigirwamana mu mitima yabo, kandi bashize ibitsitaza bibajana mu vyaha imbere y’amaso yabo. None ni igiki cotuma ndabishura ku vyo bambaza? <verse eid="EZK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 14:4" />Nuko rero babwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Umwisirayeli niyashira ikigirwamana mu mutima wiwe, agashira igitsitaza imbere y’amaso yiwe, hanyuma akaja ku bavugishwa, nanje nzobishura ibihwanye n’ivyaha vyabo. <verse eid="EZK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 14:5" />Ivyo nzobikora kugira ngo nsubire kwigarurira imitima y’Abisirayeli, bantaye bagakurikira ibigirwamana vyabo.’<verse eid="EZK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 14:6" />None rero bwira Abisirayeli, uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nimwihane! Mureke ivyo bigirwamana hamwe n’ibindi bizira vyose mukora!<verse eid="EZK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 14:7" />Iyo Umwisirayeli canke umunyamahanga aba muri Isirayeli yitandukanije nanje agashira ibigirwamana mu mutima wiwe hamwe n’ibitsitaza imbere yiwe, hanyuma akaja ku bavugishwa b’ibinyoma ngo babavugire kuri jewe, jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nzomwiyishurira. <verse eid="EZK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 14:8" />Nzohindukiriza inyonga zanje kugwanya umuntu nk’uyo, ndamutangeko akarorero, ndamugire iciro ry’umugani. Nzomuca mu bwoko bwanje; ni ho muzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 14:9" />Kandi umuvugishwa niyahendwa ngo avuge ubuhanuzi, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nzoba ndamuhenze, kandi nzomuramvurirako ukuboko kwanje ndamurandure ndamukure mu bwoko bwanje bwa Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 14:10" />Bazoharurwako ibigabitanyo vyabo, kandi uwo muvugishwa azohanwa co kimwe n’uwuza kumuraguzako. <verse eid="EZK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 14:11" />Ni ho Abisirayeli batazosubira kuzimira ngo bamveko, kandi ntibazosubira kwihumanisha ivyaha vyabo. Bazoba abantu banje, nanje nzoba Imana yabo, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze.”<verse eid="EZK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu ntihazokira urubanza rw’Uhoraho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 14:12" />Maze Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 14:13" />“Mwana w’umuntu, hagize igihugu kincumurako, kigata ubwizigirwa, nkakiramvurirako ukuboko kwanje, ngasibanganya ahava ivyokurya vyaco, nkakirungikamwo inzara ikica abantu baco n’ibitungwa vyaco, <verse eid="EZK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 14:14" />naho abagabo batatu ari bo Nowa, Daniyeli na Yobu bobaye ari yo bari, bokijije amagara yabo gusa kubera ukugororoka kwabo, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 14:15" />Canke na ho ndungitse ibikoko vy’inkazi muri ico gihugu, bigahonya abantu bose bigasiga igihugu ari agahinga, <verse eid="EZK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 14:16" />ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, naho abo bagabo batatu bobaye ari yo bari, ntibokijije abahungu n’abakobwa babo. Bokwikijije bonyene, ariko igihugu cosigaye ari agahinga.<verse eid="EZK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 14:17" />Canke nzanye inkota kuri ico gihugu, nkavuga nti: Reka iyi nkota ice mu gihugu cose, nkica abantu bose n’ibitungwa vyabo, <verse eid="EZK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 14:18" />ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, naho abo bagabo bobaye bari muri co, ntibokijije abahungu n’abakobwa babo, bokwikijije bonyene.<verse eid="EZK 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 14:19" />Canke ndungitse icago muri ico gihugu, nkagisukako uburake bwanje mu gusesa amaraso, nkica abantu baho bose n’ibikoko vyaho vyose, <verse eid="EZK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 14:20" />ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, Jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, naho Nowa na Daniyeli na Yobu bobaye ari yo bari, ntiboshoboye gukiza abahungu n’abakobwa babo. Bokwikijije bo ubwabo, kubera ukugororoka kwabo.<verse eid="EZK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 14:21" />Kuko uku ari ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Ese ukuntu bizoba ari bibi birenze urugero ninarungika i Yerusalemu ibihano vyanje bine biteye ubwoba ari vyo inkota, inzara, ibikoko vy’inkazi n’akaranda, kugira ngo vyice abantu n’ibitungwa vyabo! <verse eid="EZK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 14:22" />Ariko muri bo nzokwisigariza bamwe, abahungu n’abakobwa bakeya bazorokoka. Bazoza kuri mwebwe, kandi nimwabona ingeso zabo n’ibikorwa vyabo muzokwirurwa ku bw’ivyago vyose nateye Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 14:23" />Muzohozwa amarira mubonye ingeso zabo n’ibikorwa vyabo, kuko muzomenya ko ata co nakoreye Isirayeli kitagira igituma, ni Jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.”<verse eid="EZK 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="EZK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu, igiti c’umuzabibu ata co kimaze</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 15:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 15:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, mbega ishami ry’igiti c’umuzabibu hari ico risumvya irindi shami iryo ari ryo ryose ryo mw’ishamba? <verse eid="EZK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 15:3" />Mbega ico giti hari uwugikuramwo imbaho zo gukoramwo ibindi bintu, canke akakibazamwo ico kumanikako ibikoresho? <verse eid="EZK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 15:4" />Mbega uko kingana iyo gicanywe, umutumba waco ugacika amakara, hari ico kiba kikimaze? <verse eid="EZK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 15:5" />None ikintu ata co gishobora kumara kikiri kizima, comara iki kimaze guturirwa kigacika umunyota?<verse eid="EZK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 15:6" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nk’uko natanze igiti c’umuzabibu ngo kibe urukwi rwo mu bindi biti vyo mw’ishamba, ni ko nzotanga ababa i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 15:7" />Nzohindukiriza inyonga zanje kubagwanya. Naho bavuye mu mucanwa, ni wo nyene uzobatongora. Kandi nzohindukirira kubagwanya, bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 15:8" />Nzosiga igihugu ari agahinga, kuko batabaye abizigirwa, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.”<verse eid="EZK 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="EZK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu, umugore w’umusambayikazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 16:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 16:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, hangana n’ababa i Yerusalemu, ubamenyeshe ibizira bakora, <verse eid="EZK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 16:3" />ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji abwiye Yerusalemu: Inkomoko yawe n’amavukiro yawe ni mu gihugu c’i Kanani; so wawe yari Umumori, nyoko wawe na we yari Umuhetikazi. <verse eid="EZK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 16:4" />Umusi uvuka, uruzogi rwawe ntirwaciwe, kandi nta wakwogeje n’amazi ngo use neza, nta n’uwagusize umunyu canke ngo akwambike impuzu nziza. <verse eid="EZK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 16:5" />Nta wakurabanye imbabazi, canke ngo akugirire impuhwe maze ngo agukorere na kimwe muri ivyo. Ahubwo watawe mu gahinga, kuko umusi uvuka wari ugayitse.<verse eid="EZK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 16:6" />Maze nguciye i ruhande, ndakubona wigaragura mu maraso yawe, ukibiryamyemwo ndakubwira nti: Baho! <verse eid="EZK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 16:7" />Naragukujije nk’igiterwa co mu murima, urakura, ugira ubwiza bw’agatangaza. Amabere yawe arasonga, umushatsi wawe urakura, naho wari ukiri gusa, ugenda amenya.<verse eid="EZK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 16:8" />Mu nyuma naguciye i ruhande, ndakuravye nsaga urageze kuronka uwugukunda, nzingurura umutamana wanje ndagupfuka, mpisha ubwambure bwawe. Maze ndakurahira indahiro ku mugaragaro, ngirana isezerano ry’ubugeni nawe, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze, uba ubaye uwanje.<verse eid="EZK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 16:9" />Nca ndakwoza, nguhanagura amaraso, mpejeje ndagusiga amavuta atamirana. <verse eid="EZK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 16:10" />Hanyuma nkwambika impuzu zera derere z’agaciro kanini, zisharije neza, nkwambika n’ibirato bikozwe mu nsato z’impene ziremvye. <verse eid="EZK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 16:11" />Nakwambitse utugenegene twiza: ibisharizo vyo ku maboko, ibirezi vyo mw’izosi, <verse eid="EZK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 16:12" />impeta yo ku zuru, amahereni ku matwi, n’urugori rw’ubwamikazi ku mutwe. <verse eid="EZK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 16:13" />Wari usharijwe n’inzahabu n’ifeza, imyambaro yawe yari yera derere kandi y’agaciro kanini, isharije cane. Ivyokurya vyawe vyari vyizavyiza, ubuki, amavuta ya elayo hamwe n’ifu inoze neza. Wari mwiza cane, kandi wari ubereye kuba umwamikazi. <verse eid="EZK 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 16:14" />Ubwiza bwawe bwatumye uba rurangiranwa mu mahanga, kuko icubahiro naguhaye catumye ubwiza bwawe buba agahebuza, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze.<verse eid="EZK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 16:15" />Ariko wahavuye wishimira ubwiza bwawe, ukumenyekana kwawe gutuma uba maraya. Wihaye uwurengana wese, ubwiza bwawe buba ubw’uwo wese ahita. <verse eid="EZK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 16:16" />Wafashe umwe mu myambaro yawe, wiyubakiramwo ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ibigirwamana mu mataba y’imisozi, aho ukorera ubumaraya. Ibintu nk’ivyo ntivyari bwigere biba! Mbega ivyo vyashitse gute? <verse eid="EZK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 16:17" />Warongeye ufata ibisharizo vyose vy’agaciro naguhaye, vyari vyakozwe mu nzahabu no mw’ifeza, wicuriramwo ibishushanyo vy’abagabo, ugirana ubumaraya na vyo. <verse eid="EZK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 16:18" />Ufata imyambaro isharije naguhaye uravyambika, ubishikanira amavuta yanje hamwe n’ibiturirwa bikamota neza vyose naguhaye. <verse eid="EZK 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 16:19" />Ivyokurya nari naguhaye ngo abe ari vyo urya: ifu inoze neza, amavuta ya elayo hamwe n’ubuki, wabibishikaniye nk’ibiturirwa bikamota neza. Ng’ivyo ivyo wakoze, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze.<verse eid="EZK 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 16:20" />Wageretseko, ufata abahungu n’abakobwa wari wamvyariye, ubashikanira ibigirwamana nk’infungurwa zavyo. Mbega ubumaraya bwawe ntibwari buhagije? <verse eid="EZK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 16:21" />Wakereye abana banje, ubashikanako ibimazi ku bigirwamana. <verse eid="EZK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 16:22" />Muri ivyo bizira vyose n’ubwo bumaraya, ntiwigeze wibuka imisi y’ubuto bwawe, igihe wari gusa ugenda amenya, wigaragura mu maraso yawe.<verse eid="EZK 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 16:23" />Uragowe! Uragowe, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze. Ikigeretse kuri ivyo bibi wakoze, <verse eid="EZK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 16:24" />wiyubakiye ikibanza co gusengeramwo nk’ic’abanyamahanga, ushira igicaniro ahantu hose hakoranira abantu. <verse eid="EZK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 16:25" />Wubatse utunyabugoro ku mayirabiri hose, uhumanya ubwiza bwawe, wegurira umubiri wawe ubusambanyi hamwe n’uwuhita wese butagira ingene bwovugwa. <verse eid="EZK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 16:26" />Wisutse mu bumaraya n’Abanyegiputa, ari bo babanyi bawe buzuye ukwipfuza, maze utuma ubusambanyi bwawe bwinshi bundatsa. <verse eid="EZK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 16:27" />Ni ho nakuramvurirako ukuboko kwanje, ngabanya igihugu cawe; ndakurekurira mu maboko y’abansi bawe, ari bo Bafilisitiya, bari batewe isoni n’ingeso mbi zawe. <verse eid="EZK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 16:28" />N’Abashuri wagiranye ubumaraya na bo, kuko usanzwe utanyurwa; kandi umaze kubana na bo mu bumaraya, ntiwanyuzwe. <verse eid="EZK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 16:29" />Wagwije ubusambanyi bwawe na Babiloni, igihugu c’abadandaza, ariko na ho nyene ntiwanyuzwe.<verse eid="EZK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 16:30" />Ese ukuntu umutima wawe wapfuye, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze, vyatumye ukora ibisa gutyo, ukigenza nka maraya atakigira udusoni! <verse eid="EZK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 16:31" />Iyo wubatse ibibanza vyo gusengeramwo ibigirwamana mu mayirabiri, ukubaka ibicaniro ahahurira abantu hose, wari ubaye maraya, mugabo atameze nk’abandi bamaraya kuko wewe nta n’amahera waka.<verse eid="EZK 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 16:32" />Ewe wa mugore we w’umusambanyikazi! Uhitamwo abagabo b’abanyamahanga ukabarutisha umugabo wawe bwite! <verse eid="EZK 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 16:33" />Abamaraya bose bahabwa ingabire, ariko weho uha ingabire abagusambanya, kugira ngo ubikwegereko ubakuye ahatandukanye, ngo baze mu busambanyi bwawe. <verse eid="EZK 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 16:34" />Mu bumaraya bwawe utandukanye n’abandi; nta wugukurikira akurondera. Utandukanye n’abandi kuko wewe, ni wewe uhemba abagusambanya kandi nta na kimwe wewe uhabwa.<verse eid="EZK 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 16:35" />None rero ewe maraya, niwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>! <verse eid="EZK 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 16:36" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ko wasesaguye ubutunzi bwawe, ukiyambika ubusa mu gusambana n’abo wishakiye bose, kandi kubera ubuyobe bw’ibigirwamana vyawe, hamwe n’amaraso y’abana bawe wahaye ivyo bigirwamana, <verse eid="EZK 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 16:37" />ngiye kwegeranya abo bose wikundiye, abaguha umunezero, abo wakunze n’abo wanse. Nzobegeranya bave mu mihingo yose, ndakwamburire imbere yabo bose, babone ubwambure bwawe bwose. <verse eid="EZK 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 16:38" />Nzogucira igihano c’umugore yasambanye, akongera agasesa amaraso. <verse eid="EZK 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 16:39" />Nzoheza ndaguhereze abo wikundiye, basenyagure ibibanza vyawe vyo gusengeramwo n’ibicaniro vyawe. Bazokwambura impuzu zawe, bagutware udusharizo twawe, bagusige wambaye ubusa. <verse eid="EZK 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 16:40" />Bazokwongera bazanane n’isinzi ry’abantu bagutere amabuye, bagusogote inkota. <verse eid="EZK 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 16:41" />Bazoturira inzu yawe, baguhanire imbere y’abandi bagore benshi. Ubumaraya bwawe nzobuherengeteza, kandi ntuzoba ugisubira guha impembo abakunzi bawe. <verse eid="EZK 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 16:42" />Ni ho uburake bwanje buzohwama, ishavu n’umujinya bikakuvako; maze nzotekana, sinzosubira kukurakira.<verse eid="EZK 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 16:43" />Kuko utibutse ubuto bwawe ahubwo ukandakisha ibi vyaha vyose, nzogusubiriza mu nkoko ibihwanye n’ivyaha vyawe vyose, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. Kuko kuri ivyo vyaha wongeyeko ibikorwa bigayitse.<verse eid="EZK 16:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 16:44" />Abaca imigani bose bazohora bavuga bati: Umukobwa amera nka nyina. <verse eid="EZK 16:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 16:45" />Vy’ukuri uri umukobwa yuzuye wa nyoko, agaya umugabo n’abana; kandi uri umuvukanyi wa benewanyu koko, bagaya abagabo babo n’abana babo. Nyoko yari Umuhetikazi so na we yari Umumori. <verse eid="EZK 16:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 16:46" />Mukurwawe mukuru yari Samariya, yaba mu buraruko hamwe n’abakobwa biwe; kandi murumunawe mutoya na we yaba mu bumanuko, n’abakobwa biwe, yari Sodomu. <verse eid="EZK 16:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 16:47" />Ntiwagendeye mu ngeso zabo gusa, ahubwo wakoze ibikorwa bigayitse kurusha ivyabo, uca uba mubi kubarusha kure n’iyo. <verse eid="EZK 16:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 16:48" />Ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze, mwenewanyu Sodomu n’abakobwa biwe ntibigeze bakora nk’ivyo mwe n’abakobwa bawe mwakoze.<verse eid="EZK 16:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 16:49" />Iki ni co caha ca mwenewanyu Sodomu: we n’abakobwa biwe bari buzuye ubwibone, bakarya cane; ntibitaho aboro n’abakene. <verse eid="EZK 16:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="EZK 16:50" />Barishima cane, bagakorera ibizira imbere yanje. Ni co catumye ndabakuraho nk’uko wabibonye. <verse eid="EZK 16:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="EZK 16:51" />Samariya ntiyakoze n’ica kabiri c’ivyaha wakoze. Wakoze ibizira vyinshi kubasumvya, noneho bituma benewanyu basa nk’aho ari abagororotsi kugusumvya kubera ibibi vyose wakoze. <verse eid="EZK 16:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="EZK 16:52" />Wari ukwiye kumaramara, kuko watumye benewanyu baboneka nk’aho batari bakwiye gutsindwa n’urubanza. Ivyaha vyawe vyabaye vyinshi cane gusumba ivyabo, bituma umenga ni abagororotsi kugusumvya. None rero, niwuzure ibimaramare, kuko watumye baboneka nk’abagororotsi.<verse eid="EZK 16:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="EZK 16:53" />Ariko umusi umwe nzosubiza ibintu vyabo mu buryo, ivya Sodomu n’ivy’abakobwa biwe, hamwe n’ivya Samariya n’ivy’abakobwa biwe, kandi n’ivyawe nzobisubizanya mu buryo n’ivyabo, <verse eid="EZK 16:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="EZK 16:54" />kugira ngo nawe uzogire isoni, umaramazwe no kubona benewanyu bagirirwa neza kubera ivyaha vyawe. <verse eid="EZK 16:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="EZK 16:55" />Abo muvukana, Sodomu n’abakobwa biwe hamwe na Samariya n’abakobwa biwe, bazosubira kuba nk’uko bahora kera; kandi nawe n’abakobwa bawe muzosubira kuba nk’uko mwahoze kera. <verse eid="EZK 16:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="EZK 16:56" />Mu misi y’ubwibone bwawe ntiwigera ucisha mu kanwa mwenewanyu Sodomu, <verse eid="EZK 16:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="EZK 16:57" />imbere y’uko ububi bwawe buja ahabona. Kandi n’aho biri uko, ubu ushinyagurizwa n’abakobwa ba Edomu bari kumwe n’ababanyi biwe, hamwe n’abakobwa b’Abafilisitiya. <verse eid="EZK 16:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="EZK 16:58" />Ibizira n’ivyaha vyose wakoze uzobihanirwa, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze.<verse eid="EZK 16:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="EZK 16:59" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nzogusubiriza mu nkoko ibikwiranye n’ivyo wakoze, kuko wakengereye indahiro yanje, ukava mw’isezerano nakugiriye. <verse eid="EZK 16:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="EZK 16:60" />Ariko nzokwibuka isezerano nakugiriye mu buto bwawe, nsubizeho isezerano ritazovaho. <verse eid="EZK 16:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="EZK 16:61" />Ni ho uzokwibuka ingeso zawe, wongere umaramazwe no kwakira benewanyu, mukurwawe na murumunawe. Nzobaguha nk’abakobwa bawe, ariko ivyo nta ho bihuriye n’isezerano nagiranye nawe. <verse eid="EZK 16:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="EZK 16:62" />Nuko nzokomeza isezerano ryanje nawe, maze uzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 16:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="EZK 16:63" />Ninamara kugutangira impongano y’ivyaha wakoze vyose, uzovyibuka umaramare, wifate ku munwa kubera isoni, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 16:63" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="EZK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Ibigereranyo vy’inkona n’umuzabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 17:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 17:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, sokoranya, wongere ucire umugani ab’inzu ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 17:3" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Inkona niniya, y’amababa akomeye, ifise amoya maremare, ikagira n’amubi menshi y’amabara, yaje i Libani. Ihagarara ku gatwe k’igiti c’isederi, <verse eid="EZK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 17:4" />ivuna agatwetwe k’ico giti igatwara mu gihugu c’abadandaji, igatera mu gisagara badandarizamwo.<verse eid="EZK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 17:5" />Ifata akabuto kamwe mu mbuto zo mu gihugu, igatera mw’ivu rimera. Igatera hafi y’amazi menshi, <verse eid="EZK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 17:6" />karamera, karakura, kaba umuzabibu. Amashami yawo yakura aduga yerekeza kuri ya nkona, imizi na yo igashorera mu kuzimu. Nuko kaba umuzabibu, ugira amashami, n’amababi menshi cane.<verse eid="EZK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 17:7" />Ariko hariho n’iyindi nkona nini y’amababa n’amoya akomeye cane. Maze wa muzabibu werekeza imizi yawo kuri yo, uhereye aho wari utewe, uyihindukirizako n’amashami kugira ngo iwuvomere. <verse eid="EZK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 17:8" />Wari watewe mw’ivu ryiza, i ruhande y’amazi menshi, kugira ngo uzogire amashami, wame ivyamwa, ube umuzabibu mwiza cane.’<verse eid="EZK 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 17:9" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Mbega uwo muzabibu uzobaho? Mbega ntuzorandurwa, ukamurwako ivyamwa hanyuma ukuma? Udututuje kuri wo twose tuzokwuma, kandi ntibizosaba inguvu z’abantu benshi mu kuwurandura. <verse eid="EZK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 17:10" />Niwasubira kubadikwa hoho uzonaga? Ntibishoboka, uzokwuma uherengetere umuyaga wo mu buseruko niwawuhuha. Uzokwumira muri iryo vu ryiza wakuriyemwo.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 17:11" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ambwira ijambo ati: <verse eid="EZK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 17:12" />“Bwira abo bantu b’abagarariji uti: ‘Ibi ntimuzi ico bisigura?’ Babwire uti: ‘Umwami w’i Babiloni yagiye i Yerusalemu, atwara umwami n’abatware baho, abajana i Babiloni. <verse eid="EZK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 17:13" />Maze afata umwe wo mu nda y’ingoma agirana isezerano na we, aramurahiza. Arongera kandi atwara n’abatware bo muri Isirayeli, <verse eid="EZK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 17:14" />kugira ngo ubwami bucishwe bugufi, ntibuzosubire kwivyukiranya, buze bubeshweho gusa no kuzigama iryo sezerano. <verse eid="EZK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 17:15" />Ariko Umwami aramugarariza, arungika intumwa muri Egiputa, ngo amuhe amafarasi n’ingabo nyinshi. Mbega azomunesha? Mbega uwukora nk’ivyo azocika kw’icumu? Azorenga kw’isezerano hanyuma bikunde ko arokoka?<verse eid="EZK 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 17:16" />Ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze, azogwa i Babiloni, mu gihugu c’umwami yari yamushize ku ngoma, uwo yarenze ku ndahiro yari yamurahije, agahonyanga isezerano bagiraniye. <verse eid="EZK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 17:17" />Farawo n’ingabo ziwe zikomeye, hamwe n’imikogote yiwe nta co azomumarira mu ntambara, igihe bazokwubaka ivyo kwuririrako bakugariza Yerusalemu kugira ngo batikize benshi. <verse eid="EZK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 17:18" />Kuko yakengereye indahiro yarahiye, akarenga kw’isezerano. Kubera yuko yari yamanitse ukuboko arahira, hanyuma akaba yakoze ivyo vyose, ntazorokoka.<verse eid="EZK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 17:19" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, nzomuhanira kurenga isezerano no gukengera indahiro yarahiye ku mugaragaro mw’izina ryanje. <verse eid="EZK 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 17:20" />Nzomutega umutego wanje ndamufate, mpeze ndamujane i Babiloni, ndamucirireyo urubanza kuko yancumuyeko. <verse eid="EZK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 17:21" />Abasoda biwe bose bazohunga bamarwe n’inkota, abazocika kw’icumu na bo bazoshwiragizwa n’umuyaga. Ni ho muzomenya ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari jewe nabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 17:22" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Jewe nyene ubwanje nzofata agatwetwe k’isederi ndakabadike; mbere nzoca agatwetwe ko hejuru cane koroshe, ndagatere ku mpinga y’umusozi muremure. <verse eid="EZK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 17:23" />Nzogatera ku musozi ukirurutse wo muri Isirayeli; na ko kazoshamika, kame ivyamwa, kabe igiti c’isederi giteye igomwe. Inyoni z’ubwoko bwose zizoza zicarikemwo, ziyubakire inzu mu gitutu c’amashami yaco. <verse eid="EZK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 17:24" />Ibindi biti vyose vyo mw’ishamba bizomenya ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nsubiza hasi igiti kirekire, kigufi na co nkagikuza. Ibiti biremvye ndavyumisha, ivyumye na vyo ngatuma biremba.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 17:24">Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabivuze, kandi nzobikora.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 17:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="EZK 18" />
  <para style="s1">Uwukora ivyaha ni we azopfa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 18:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 18:2" />“Mbega muri Isirayeli iyo muciye uwu mugani muti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:2">‘Abavyeyi barya inzabibu z’ibitumbwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:2">amenyo y’abana babo akaba ari yo ajigurwa,’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:2">muba mugomvye kuvuga iki?<verse eid="EZK 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 18:3" />Ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze, uwo mugani ntimugisubira kuwukoresha muri Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 18:4" />Kuko abafise ubugingo bose ni abanje, abavyeyi co kimwe n’abana, bose ni abanje. Uwucumura ni we azopfa.<verse eid="EZK 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 18:5" />Iyumvire umugororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:5">akora ibitunganye kandi bibereye.<verse eid="EZK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 18:6" />Ntarira mu bibanza basengeramwo ibigirwamana vyo ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:6">canke ngo arabe ibigirwamana vya Isirayeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:6">Ntahumanya umugore w’umubanyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:6">canke ngo aryamane n’umugore ari mu miziro yiwe.<verse eid="EZK 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 18:7" />Ntagunga abandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:7">ahubwo asubiza ingwati y’abo yari yaguranye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:7">Ntiyigera yiba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:7">ahubwo agaburira indya ziwe abashonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:7">akambika n’abagenda gusa.<verse eid="EZK 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 18:8" />Ntatanga ingurane yiteze inyungu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:8">canke akandi karusho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:8">Amaboko yiwe ayarinda gukora ikibi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:8">agaca izibereye hagati y’abatase.<verse eid="EZK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 18:9" />Akurikiza amabwirizwa yanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:9">akagendera no mu vyagezwe vyanje.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:9">Uwo muntu ni umugororotsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:9">kandi nta kabuza, azobaho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:9">ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 18:10" />Ariko aramutse avyaye umwana akaba inkozi y’ikibi, agasesa amaraso canke agakora n’ibi bibi bindi <verse eid="EZK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 18:11" />(naho se ata na kimwe yakoze muri ibi):</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:11">arira mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo ibigirwamana vyo ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:11">ahumanya umugore wa mugenziwe,<verse eid="EZK 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 18:12" />acinyiza abakene n’aboro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">yiba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">adasubiza ingwati y’abo yaguranye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">asenga ibigirwamana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:12">akora ibizira,<verse eid="EZK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 18:13" />agatanga ingurane ashaka inyungu.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:13">Mbega umuntu nk’uwo yobaho? Oya na mba! Kubera ko yakoze ibizira nk’ivyo vyose, azopfa, kandi amaraso yiwe azomuharurwako.<verse eid="EZK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 18:14" />Ariko aramutse avyaye umwana, uwo na we akabona ivyaha vyose se akora, ariko naho abibona, ntakore ibisa n’ivyo:<verse eid="EZK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 18:15" />Ntarire mu bibanza vyo gusengeramwo ibigirwamana vyo ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:15">canke ngo asenge ibigirwamana vyo mu nzu ya Isirayeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:15">Ntahumanye umugore wa mugenziwe.<verse eid="EZK 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 18:16" />Ntagunge umuntu n’umwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:16">canke ngo yake ingwati uwo aguranye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:16">Ntiyibe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:16">ahubwo akagaburira abashonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:16">akambika abagenda gusa.<verse eid="EZK 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 18:17" />Akabuza amaboko yiwe gukorera ikibi abakene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 18:17">ntagurane amahera arondera inyungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 18:17">akagendera mu vyagezwe vyanje, no mu mabwirizwa yanje.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 18:17">Uwo ntazozira ivyaha vya se; ni ivy’ukuri azobaho. <verse eid="EZK 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 18:18" />Ariko se azokwicwa n’ivyaha vyiwe, kuko yagunze abandi, akiba benewabo, agakora ibibi mu bwoko bwiwe.<verse eid="EZK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 18:19" />Ariko murabaza muti: ‘Ni kubera iki umwana atazira ivyaha vya se?’ Nimba umwana azoba yakoze ibiroranye, agashira umutima ku gukurikiza amabwirizwa yanje, nta kabuza azobaho. <verse eid="EZK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 18:20" />Uwukora ivyaha ni we azopfa. Umwana ntazozira ivyaha vya se, na se ntazozira ivyaha vy’umwana wiwe. Umugororotsi azokwezwa n’ubugororotsi bwiwe, kandi umunyakibi azoharurwako ibibi vyiwe.<verse eid="EZK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 18:21" />Ariko umunyakibi niyahindukira akava mu vyaha vyiwe vyose, agakurikiza amabwirizwa yanje yose, agakora ibitunganye n’ibigororotse, nta kabuza azobaho; ntazopfa. <verse eid="EZK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 18:22" />Ibicumuro vyose yakoze nta na kimwe kizomuharurwako. Kubera ibikorwa vyo kugororoka azoba yakoze, azobaho. <verse eid="EZK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 18:23" />Mbega mwibaza ko nezerezwa n’urupfu rw’umunyakibi? Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji abaza. Mbega sinezerezwa n’uko yova mu ngeso ziwe mbi, akabaho?<verse eid="EZK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 18:24" />Ariko noneho, umugororotsi niyava mu bugororotsi bwiwe, agakora ivy’ukugabitanya hamwe n’ibizira nk’ivyo umunyakibi akora, mbega azobaho? Ivy’ukugororoka yakoze vyose nta na kimwe kizokwibukwa, kandi azopfa azize ivyaha yakoze.<verse eid="EZK 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 18:25" />Kandi muravuga muti: ‘Inzira y’Imana ntigororotse.’ Nimunyumvirize yemwe Bisirayeli: Inzira yanje ntigororotse? Ahubwo inzira zanyu ni zo zitagororotse. <verse eid="EZK 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 18:26" />Umugororotsi niyava mu nzira ziwe agakora icaha, azokizira; azopfa azize ivyaha azoba yakoze. <verse eid="EZK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 18:27" />Ariko umunyakibi niyava mu vyaha vyiwe, agakora ibitunganye n’ibigororotse, azokiza ubugingo bwiwe. <verse eid="EZK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 18:28" />Kuko azoba yiyumviriye ku vyo yakoze, hanyuma agahitamwo kubiheba, nta kabuza azobaho; ntazopfa. <verse eid="EZK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 18:29" />Ariko Abisirayeli baravuga bati: ‘Inzira y’Imana ntigororotse.’ Mbega inzira zanje ni zo zitagororotse ga mwa Bisirayeli mwe? Inzira zanyu si zo zitagororotse?<verse eid="EZK 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 18:30" />Ni co gituma, yemwe Bisirayeli, nzobacira urubanza ruhwanye n’ingeso zanyu, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. Niwihane! Va mu vyaha vyawe vyose; ni ho ivyaha vyawe bitazoba inyanduruko yo kuranduka. <verse eid="EZK 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 18:31" />Nimute kure ibicumuro vyanyu mwakoze, muhabwe umutima musha n’impwemu nsha. Ni igiki gituma mugomba gupfa, yemwe bantu ba Isirayeli?” <verse eid="EZK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 18:32" />Sinezerezwa n’urupfu rw’umuntu n’umwe, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. Nimwihane, mubone kubaho!<verse eid="EZK 18:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="EZK 19" />
  <para style="s1">Gucura intimba ku bw’abaganwa ba Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 19:1" />Cura intimba uririre abaganwa ba Isirayeli, <verse eid="EZK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 19:2" />uvuge uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">“Nyoko yari iki?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:2">Yari intare y’ingore yibera hagati mu ntare!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:2">Yiryamira hagati muri zo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:2">ikonsa ibibuguru vyayo.<verse eid="EZK 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 19:3" />Yareze ikibuguru kimwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:3">kiba intare ikomeye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:3">Imenya guhiga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:3">ndetse irya n’abantu.<verse eid="EZK 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 19:4" />Amahanga na yo yumva ivyayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:4">maze igwa mu mutego wayo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:4">Ayikwegesha igera,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:4">ayijana mu gihugu ca Egiputa.<verse eid="EZK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 19:5" />Ya ntare y’ingore iyirindiriye ikayibura,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:5">ivyizigiro vyayo birahera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:5">Ica ifata ikindi kibuguru cayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:5">irakirera ikigira intare ikomeye.<verse eid="EZK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 19:6" />Yagendana n’izindi ntare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:6">maze iba umukangara w’intare ikomeye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:6">Nuko imenya guhiga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:6">ndetse itangura no kurya abantu.<verse eid="EZK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 19:7" />Iyo ntare isenyagura ibirimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:7">itikiza n’ibisagara vyaho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:7">Imirima icika ibisanze, ibiterwa biratikira.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:7">Ababa muri ivyo bihugu bose baterwa ubwoba n’ukuroha kwayo.<verse eid="EZK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 19:8" />Ayo mahanga aza kuyigwanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:8">aturutse impande zose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:8">Bayitega urusenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:8">igwa mu mutego wabo.<verse eid="EZK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 19:9" />Bayikwegesha igera bayugaranira mu kazu gatoya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">bayishira umwami w’i Babiloni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:9">Bayishira mw’ibohero,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">ugutontoma kwayo ntikwaba kucumvikana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:9">ku misozi ya Isirayeli.<verse eid="EZK 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 19:10" />Nyoko yari ameze nk’umuzabibu uri mw’itongo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:10">watewe i ruhande y’amazi menshi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:10">warama kandi wari wuzuyeko amashami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:10">kuko waronka amazi akwiye.<verse eid="EZK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 19:11" />Amashami yawo yari akomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">yari abereye kuvamwo inkoni z’abarongozi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Urakura uba muremure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">ushika hejuru y’ibindi biti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:11">Waraboneka gusumba ibindi kuko wari muremure,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:11">ukagira n’amashami menshi.<verse eid="EZK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 19:12" />Ariko waranduranywe uburake,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">utererwa i musozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">umuyaga wo mu buseruko urawumisha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">uhungurura ivyamwa vyawo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:12">amashami yawo aruma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:12">umuriro na wo urayatongora.<verse eid="EZK 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 19:13" />None ubu uwo muzabibu utewe mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:13">mu gihugu kitagira amazi.<verse eid="EZK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 19:14" />Maze umuriro uturuka muri ya mashami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:14">utongora ivyamwa vyawo vyose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 19:14">Nta mashami akomeye yovamwo inkoni z’abami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 19:14">yasigaye kuri wo.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 19:14">Ukwo ni kwo gucura intimba, gukoreshwa igihe cakwo.”<verse eid="EZK 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="EZK 20" />
  <para style="s1">Ubugarariji bwa Isirayeli buhanwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 20:1" />Mu mwaka ugira indwi, mu kwezi kwa gatanu, ku musi w’icumi, bamwe mu batware ba Isirayeli baza gusiguza <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bicara imbere yanje.<verse eid="EZK 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 20:2" />Maze Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 20:3" />“Mwana w’umuntu, bwira abatware ba Isirayeli, uti: ‘<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji arabaza ati: Vy’ukuri mwaje kugira ngo munsiguze? Ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, sindabemerera ko mugira ico munsiguza, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.’<verse eid="EZK 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 20:4" />Nta rubanza ubacira? Nta rubanza ubacira ga mwana w’umuntu? Bagirize na birya bizira ba sekuruza bakoze, <verse eid="EZK 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 20:5" />maze ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Umusi nahitamwo Isirayeli, narahiye ab’inzu ya Yakobo manitse ukuboko, ndabihishurira bari muri Egiputa. Manitse ukuboko ndababwira nti: Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu. <verse eid="EZK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 20:6" />Kuri uwo musi ni ho nabarahira ko nzobakura muri Egiputa, nkabajana mu gihugu nabateguriye, igihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki, igihugu gisumvya ibindi vyose kuba ciza. <verse eid="EZK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 20:7" />Maze ndababwira nti: Umwe wese muri mwebwe nate kure ibishushanyo yahora ahanze amaso, kandi mureke kwihumanisha ibigirwamana vyo muri Egiputa, kuko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="EZK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 20:8" />Ariko barangararije banka kunyumvira. Ntibataye ibishushanyo bari bahanze amaso, canke ngo bahebe ibigirwamana vyo muri Egiputa. Ni ho naca mvuga ko nzobasukako uburake bwanje, nkabimarirako ishavu bakiri muri Egiputa. <verse eid="EZK 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 20:9" />Ariko sinabikoze, kuko nashaka gukingira izina ryanje kugira ngo ntiritukirwe mu maso y’amahanga babamwo; kuko yari yarambonye niyerekana mu gukura Abisirayeli muri Egiputa. <verse eid="EZK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 20:10" />Ni ho nabakura muri Egiputa, nkabatwara mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 20:11" />Ni ho nabahereye amategeko yanje, ndabamenyesha n’ivyagezwe vyanje, ndababwira ko uwuzoyakurikiza azobaho. <verse eid="EZK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 20:12" />Nongera ndabaha Isabato yanje nk’ikimenyetso hagati yanje na bo, kugira ngo bamenye ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari jewe ndabeza.<verse eid="EZK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 20:13" />Ariko abantu ba Isirayeli barangarariza mu bugaragwa, ntibakurikiza amategeko yanje, bava mu vyagezwe vyanje, kandi uwari kubikurikiza vyari gutuma abaho, bahumanya amasabato yanje. Maze ndavuga nti nzobasukako uburake bwanje, ndabatikirize mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 20:14" />Ariko, ku bw’izina ryanje, nakoze ivyatuma ridatukirwa mu maso y’amahanga, amwe yambona nkura Abisirayeli muri Egiputa. <verse eid="EZK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 20:15" />Maze nca ndongera manika ukuboko, ndabarahirira mu bugaragwa ko ntazobashikana mu gihugu c’isezerano ngo ndakibegurire, igihugu gitemba amata n’ubuki, igihugu gisumvya ibindi kuba ciza. <verse eid="EZK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 20:16" />Ivyo nabibabwiye kuko bari bataye ivyagezwe, bakanka gukurikiza amabwirizwa yanje, bagahumanya n’amasabato yanje. Imitima yabo bari bayeguriye ibigirwamana vyabo. <verse eid="EZK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 20:17" />Ariko ndabagirira impuhwe, sinabarandura canke ngo ndabaherengetereze mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 20:18" />Nabwiriye abana babo mu bugaragwa nti: Ntimuzokurikize amabwirizwa ya ba so, canke ngo mugendere mu vyagezwe vyabo, canke ngo mwihumanishe ibigirwamana vyabo. <verse eid="EZK 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 20:19" />Ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu; nimukurikize amabwirizwa yanje, mushire imitima yanyu mu vyagezwe vyanje. <verse eid="EZK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 20:20" />Mweze Isabato yanje, kuko izoba ikimenyetso hagati yanje na mwe, kibibutsa ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yanyu.<verse eid="EZK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 20:21" />Ariko abo bana na bo nyene barangarariza: Banka gukurikiza amabwirizwa yanje, ntibashira imitima yabo ku mabwirizwa yanje, n’aho uwari kuyakurikiza ari yo yari gutuma abaho, bongera bahumanya Amasabato yanje. Ni ho navuga ko nzobasukako uburake bwanje, nkabimarirako ishavu mu bugaragwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 20:22" />Ariko narisubiyeko kubera nanka ko izina ryanje ritukwa n’amahanga yambonye ndabakura muri Egiputa. <verse eid="EZK 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 20:23" />Nongera manika ukuboko ndarahira ko nzobasabagiriza mu mahanga, nkabashwiragiza mu bihugu, <verse eid="EZK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 20:24" />kuko batakurikije amabwirizwa yanje, bakava mu vyagezwe vyanje, bagahumanya Amasabato yanje, amaso yabo bakayahanga ibigirwamana vya ba se. <verse eid="EZK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 20:25" />Nuko ndabaha amabwirizwa atari meza, n’ivyagezwe bitobabeshaho, <verse eid="EZK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 20:26" />ndabareka bihumanisha ingabire nabahaye, ndabareka bashikanira imana zabo ibimazi vy’abana babo b’imfura, kugira ngo ndabateze agahinda, bamenye ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’<verse eid="EZK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 20:27" />None rero mwana w’umuntu, bwira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ba sogokuruza barantutse mu kunta; <verse eid="EZK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 20:28" />kuko igihe nabashikana mu gihugu nari nararahiye ko nzobaha, bashikanye ibimazi, baturirira ibimota neza mu bibanza basengeramwo ibigirwamana vyo ku misozi yose miremire, no musi y’ibiti vyose bitotahaye. Ni ho batangiye ibimazi vyo gukabura ishavu ryanje. Ni ho bashikaniye amashikanwa y’ibiturirwa bikamota neza, n’ibinyobwa. <verse eid="EZK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 20:29" />Maze ndababaza nti: Ivyo bibanza vyo ku misozi mwama mujamwo ni ibiki?’ ” Gushika n’ubu biracitwa ibibanza vyo mu mataba y’imisozi.<verse eid="EZK 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubugarariji bwa Isirayeli buzokurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 20:30" />“None rero bwira inzu ya Isirayeli, uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Muzogeza ryari kwihumanisha ibishushanyo nk’uko ba sogokuruza banyu bavyihumanishije, mugasambana n’ibizira vy’ibigirwamana vyabo? <verse eid="EZK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 20:31" />Kuko iyo mubishikaniye ingabire nabahaye, mu gutanga abana banyu b’imfura ku gicaniro, muba muriko murihumanisha ibigirwamana vyanyu gushika n’ubu. None mwumva noshobora nte kubareka ngo mugire ico munsiguje, yemwe Bisirayeli? Ndabarahiye ukubaho kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze, sinzobareka ngo munsiguze ikintu na kimwe.<verse eid="EZK 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 20:32" />Muravuga muti: Tugomba kumera nk’ayandi mahanga n’ayandi moko yo kw’isi, asenga ibiti n’amabuye.’ Ariko ivyo mwiyumvira ntibizoshika. <verse eid="EZK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 20:33" />Ndabarahiye ukubaho kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze, nzobaganzisha ukuboko kw’inkomezi, ndabaramvurireko ukuboko kwanje, ndabasukeko uburake bwanje. <verse eid="EZK 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 20:34" />Nzobegeranya ndabakure mu mahanga no mu bihugu nabashwiragirijemwo, ndabazanishije ukuboko gukomeye, ukuboko kuramvuye, mu gusuka uburake bwanje. <verse eid="EZK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 20:35" />Nzobatwara mu bugaragwa mbakuye muri ayo mahanga, abe ari ho ndabahanira imbonankubone. <verse eid="EZK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 20:36" />Nk’uko nahaniye ba sogokuruza banyu mu bugaragwa bwo mu gihugu ca Egiputa, ni ko namwe nzobahana, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 20:37" />Nzobacisha musi y’inkoni yanje, maze ndabarongorere mw’isezerano ryanje. <verse eid="EZK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 20:38" />Nzobakuramwo abangarariza bose bakancumurako. Naho nzobakura mu bihugu bajanywemwo nk’inyagano, ntibazokwinjira mu gihugu ca Isirayeli. Ni ho muzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 20:39" />Ariko mwebwe bantu ba Isirayeli, uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndababwiye: Umuntu wese muri mwebwe nagende akorere ikigirwamana ciwe! Ariko muzoteba munyumvirize, kandi izina ryanje ntimuzosubira kuritukishisha amashikanwa yanyu n’ibigirwamana vyanyu. <verse eid="EZK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 20:40" />Kuko ku musozi wanje wera, ni wo musozi muremure wa Isirayeli, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze, muri ico gihugu, ni ho ab’inzu ya Isirayeli bose bazonsengera, kandi nanje nzobemera. Ni ho muzonshikanira amashikanwa yanyu atoranijwe, hamwe n’ibimazi vyanyu vyejejwe. <verse eid="EZK 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 20:41" />Nzobakira nk’ibiturirwa bikamota neza, ninabakura mu yandi mahanga, nkabegeranya muvuye mu bihugu mwasanzariyemwo, kandi nzobereka ukwera kwanje imbere y’amahanga. <verse eid="EZK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 20:42" />Ni ho muzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ninabashikana mu gihugu ca Isirayeli, igihugu narahiye manitse ukuboko ko nzoha ba sogokuruza. <verse eid="EZK 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 20:43" />Ni ho muzokwibuka ingeso zanyu n’ibikorwa mwihumanishije. Muzokwizinukwa ku bw’ibibi vyose mwakoze. <verse eid="EZK 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 20:44" />Muzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ninabikora uko kubera izina ryanje, ntaravye ingeso zanyu mbi n’ibikorwa vyanyu bihumanye, yemwe Bisirayeli, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.”<verse eid="EZK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ivyavugishijwe kuri Negebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 20:45" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 20:46" />“Mwana w’umuntu, raba mu bumanuko, vuga ubutumwa uburire abari mu bumanuko kandi uvugishwe uburire ikibira co mu bumanuko. <verse eid="EZK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 20:47" />Ubwire ishamba ryo mu bumanuko uti: ‘Niwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ngiye kuguturira, kandi nzotongora ibiti vyawe vyose, ibitotahaye n’ivyumye. Imbeya zawo ntizizozima, kandi ikintu cose uhereye mu bumanuko ukageza mu buraruko kizobabuka. <verse eid="EZK 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 20:48" />Abantu bose bazobona ko ari jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nawudometse, kuko ntuzigera uzima.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 20:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 20:49" />Maze ndavuga nti: “Ewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, erega bazovuga bati: ‘Mbega uwu avuga mu migani gusa?’ ”<verse eid="EZK 20:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="EZK 21" />
  <para style="s1">Imana izokoresha Babiloni nk’inkota y’urubanza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 21:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 21:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, hanga amaso yawe Yerusalemu, uvugishwe werekeza ku rusengero, hamwe n’igihugu ca Isirayeli, <verse eid="EZK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 21:3" />uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuze: Ehe ngiye kukugwanya. Nzokura inkota yanje mu rwubati ndandure abanyakibi n’abagororotsi bose hamwe. <verse eid="EZK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 21:4" />Ko nzokwica abanyakibi n’abagororotsi, inkota yanje izova mu rwubati, izokwica idasize n’umwe uhereye mu bumanuko ugashitsa mu buraruko. <verse eid="EZK 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 21:5" />Maze abantu bose bazomenya ko ari jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nakuye inkota mu rwubati; kandi sinzoyisubizayo itarangije igikorwa.’<verse eid="EZK 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 21:6" />None rero, mwana w’umuntu, boroga! Borogera imbere yabo, wuzuye intimba n’agahinda. <verse eid="EZK 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 21:7" />Nibakubaza bati: ‘Ni kubera iki uboroga?’ Ubishure uti: ‘Ni kubera inkuru numvise z’ibigiye gushika. Umutima wose uzoshongeshwa n’ubwoba, n’amaboko yose adendebukirwe; imitima izocika ivutu, amavi yose azoregarega, acike amazi. Bigiye kuza! Nta kabuza bizoshika, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 21:8" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 21:9" />“Mwana w’umuntu, vugishwa, uvuge uti: ‘Uku ni ko Imana ivuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:9">Inkota, inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:9">ikarishe cane kandi ikayangana,<verse eid="EZK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 21:10" />yakarihirijwe gusogota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:10">ihanagurwa ngo ice ibibatsi nk’imiravyo!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 21:10">Mbega hari uwotwenga? N’ababasumvya inkomezi barahindikiranye musi y’ububasha bwayo.<verse eid="EZK 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 21:11" />Inkota yateguwe ngo ihanagurwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:11">ishirwe mu kuboko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:11">iriko irakarishwa yongera ihanagurwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:11">ngo ishirwe mu kuboko kw’uwuririka.<verse eid="EZK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 21:12" />Mwana w’umuntu, koma induru uboroge;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">kuko iteguriwe abantu banje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">n’abaganwa bose ba Isirayeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:12">Bashitsweko n’inkota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">bari kumwe n’abantu banje.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:12">None rero niwikubite mu gikiriza.<verse eid="EZK 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 21:13" />Ico gipimo ntikizobura kuza. Ariko bizomera gute kuri iyo nkoni y’ubwami, inkota niyayikengera, maze ikayibuza kubandanya? Ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji abaza.<verse eid="EZK 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 21:14" />None rero mwana w’umuntu, vugishwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">ukubita amashi ku yandi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">Reka iyo nkota ikubite kabiri,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">ndetse na gatatu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:14">Ni inkota yo gusogota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">kandi ni iyo kuririka cane,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:14">ibakikuje impande zose.<verse eid="EZK 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 21:15" />Imitima yabo nishongeshwe n’ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:15">n’abahindikirana babe benshi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:15">Nayiteguriye gutikiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:15">kandi iri ku marembo yabo yose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:15">Raba! Yakozwe ngo ikubite kurya kw’umuravyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:15">yakiriwe ngo itikize.<verse eid="EZK 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 21:16" />Wa nkota we, rabagiza i buryo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:16">hanyuma ubangurirwe i bubamfu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:16">uhindukirire iyo ubugi bwawe buraba hose.<verse eid="EZK 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 21:17" />Nanje nzokubita amashi ku yandi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:17">ishavu ryanje rigabanuke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:17">ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 21:18" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> antumako ijambo ati: <verse eid="EZK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 21:19" />Mwana w’umuntu, shiraho inzira zibiri, izo inkota y’umwami w’i Babiloni izocamwo. Ushire ikimenyetso ku nzira izanana mu gisagara c’i Babiloni, aho yigaburiramwo kabiri. <verse eid="EZK 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 21:20" />Ushire ikimenyetso ku nzira inkota izocamwo, kimwe ku nzira ija i Raba h’Abamoni, ikindi ku yija i Buyuda mu gisagara kizitiye ari co Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 21:21" />Kuko umwami w’i Babiloni azohagarara ku mayirabiri, aho izo nzira zompi zishamikira, kugira ngo araguze. Azozungagiza imyampi, abaze ibigirwamana, asuzume ibitigu vy’ibikoko vyatanzweko ibimazi. <verse eid="EZK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 21:22" />Maze ikigirwamana kiri i buryo kimwereke Yerusalemu, amarembo yaho azoyasenyaguze ibiti bininibinini, atange itegeko ryo gutikiza, bakome akaruru k’intambara, bubake ibigigira vyo gutera amarembo, arunde ibirundo vy’ivu vyo kwuririrako, ahakikuze kugira ngo ahatere. <verse eid="EZK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 21:23" />Ariko ab’i Yerusalemu bazobifata nk’aho ari indagu y’ikinyoma, kuko bafise isezerano bagiranye na Babiloni. Ariko umwami w’i Babiloni we azobibutsa ivyaha vyabo, aheze abatere, abatware nk’inyagano.<verse eid="EZK 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 21:24" />None rero uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: “Kubera yuko, mwatumye ivyaha vyanyu vyibukwa mu kwerekana ubugarariji bwanyu, mukagaragaza ivyaha mu vyo mukora vyose, ni co gitumye mutwarwa nk’inyagano.<verse eid="EZK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 21:25" />Nawe wa munyakibi we, wa muganwa wa Isirayeli, washikiwe n’umusi mubi, igihe co guhanwa kwawe kigiye cashika, <verse eid="EZK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 21:26" />ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: ‘Ikureko umwitwikiro, wambure n’urugori rw’ubwami. Ntibizosubira kuba uko vyahoze: abaciye bugufi bazoshirwa hejuru, abashizwe hejuru na bo bazocishwa bugufi. <verse eid="EZK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 21:27" />Umusaka! Umusaka! Nta kabuza nzohahindura umusaka! Urugori rw’ubwami ntiruzosubira kwambarwa, gushika aho nyenerwo azozira, uwo ni we nzoruha.’<verse eid="EZK 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 21:28" />Nawe mwana w’umuntu, vugishwa uvuge uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji abwiye Abamoni, ku bw’ibitutsi vyabo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">Inkota, inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:28">isokowe ngo isogote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:28">Ihanaguwe ngo itikize,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:28">ikayangana nk’umuravyo!<verse eid="EZK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 21:29" />Naho mufise indoto zibesha zivuga ibiberekeye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:29">n’indagu z’ibinyoma babaraguriye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:29">izoshirwa ku mazosi yanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:29">abanyakibi bategerezwa gusogotwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:29">abo igihe cabo cashitse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:29">kandi abo igihe cabo co guhanwa cabaye ntarengwa.<verse eid="EZK 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 21:30" />Ubu subiza inkota mu rwubati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:30">kuko mu kibanza waremewemwo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:30">mu gihugu ca ba sekuruza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:30">ni ho nzogucira urubanza.<verse eid="EZK 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 21:31" />Nzogusukako uburake bwanje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:31">ndakwimarireko ishavu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:31">Nzokurekurira mu maboko y’inkozi z’ikibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:31">bamenyereye kwica rubi.<verse eid="EZK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 21:32" />Uzoba ibitoro vyo gucanwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:32">amaraso yawe aseseke mu gihugu cawe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 21:32">Ntuzosubira kwibukwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 21:32">ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 21:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="EZK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu hazohanirwa ivyaha vyaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 22:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti:<verse eid="EZK 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 22:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, uriteguye guca urubanza? Uriteguye gucira urubanza iki gisagara gisesa amaraso? Nuko nucagirize ibizira bakora, <verse eid="EZK 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 22:3" />ukibwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Yewe wa gisagara cikwegera guhona mu gusesa amaraso muri co, no mu kwihumanisha ibigirwamana, <verse eid="EZK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 22:4" />amaraso washeshe atumye uba uwo gutsindwa n’urubanza, kandi uhumanijwe n’ibigirwamana wibaziye. Utumye imisi yawe yo gutikizwa ikwegereza, kandi ushitse ku mpera y’imyaka yawe. Ni co gituma nzoguhindura igitutsi ku banyamahanga, n’agatwengo ku bindi bihugu vyose. <verse eid="EZK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 22:5" />Abari hafi n’abari kure bazogushinyaguriza, kuko wagize izina ribi, wuzuyemwo umuryano.<verse eid="EZK 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 22:6" />Raba ingene umuganwa wese ari muri Isirayeli akoresha igitugu ciwe mu gusesa amaraso. <verse eid="EZK 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 22:7" />Abakubamwo basuzugura ba se na ba nyina; bacinyiza ba kavantara, bakagirira nabi impfuvyi n’abapfakazi. <verse eid="EZK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 22:8" />Wasuzuguye ivyera vyanje, umpumaniriza amasabato. <verse eid="EZK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 22:9" />Muri wewe hari abadodobereza abandi bakicwa; muri wewe hari abagirira imisi mikuru mu mataba y’imisozi, bagakorerayo ibiteye isoni. <verse eid="EZK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 22:10" />Muri wewe hari abasambanya abagore ba ba se; muri wewe hari abafata abagore ku nguvu bari mu miziro yabo. <verse eid="EZK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 22:11" />Muri wewe, umugabo akora ibizira n’umugore w’umubanyi wiwe, uwundi agakora ibizira n’umukazana wiwe, uwundi na we agahumanya mushikiwe, uwo basangiye se. <verse eid="EZK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 22:12" />Muri wewe, abantu bakira ibiturire kugira ngo basese amaraso, bakaka inyungu ku ngurane, kandi bakaka inyungu z’umurengera. Ikirengeye ivyo, mwarantaye, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 22:13" />Ehe nzokubita amashi ku yandi ku bw’inyungu z’umurengera watse no ku bw’amaraso washeshe muri wewe. <verse eid="EZK 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 22:14" />Mbega umutima wawe uzoshobora kwihangana canke amaboko yawe areme ku musi nzoguhanirako? Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabivuze, kandi nzobikora. <verse eid="EZK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 22:15" />Nzobashwiragiza mu mahanga, ndabasanzaze mu bihugu vyose; kandi nzokuraho ubuhumane bwanyu. <verse eid="EZK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 22:16" />Niwamara kuboneka uhumanye imbere y’ayandi mahanga, uzomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 22:17" />Maze Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 22:18" />“Mwana w’umuntu, ab’inzu ya Isirayeli bose bambereye nk’imyanda iva kw’ifeza. Bameze nk’imyanda iva ku butare bwitwa umujumbu, tini, icuma, irya myanda isigara iyo ubwo butare buciye mw’itanure. <verse eid="EZK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 22:19" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Kubera yuko mwese mwahindutse nk’imyanda iva ku butare, nzobegeraniriza i Yerusalemu. <verse eid="EZK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 22:20" />Nk’uko umuntu yegeraniriza ifeza, umujumbu, icuma, umuringa na tini, mw’itanure ngo bishongeshwe n’umuriro, ni ko nzobegeranya mu burake n’ubushangashirwe bwanje, ndabashire mu gisagara hagati mushongereyo. <verse eid="EZK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 22:21" />Nzobegeranirizayo ndabahuhishe uburake bwanje, mushongereyo. <verse eid="EZK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 22:22" />Nk’uko ifeza ishongera mw’itanure, ni ko namwe muzoshongera muri Yerusalemu, ni ho muzomenya ko ari jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nabasutseko uburake bwanje.”<verse eid="EZK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 22:23" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 22:24" />“Mwana w’umuntu, barira Isirayeli uti: ‘Uri igihugu gihumanye, kitazoronka imvura canke urume ku musi w’uburake bwanje.’ <verse eid="EZK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 22:25" />Abaganwa baco bakigiriyemwo inama z’ubugarariji, nk’intare itontoma itabagura ico yafashe; bica abantu ata co bazira, bakanyaga ubutunzi bwabo, bagapfakaza benshi bo muri co. <verse eid="EZK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 22:26" />Abaherezi baho barenze ku vyagezwe vyanje, bahumanya ivyera vyanje; ntibatandukanya ivyejejwe n’ibitejejwe; bigisha ko ata tandukaniro hagati y’ibihumanye n’ivyejejwe; birengagije amasabato yanje, maze izina ryanje risuzugurirwa muri bo. <verse eid="EZK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 22:27" />Abatware baho bameze nk’amabingira atabagura ico yafashe; barasheshe amaraso, bica abantu kugira ngo bashike ku nyungu mbi. <verse eid="EZK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 22:28" />Abavugishwa baho ivyo bikorwa bibi babisiga irangi ryera mu kuvugishwa ibinyoma n’indagu z’ububeshi. Bavuga bati: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze,’ kandi Uhoraho ata na kimwe yababwiye. <verse eid="EZK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 22:29" />Abo muri ico gihugu bahahaza abandi, bakabambura utwabo; bahahaza aboro n’abakene, bakarenganya ba kavantara, bakanka kubacira imanza ziroranye.<verse eid="EZK 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 22:30" />Kandi nararondeye muri bo umuntu n’umwe yosanasana uruzitiro rw’ubugororotsi, agahagarara imbere yanje ngo azibire igihengeri, agasengera igihugu ngo sindagitikize, ariko nta n’umwe naronse. <verse eid="EZK 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 22:31" />Ni co gituma nzogisukako ishavu, ndagitongoze umuriro w’uburake bwanje, ndabashitseko igihano c’ivyaha vyabo, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.”<verse eid="EZK 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="EZK 23" />
  <para style="s1">Ba maraya bavukana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 23:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 23:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, habaye abagore babiri bavukana. <verse eid="EZK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 23:3" />Bompi baba ba maraya muri Egiputa, batangura ubwo bumaraya bakiri bato. Aho ni ho amabere yabo batanguriye kuyakorakora, amabere y’ubusugi bwabo agakandakandwa. <verse eid="EZK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 23:4" />Mukuru yitwa Ohola, murumunawe yitwa Oholiba. Bose bari abanje, kandi baravyaye abahungu n’abakobwa. Ohola ni Samariya, Oholiba na we ni Yerusalemu.<verse eid="EZK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 23:5" />Ohola yagiye kuba maraya yari uwanje; ariko araheza agira abo yikundiye, ari bo banyentambara b’Abashuri. <verse eid="EZK 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 23:6" />Bari bambaye imyambaro isa n’ubururu, bari abatware n’abakuru b’ingabo, imisore iteye igomwe, bagendera ku mafarasi. <verse eid="EZK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 23:7" />Nuko ahurumbira kuba maraya w’abahizi bo muri Ashuri, yihumanisha ibigirwamana vy’uwo wese yipfuje. <verse eid="EZK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 23:8" />Ntiyigeze aheba ubumaraya bwiwe yatanguriye muri Egiputa, aho yahereye mu buto bwiwe asambana n’abagabo, bagakorakora ubusugi bwiwe, bakamwimarirako inyota yabo yose y’ubusambanyi.<verse eid="EZK 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 23:9" />Ni co catumye ndamurekurira mu maboko y’abo yikundiye ari bo Bashuri, bari baramutwaye umutima. <verse eid="EZK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 23:10" />Baramwambuye bamusiga amenya, bamutwara abana, maze bamwicisha inkota. Maze ahinduka agatwengo mu bandi bagore bose kubera igihano yahawe.<verse eid="EZK 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 23:11" />Ivyo murumunawe Oholiba yarabibona, ariko we arushiriza kuba umusambanyi, ingeso ziwe zirononekara gusumba iza mukuruwe. <verse eid="EZK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 23:12" />Na we nyene yakunze Abashuri: abatware, abakuru b’ingabo, abasoda bambaye neza, bagendera ku mafarasi, ndetse n’iyindi misore myiza yose. <verse eid="EZK 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 23:13" />Maze mbona ko na we yihumanije, ko yatwawe n’ingeso za mukuruwe.<verse eid="EZK 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 23:14" />Ariko Oholiba wewe yararengeje urugero muri ubwo bumaraya bwiwe, kuko yabonye ku mpome ibishushanyo vy’abagabo b’Abakaludaya, basize ibara ritukura, <verse eid="EZK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 23:15" />bakenyeje imikanda mu rukenyerero, n’ibitambara ku mitwe yabo; bose basa n’abakuru b’ingabo z’i Babiloni mu Bukaludaya bagendera ku mafarasi, imvukira z’i Babiloni. <verse eid="EZK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 23:16" />Akibakubise ijisho, arabipfuza, aca abatumako intumwa mu Bukaludaya. <verse eid="EZK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 23:17" />Maze Abanyababiloni baza aho ari, basambana na we, bamuhumanisha ubusambanyi bwabo. Ariko amaze guhumanywa na bo, arabazinukwa. <verse eid="EZK 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 23:18" />Igihe yakora ubwo bumaraya bwiwe ku mugaragaro, akagaragaza ubwambure bwiwe, naramuzinutswe nk’uko nari nazinutswe mukuruwe. <verse eid="EZK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 23:19" />Ariko akomeza kugwiza ubusambanyi bwiwe, yibuka imyaka y’ubuto bwiwe, igihe yari maraya muri Egiputa. <verse eid="EZK 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 23:20" />Hariya yikurikiriye abamusambanya, bari bafise ibitsina nk’ivy’indogoba, bagashuha nk’ifarasi. <verse eid="EZK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 23:21" />Ewe Oholiba, uko ni ko wiyibukije ubusambanyi bwo mu buto bwawe ukiri muri Egiputa, igihe igikiriza cawe bagikorakora, amabere yawe agakandakandwa.<verse eid="EZK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 23:22" />None rero ewe Oholiba, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: ‘Ehe ngiye kukurekurirako barya wikundiye, hanyuma ukabazinukwa, bagutere baturutse impande zose. <verse eid="EZK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 23:23" />Abanyababiloni hamwe n’Abakaludaya bose bazozanana, abagabo b’i Pekodi, i Showa n’i Kowa hamwe n’Abashuri bose bazozanana na bo, imisore myizamyiza, irimwo abatware, abakuru b’ingabo, abagendera ku mafarasi, hamwe n’abashizwe hejuru, bose baze ku mafarasi. <verse eid="EZK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 23:24" />Bazogutera bitwaje ibigwanisho, imikogote, hamwe n’abasoda benshi. Bazogukikuza impande zose, bitwaje inkinzo nininini na ntonto, bambaye n’inkofero z’ivyuma. Nzokurekurira mu maboko yabo baguhane, kandi baguhane bakurikije amategeko yabo. <verse eid="EZK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 23:25" />Nzokurekurirako ishari ryanje, maze na bo bazoguhanana uburake. Bazoguca izuru n’amatwi, kandi amasigarira azomarwa n’inkota. Abahungu n’abakobwa bawe bazotwarwa nk’inyagano, abazosigara na bo bazotongorwa n’umuriro. <verse eid="EZK 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 23:26" />Bazokwambura ivyambarwa vyawe, bagutware udusharizo twose. <verse eid="EZK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 23:27" />Ukwo ni ko nzoshira iherezo ku bumaraya bwawe buteye isoni watanguriye muri Egiputa. Ivyo ntuzosubira kubiraba, canke ngo umutima wawe wipfuze kwibuka ivyo muri Egiputa.<verse eid="EZK 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 23:28" />Kuko uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ngira ndakurekurire mu minwe y’abo wanka, abo wazinutswe. <verse eid="EZK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 23:29" />Bazoguhanana urwanko rwinshi, bagutware ivyo wabiriye akuya. Bazokwambura bagusige uri gusa, n’isoni z’ubumaraya bwawe zizoshirwa ahabona. Ubusambanyi bwawe buteye isoni <verse eid="EZK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 23:30" />ni bwo bugukwegeye ivyo, kuko wasambanye n’ayandi mahanga, wihumanisha ibigirwamana vyayo. <verse eid="EZK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 23:31" />Wagendeye mu ngeso za mukurwawe, none nzoguhanisha ivyago vyamuranduye.<verse eid="EZK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 23:32" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">Uzonywera ku gikombe ca mukurwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:32">igikombe cagutse kandi kinini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 23:32">nzotuma bagucokora kandi bagutwenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:32">kuko igikombe cawe cuzuye.<verse eid="EZK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 23:33" />Uzokwuzura akaborerwe n’imibabaro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:33">igikombe c’ukurandurwa n’ukuba akahebwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:33">ni co gikombe ca mukurwawe Samariya.<verse eid="EZK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 23:34" />Uzokinywa uciranguze;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:34">uzokimenagura ugihekenya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 23:34">hanyuma witabagure igikiriza kubera umubabaro.</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 23:34">Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 23:35" />Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuga ati: Ko wanyibagiye ukampa umugongo, utegerezwa kwemera ingaruka z’ubusambanyi bwawe buteye isoni.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 23:36" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yongera arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, cira urubanza Ohola na Oholiba. Bamenyeshe ibizira bakora, <verse eid="EZK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 23:37" />kuko babaye abasambanyi, kandi bakaba bafise amaraso ku maboko yabo. Basambanye n’ibigirwamana vyabo; babishikanira ibimazi vy’abana babo, abo bari bamvyariye, babahindura ivyokurya vyabo. <verse eid="EZK 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 23:38" />Ikindi bankoreye ni iki: bahumanije Ingoro yanje, amasabato yanje ntibayaziririza. <verse eid="EZK 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 23:39" />Umusi batanga ibimazi vy’abana babo ni ho binjira mu Ngoro yanje gusenga. Ng’uko uko bahumanije Ingoro yanje.<verse eid="EZK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 23:40" />Batumyeko n’abagabo ba kure cane, na bo baraza. Bababonye baca bariyuhagira, barituganya mu maso, barashaza. <verse eid="EZK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 23:41" />Baca bicara ku buriri bwiza cane, batunganya n’imeza imbere yabo, babatega ibiturirwa bikamota neza n’amavuta ya elayo, kandi vyari ivyanje.<verse eid="EZK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 23:42" />Inzu zabo zamamwo urwamo rw’abagabo benshi, imborerwa, abo batumyeko bakava mu bice bitandukanye vy’ubugaragwa, bambitse ibikomo abo bagore ku maboko babambika n’ingori nziza cane ku mitwe. <verse eid="EZK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 23:43" />Maze ndavuga ivy’uwo yabaye akaheze kubera ubusambanyi nti: ‘Nibamukoreshe ubumaraya kuko asanzwe ari we. <verse eid="EZK 23:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 23:44" />Nuko basambana na we. Nk’uko abagabo basambana na ba maraya, ni ko basambanye n’abo bagore babiri, Ohola na Oholiba. <verse eid="EZK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 23:45" />Ariko abagabo b’abagororotsi bazobacira urubanza, bahane abo bagore basambana bagasesa amaraso, kuko ni abasambanyi, kandi ibiganza vyabo vyuzuyeko amaraso.<verse eid="EZK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 23:46" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nimuhagurutse igitero kuri bo, bacike ivutu, kandi mubasahure ivyabo. <verse eid="EZK 23:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 23:47" />Ico gitero kibatere amabuye, congere kibatemaguze inkota; baze bice abahungu n’abakobwa babo, baturire n’amazu yabo.<verse eid="EZK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 23:48" />Uko ni ko nzoherengeteza ibiterasoni vyo muri iki gihugu, kugira ngo mburire abandi bagore bose ntihagire uwuzokwigana ingeso zanyu. <verse eid="EZK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 23:49" />Muzosubirizwa mu nkoko ibikwiranye n’ivyaha vy’ugusenga ibigirwamana mwakoze. Ni ho muzomenyera ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 23:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="EZK 24" />
  <para style="s1">Yerusalemu hagereranywa n’inkono iteka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 24:1" />Mu mwaka ugira icenda, mu kwezi kw’icumi, ku musi w’icumi, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 24:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, wandike iyi tariki ahantu, kuko umwami wa Babiloni ateye Yerusalemu uwu musi nyene. <verse eid="EZK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 24:3" />Cira umugani ab’iyi nzu y’abagarariji, uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:3">Shira inkono ku ziko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:3">uyishiremwo n’amazi.<verse eid="EZK 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 24:4" />Shiramwo imisoso y’inyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:4">ushiremwo nzizanziza; ukuguru n’ukuboko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:4">Uheze uyuzuze n’amagufa mezameza,<verse eid="EZK 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 24:5" />ufate intama ya mbere nziza;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:5">maze wegenyeze inkwi nyinshi musi y’iyo nkono,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:5">kugira ngo ibire cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:5">amagufa ariyo ashane n’inyama.<verse eid="EZK 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 24:6" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">‘Uzobona ibara, yewe wa gisagara gisesa amaraso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:6">umeze nk’inkono itigera yozwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:6">yuzuye umwanda utavako.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:6">Bayikuramwo inyama imwimwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:6">uko zivayo kwose kuko nta yiruta iyindi.<verse eid="EZK 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 24:7" />Kuko amaraso casheshe akiboneka hagati muri co.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:7">Cayasheshe ku rutare;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:7">nticayasheshe hasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:7">ngo umukungugu uyapfuke.<verse eid="EZK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 24:8" />Mu kugwiza uburake no kwihora,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:8">nanje nasutse amaraso yiwe ku rutare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:8">kugira ngo ntaze yigere azimangana.<verse eid="EZK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 24:9" />Kandi kubera ivyo, uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:9">Uzobona ibara wa gisagara gisesa amaraso!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:9">Nanje nzokwegenyezamwo inkwi nyinshi.<verse eid="EZK 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 24:10" />Komanya inkwi nyinshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:10">ucane umuriro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:10">Canira neza inyama,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:10">uzongeremwo ibirungo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:10">gushika n’amagufa ashe neza.<verse eid="EZK 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 24:11" />Maze utereke inkono igaragara ku makara,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:11">kugira ngo ivyo ikozwemwo bishuhe cane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 24:11">mbere n’umwanda wose uri muri yo ushonge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:11">n’ibibi vyose biri muri yo bishe bihere.<verse eid="EZK 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 24:12" />Ariko ico umuntu yokora cose ni impfagusa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:12">imyanda iyuzuyemwo ntizoyivamwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 24:12">naho hokoreshwa umuriro mwinshi.<verse eid="EZK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 24:13" />Ariko imyanda yawe yabaye akaburarugero. Ko nagerageje kukwoza imyanda yawe ukanka, ntuzohumanuka, kiretse ndaguherejeko uburake bwanje.<verse eid="EZK 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 24:14" />Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabivuze! Igihe canje co gukora kirashitse. Sinzokwisubirako, kandi sinzogira imbabazi, kandi sinzonavyicuza. Nzogusubiriza mu nkoko ibikwiranye n’ivyo wakoze, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umugore wa Ezekiyeli ahwera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 24:15" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 24:16" />“Mwana w’umuntu, ehe ngiye kugutwara icahora ari igihimbaro c’amaso yawe, kandi ntiwidoge canke ngo ukorore n’iryosozi. <verse eid="EZK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 24:17" />Uzonihe unumye, kandi ntuzogandarire uwupfuye. Uzobohere igitambara cawe ku mutwe, wambare n’ibirato vyawe; ntuzokwipfuke ku munwa, kandi ntuzorye indya z’abagandaye.”<verse eid="EZK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 24:18" />Nuko bukeye ndabibwira abantu, hanyuma ku mugoroba umugore wanje arapfa. Bukeye bwaho ndabigenza uko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yabintegetse.<verse eid="EZK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 24:19" />Maze abantu barambaza bati: “Tubwire ico ivyo uriko uragira bisigura kuri twebwe.”<verse eid="EZK 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 24:20" />Maze ndababwira nti: “Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rinzako riti: <verse eid="EZK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 24:21" />‘Bwira ab’inzu ya Isirayeli uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ngiye guhumanya Ingoro yanje, iyo mwahora mwibaza ko ari yo nkomezi zanyu, umunezero w’amaso yanyu, ivyizigiro vy’ubuzima bwanyu. Abahungu n’abakobwa banyu mwasize inyuma i Yerusalemu bazomarwa n’inkota. <verse eid="EZK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 24:22" />Namwe muzobigenze nk’uko nabigenjeje. Ntimuzokwipfuke ku munwa, canke ngo murye ivyokurya vy’abagandaye. <verse eid="EZK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 24:23" />Muzogumize ibitambara vyanyu ku mitwe, kandi muzogume mwambaye ibirato vyanyu. Ntimuzogandare canke ngo murire; ariko muzokwicwe n’akabonge k’ivyaha mwakoze, maze umwe wese aborogane na mugenziwe. <verse eid="EZK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 24:24" />Ezekiyeli azobabere akarorero. Muzobigenze nk’uko yabigenjenje. Ivyo nivyashika, muzomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 24:25" />Maze <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> arambwira ati: “Nawe ga mwana w’umuntu, uwo musi nzokuraho inkomezi zabo, umunezero n’ubwiza bwabo, ibihimbaro vy’amaso yabo n’ivyipfuzo vy’imitima yabo, ntware abahungu n’abakobwa babo. <verse eid="EZK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 24:26" />Kuri uwo musi nyene uwuhunze azoza aho uri aje kukubwira ivyabaye. <verse eid="EZK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 24:27" />Uwo musi akanwa kawe kazokwuguruka, uganire na we, kandi ntuzosubira kunuma. Uzobabera ikimenyetso, na bo bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="EZK 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="EZK 25" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 25:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 25:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, hindukira utumbere igihugu c’Abamoni, maze uvugishwe kuri bo. <verse eid="EZK 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 25:3" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji. Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ko mwanezerewe igihe Ingoro yanje yahumanywa, igihugu ca Isirayeli kigasigara ari agahinga, Abayuda na bo bajanywe ari inyagano, <verse eid="EZK 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 25:4" />nzobarekurirako abantu bo mu buseruko babigarurire. Bazokwubaka amakambi yabo babike amahema mu gihugu canyu; bazorya ivyamwa vyanyu, banywe n’amata yanyu. <verse eid="EZK 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 25:5" />I Raba nzohahindura uburagiro bw’ingamiya, Amoni na ho ndahahindure aho intama zivyagira. Ni ho muzomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 25:6" />Kuko uku ari ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ko wakomye amashi ukiterera hejuru, umutima wawe w’ubugunge ukanezerezwa n’ugutikizwa kwa Isirayeli, <verse eid="EZK 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 25:7" />nzokuramvurirako ukuboko kwanje, ngutange ube iminyago y’amahanga. Nzoguca mu mahanga ngukure mu bihugu, nkurandure nguherengeteze. Ni ho uzomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Mowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 25:8" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: “Ko Mowabu na Seyiri bavuze bati: ‘Ehe i Buyuda habaye nk’ayandi mahanga yose,’ <verse eid="EZK 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 25:9" />ngiye guca icanzo i Mowabu mpereye ku bisagara, ibiri ku mbibe zaho, harimwo n’ibihesheje icubahiro igihugu, ari vyo Beti-Yeshimoti, Bayali-Meyoni na Kiriyatayimu. <verse eid="EZK 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 25:10" />Nzorekurira Mowabu n’Abamoni mu maboko y’abo mu buseruko, mube inyegu yabo, kugira ngo Abamoni ntibazosubire kwibukwa mu yandi mahanga, <verse eid="EZK 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 25:11" />kandi nzohana Mowabu. Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="EZK 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 25:12" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: “Ko Abanyedomu bihoye Abayuda, vyababereye icaha gikomeye, <verse eid="EZK 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 25:13" />nuko rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nzoramvurira ukuboko kwanje kuri Edomu, nice abantu baho n’ibitungwa vyabo. Nzohasiga ari agahinga, kandi kuva i Temani gushika i Dedani, abaho bose bazomarwa n’inkota. <verse eid="EZK 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 25:14" />Nzokwihora Edomu nkoresheje ukuboko kw’abantu banje b’Abisirayeli, maze bazosubiriza mu nkoko Abanyedomu ibihwanye n’uburake bwanje; ni ho bazobona ukwihora kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.”<verse eid="EZK 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imburi ku Bufilisitiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 25:15" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: “Ko Abafilisitiya bihoye Abayuda bafise umutima w’ubugunge, ngo babaranduze urwanko rwabo rwa kera, <verse eid="EZK 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 25:16" />nuko rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: ‘Ngira ndamvurire ukuboko ku Bafilisitiya, mperengeteze Abakereti, ndandure n’abasigaye ku nkengera z’ikiyaga. <verse eid="EZK 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 25:17" />Nzobashitsako ukwihora gukomeye, ndabahanishe uburake bwanje. Ni ho bazomenyera ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari jewe nabihoye.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 25:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="EZK 26" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Tiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 26:1" />Mu kwezi kw’icumi na rimwe, kw’umwaka w’icumi na kabiri, ku musi wakwo wa mbere, umwami Yehoyakini atwawe nk’inyagano, Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 26:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, kubera ko Tiro banezerewe babonye Yerusalemu hasenyutse, bakavuga bati: ‘Ha! Amarembo y’amahanga arasenyutse, imiryango yaho iranyugurukiye. Hacitse agahinga, ariko jewe ngiye kuronka ubutunzi,’ <verse eid="EZK 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 26:3" />Ni co gituma <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze ati: Ngiye kukugwanya, yewe Tiro, nzozana ihanga ryanje rigutere nk’uko ikiyaga gisuka imipfunda ku nkengera. <verse eid="EZK 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 26:4" />Bazosenyura inzitiro za Tiro, bahenagure iminara yaho; nzokubura ivu ryaho hasigare hameze nk’igitandara. <verse eid="EZK 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 26:5" />Hazosigara hameze nk’igitandara co mu kiyaga banikirako insenga z’abarovyi, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze. Hazoba aho amahanga aza gutora iminyago, <verse eid="EZK 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 26:6" />kandi abahaba bose bazomarwa n’inkota. Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 26:7" />Kuko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze nti: Mu Buraruko nzozana Nebukadineza, umwami w’i Babiloni, umwami aganza abandi bami, azanane n’amafarasi n’imikogote hamwe n’ingabo nyinshi, atere Tiro. <verse eid="EZK 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 26:8" />Azoranduza inkota ibisagara vyo mu gihugu hagati; ategure uburyo agutera, yubake ivyo kwuririrako inzitiro zawe, agutere yitwaje inkinzo. <verse eid="EZK 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 26:9" />Inzitiro zawe azozisenyuza ibiti bininibinini, iminara yawe ayihenuze ibigwanisho vyiwe. <verse eid="EZK 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 26:10" />Amafarasi yiwe azoba ari menshi ku buryo igihugu cose kizokwuzuramwo umukungugu. Inzitiro zawe zizotigitishwa n’urwamo rw’amafarasi y’intambara hamwe n’imikogote n’ivyo ikwega, mu gihe azoba ariko arinjira mu marembo, abasoda na bo binjira mu gisagara baca mu birengero. <verse eid="EZK 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 26:11" />Ibinono vy’amafarasi yiwe bizoca mu mabarabara yawe yose; bamarishe inkota abantu bawe, kandi inkingi zawe zikomakomeye zizosenyurirwa hasi. <verse eid="EZK 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 26:12" />Bazosahura ubutunzi bwawe, bibe ibidandazwa vyawe; bazosenyura inzitiro zawe, basenyure amazu yawe mezameza, amabuye bayaterere mu kiyaga, co kimwe n’imbaho zawe, ndetse n’umukungungu wawe. <verse eid="EZK 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 26:13" />Nzohoza urwamo rw’indirimbo zawe, kandi nta mirya y’inanga izosubira kwumvikana. <verse eid="EZK 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 26:14" />Nzoguhindura igitandara kigaragara, ube imbuga yo kwanikirako insenga z’abarovyi. Ntuzosubira kwubakwa, kuko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.”<verse eid="EZK 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 26:15" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji abwiye Tiro: “Mbega ababa ku nkengera z’ikiyaga ntibazojugumira nibumva isenyerana ryawe, bakumva amaborogo y’abakomeretse hamwe n’ukwicwa kuzoba kuriko kurabera iwawe? <verse eid="EZK 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 26:16" />Abami bose bo ku nkengera z’ikiyaga bazova ku ntebe zabo z’ubwami, bambure amakanzu yabo n’inyambarabami zabo. Bazicara hasi buzuye ubwoba, bajugumira, kuko bazoba babonye ivyakubayeko. <verse eid="EZK 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 26:17" />Maze bazocura intimba ku bwawe, bati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">‘Ese ayo ubonye, yewe wa gisagara wahora uri rurangiranwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">abakibamwo bari abagabo ku kiyaga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Wari umunyabushobozi ku biyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">wewe hamwe n’abantu bawe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:17">Mwahoze muteye ubwoba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:17">ku bari babakikuje bose.<verse eid="EZK 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 26:18" />None ubu ababa ku nkengera z’ikiyaga bose barajugumiye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:18">kubera ugusenyuka kwawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 26:18">amazinga yose ahinze agashitsi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 26:18">abonye isenyerana ryawe.’<verse eid="EZK 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 26:19" />Jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze nti: ‘Ninakugira nk’agahinga, ukaba nk’igisagara catawe kera, nkagucokeza i bwina ikiyaga kikakurengako, amazi yaco akagupfuka, <verse eid="EZK 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 26:20" />ico gihe nzokumanura hamwe n’abaja mu rwobo, ahari ababayeho kera. Nzotuma uba i kuzimu, ahameze nk’ibihomoka vya kera, ujane n’abaja mu rwobo, kandi ntuzogaruka canke ngo usubire kuba kw’isi y’abazima. <verse eid="EZK 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 26:21" />Nzogushitsa kw’iherezo riteye ubwoba, kandi ntuzosubira kubaho. Uzoronderwa ariko ntuzosubira kubonwa, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 26:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="EZK 27" />
  <para style="s1">Kuririra Tiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 27:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 27:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, cura intimba uririre Tiro. <verse eid="EZK 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 27:3" />Bwira Tiro, igisagara cubatse ku nkengera z’ikiyaga, ihuriro ry’abadandaza bava mu mihingo myinshi, uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:3">Yewe Tiro, uvuga uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:3">“Ubwiza bwanje ni akaroruhore.”<verse eid="EZK 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 27:4" />Imbibe zawe zishika mu kiyaga hagati,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:4">kandi abakwubatse bakugize mwiza cane.<verse eid="EZK 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 27:5" />Umeze nk’ubwato bunini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:5">wubakishijwe imbaho z’akajwari z’i Seniri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:5">bakwongerako imbaho z’amasederi y’i Libani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:5">bakwubakira ibikenewe vyose kuri wewe.<verse eid="EZK 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 27:6" />Imirinzi y’i Bashani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:6">ni yo bakubaziyemwo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:6">intebe zawe na zo bazibaza mu mbaho z’akajwari ziva i Kupuro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:6">bazishazisha amahembe y’inzovu.<verse eid="EZK 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 27:7" />Ibitambara vy’ubwato bwawe vyari bikozwe mu mpuzu zera derere</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:7">ziva muri Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:7">vyakubera nk’ibendera hejuru yawe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:7">ibitambara vy’ubururu n’ibitukura biva ku nkengera za Elishahu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:7">ni vyo vyakubera ubwugamo.<verse eid="EZK 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 27:8" />Abagabo b’i Sidoni n’i Haruvadi ni bo basoza ubwato bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:8">kandi abanyabwenge bawe, yewe Tiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:8">ni bo bagendesha amato.<verse eid="EZK 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 27:9" />Abakurambere baciye ubwenge bava i Gebali bama mu bwato,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:9">kugira ngo basanure akantu kose gatiriganye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:9">Amato yose yo mu kiyaga hamwe n’abayagendesha bama iwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:9">baje kurondera ibidandazwa.<verse eid="EZK 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 27:10" />Abagabo bava i Buperesi, i Ludi n’i Puti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:10">ni bo bari bagize ingabo zawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:10">Bamanitse inkinzo n’inkofero vyabo ku nzitiro zawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:10">vyagaragaza ubwiza bwawe.<verse eid="EZK 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 27:11" />Abagabo b’i Haruvadi n’i Heleki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:11">ni bo bacungera umutekano w’inzitiro zawe ku mpande zose;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">abagabo b’i Gamadi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:11">bari mu minara yawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:11">Bamanitse inkinzo zabo ku nzitiro zawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:11">ubwiza bwawe baraburyohora.<verse eid="EZK 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 27:12" />Tarushishi mwahanahana ibidandazwa, kuko wari ufise ubutunzi bwinshi; bakaguha ifeza, n’ubundi butare, nawe ukabaha ibidandazwa.<verse eid="EZK 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 27:13" />Ubugiriki, Tubali na Mesheki mwasangira urudandazwa; bakaguha abagurano n’ibindi bintu bikozwe mu mwakaka, nawe ukabaha ibidandazwa vyawe.<verse eid="EZK 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 27:14" />Abagabo bava i Beti h’i Togaruma baguha imikogote ikwegwa n’amafarasi, hamwe n’amafarasi y’intambara, n’inyumbu, nawe ukabaha ibidandazwa.<verse eid="EZK 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 27:15" />Abagabo b’i Dedani mwahana ibidandazwa, kandi abo ku nkengera z’ikiyaga basumira iwawe; bakuriha amahembe y’inzovu n’ibiti vyitwa ebene.<verse eid="EZK 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 27:16" />Siriya mwahanahana ibidandazwa, kuko wari ufise vyinshi; bakakuzanira amabuye y’agaciro, ibitambara bitukura, ivyera, n’impuzu z’amabara.<verse eid="EZK 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 27:17" />Ubuyuda na Isirayeli mwarahanahana ibidandazwa; bakuzanira ingano z’i Miniti hamwe n’ifu, insukoni nziza, ubuki, amavuta ya elayo, hamwe n’ibirungo.<verse eid="EZK 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 27:18" />Damasiko mwahanahana ibidandazwa kuko wari ufise vyinshi, bakakuzanira imivinyu y’i Heluboni hamwe n’ubwoya bw’intama z’i Zahari. <verse eid="EZK 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 27:19" />Abagiriki bavuye mu gisagara Uzali, baje kudandaza bakuzanira ibicuzwe mu vyuma, imbaho z’ikasiya, ibimota neza n’imisigati.<verse eid="EZK 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 27:20" />Ab’i Dedani bagushorako uburengeti basasa ku mafarasi.<verse eid="EZK 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 27:21" />Arabiya n’abaganwa bose b’i Kedari bashorera iwawe; intama n’amapfizi yazo, hamwe n’impene.<verse eid="EZK 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 27:22" />Abadandaza b’i Sheba n’i Rama mwahanahana ibidandazwa; bagashora ibirungo vy’ubwoko bwose, utubuye tw’agaciro turimwo n’inzahabu.<verse eid="EZK 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 27:23" />Harani, Kanehe na Edeni, hamwe n’abadandaza b’i Sheba, Ashuri na Kilimadi mwahanahana ibidandazwa. <verse eid="EZK 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 27:24" />Ku masoko yawe bahashora imyambaro myizamyiza, ibitambara vy’ubururu, impuzu zijererenze z’amabara menshi, ziteweko utugozi duhinze turiko amapfundo akomeye.<verse eid="EZK 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 27:25" />Amato y’i Tarushishi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:25">ni yo yagutwarira ibidandazwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:25">Amato maninimanini ni ho yuzurizwa imizigo minini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:25">uriko urarungika mu kiyaga.<verse eid="EZK 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 27:26" />Abasoza bawe baragutwaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:26">bagushikanye kure mu kiyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:26">Ariko umuyaga wo mu buseruko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:26">uzogusamburira hagati mu kiyaga.<verse eid="EZK 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 27:27" />Ubutunzi bwawe, ibidandazwa vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">abasoza bawe n’abagendesha ubwato,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">abadandaza bawe hamwe n’abasoda bawe bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">n’uwundi wese bazoba bari kumwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:27">bazodobezwa i bwina mu kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:27">ku musi ubwato buzomeneka.<verse eid="EZK 27:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 27:28" />Ibisagara vyo ku nkengera z’ikiyaga bizojugumira</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:28">nivyumva amarira y’abagendesha ubwato bawe.<verse eid="EZK 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 27:29" />Abasoza</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:29">bazota amato yabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:29">abajejwe gutunganya ubwato</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:29">bazokwururuka baje ku nkengera z’ikiyaga.<verse eid="EZK 27:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 27:30" />Bazoduza ijwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:30">buzuye urwamo bakuririra;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:30">bazokwisurirako imikungugu ku mitwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:30">bikumbagaze mu minyota.<verse eid="EZK 27:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 27:31" />Bazokwimosha inkomvorera kubera wewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:31">bambare amagunira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:31">Bazokuririra buzuye intimba mu mutima,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:31">bakugandarire buzuye umubabaro.<verse eid="EZK 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 27:32" />Mu kukuririra no mu kukuborogera</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:32">bazocura intimba ku bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:32">bavuga bati: Mbega hari igisagara cari kimeze nka Tiro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:32">ubu kidobejwe mu gacerere i bwina mu kiyaga?’<verse eid="EZK 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 27:33" />Igihe ibidandazwa vyawe vyasohoka ku kiyaga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:33">wahaza amahanga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:33">ubutunzi bwawe n’ibidandazwa vyawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:33">vyatungishije abami bo mw’isi.<verse eid="EZK 27:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 27:34" />None ubu umenaguwe n’ikiyaga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:34">wibiye i bwina muri co;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:34">ibidandazwa vyawe n’abakozi bawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:34">bitwariwe rimwe i bwina hamwe nawe.<verse eid="EZK 27:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 27:35" />Ababa ku nkengera z’ikiyaga bose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:35">barumiwe;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 27:35">abami babo bafashwe n’ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:35">mu maso habo harijiriwe.<verse eid="EZK 27:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 27:36" />Abadandaza bo mu mahanga bavugije agahwa kubera wewe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:36">Iherezo ryawe rihindisha agashitsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 27:36">kandi ntuzosubira kubaho.”<verse eid="EZK 27:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="EZK 28" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi ku mwami wa Tiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 28:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 28:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, bwira abatware b’i Tiro uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Mu bwibone bwo mu mutima wawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">uvuga uti: “Erega ndi imana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">nicaye ku ntebe y’imana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">hagati mu biyaga.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:2">Ariko uri umuntu nturi imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:2">naho wibaza ko unganya ubwenge n’imana.<verse eid="EZK 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 28:3" />Mbega usumvya ubwenge Daniyeli?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:3">Nta banga na rimwe udashobora kumenya?<verse eid="EZK 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 28:4" />Ubwenge bwawe n’ugutahura kwawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:4">vyaguhesheje ubutunzi bwinshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:4">biguha ifeza n’inzahabu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:4">biba amatungo yawe.<verse eid="EZK 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 28:5" />Kubera ubumenyi ufise mu rudandazwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:5">wagwije ubutunzi bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:5">kandi kubera ubwo butunzi bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:5">wagwije ubwibone mu mutima.<verse eid="EZK 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 28:6" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:6">Ko wibaza ko uri umunyabwenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:6">ko ufise ubwenge nk’ubw’imana,<verse eid="EZK 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 28:7" />nzozana abanyamahanga bagutere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:7">bavuye mu mahanga ateye ubwoba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:7">bazosokora inkota bakumare ubwiza bw’ubwenge bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:7">ugukayangana kwawe bagusogote.<verse eid="EZK 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 28:8" />Bazokumanura mu cobo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:8">kandi uzopfa rubi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:8">ugwe i bwina mu kiyaga.<verse eid="EZK 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 28:9" />Mbega uzosubira kwirata uvuga uti: Ndi imana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:9">uri imbere y’abakwica?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:9">Uzoba uri umuntu buntu, ata bumana ufise</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:9">uri mu maboko y’abagusogota.<verse eid="EZK 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 28:10" />Uzopfa urupfu rw’abatakebwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:10">ugwe mu minwe y’abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 28:10">ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 28:11" />Maze Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ritumwa kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 28:12" />“Mwana w’umuntu, cura intimba, uririre umwami w’i Tiro, uvuge uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:12">Wari akaroruhore,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:12">wuzuye ubwenge, utunganye mu bwiza.<verse eid="EZK 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 28:13" />Wari muri Edeni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">itongo ry’Imana;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">wari usharijwe n’amabuye yose y’agaciro:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">karuneliyani, krizoliti na emerodi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">topazi, onigisi na yasipi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">lapisi lazuli, turikwaze na berile.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:13">Vyose biteguwe neza hamwe n’inzahabu nziza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:13">vyari vyaguteguriwe utararemwa.<verse eid="EZK 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 28:14" />Wari wasizwe amavuta ngo ube umukerubi murinzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:14">ni co nari narakurobanuriye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:14">Wari ku musozi wera w’Imana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:14">ukagendagendera ku mabuye yakaka.<verse eid="EZK 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 28:15" />Wari inyankamugayo mu nzira zawe zose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:15">kuva umusi waremwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:15">gushitsa aho nagusangamwo ikibi.<verse eid="EZK 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 28:16" />Mu rudandazwa rwawe ruhambaye</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">wari wuzuyemwo umuryano,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">bigutera gukora ivyaha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:16">Ni co gituma nagutituye nkagukura ku musozi w’Imana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">nkakwomora, yewe mukerubi murinzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:16">nkagukura mu mabuye yakaka.<verse eid="EZK 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 28:17" />Umutima wawe wawujujemwo ubwibone</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">kubera ubwiza bwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">wonona ubwenge bwawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">kubera ubwiza bwawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:17">Ni co catumye ndaguta kw’isi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:17">ugacika akabarore imbere y’abami.<verse eid="EZK 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 28:18" />Ubwinshi bw’ivyaha vyawe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">n’ubugunge mu rudandazwa rwawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">vyatumye uhumanya ingoro zawe.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">Ni co gituma nakuzanyeko umuriro uvuye muri wewe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">uragutikiza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:18">Nakugize umunyota wo hasi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:18">mu maso y’abariko bararorera bose.<verse eid="EZK 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 28:19" />Amahanga yose yari akuzi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:19">arajorerwa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:19">ingene iherezo ryawe rihindisha agashitsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:19">kandi ukaba utazosubira kubaho.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Sidoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 28:20" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 28:21" />“Mwana w’umuntu, hindukira urabe i Sidoni, uhavugishwako, <verse eid="EZK 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 28:22" />uvuge uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">Nzokugwanya, yewe Sidoni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">kandi nzokwihesha icubahiro muri wewe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:22">Uzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">ninamara kuguhana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:22">nkakwiyerekanirako ko ndi uwera.<verse eid="EZK 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 28:23" />Nzoguteza icago,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:23">amaraso yawe azotemba mu mabarabara.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Ubwicanyi buzoza muri wewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 28:23">inkota igutere izananye ku mpande zose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 28:23">Maze abantu bose bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 28:24" />Abisirayeli ntibazoba bagifise ababanyi b’indyarya, bababaza nk’umukere, bagahanda nk’amahwa. Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji.<verse eid="EZK 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 28:25" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ninamara kwegeranya ubwoko bwa Isirayeli nkabukura mu mahanga bwasanzariyemwo, nzobigaragazako nk’uwera mu maso y’amahanga. Maze bazoba mu gihugu cabo, ico nahaye umusavyi wanje Yakobo. <verse eid="EZK 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 28:26" />Bazoba amahoro, biyubakire amazu, batere imizabibu; bazoba mu mahoro ninahana amahanga abakikuje yabahindutse. Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 28:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="EZK 29" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi zerekeye Egiputa</para>
  <para style="s2">Imburi kuri Farawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 29:1" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi, mu kwezi kw’icumi, ku musi w’icumi na kabiri, umwami Yehoyakini ari mu kinyago, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 29:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, hindukira uhange amaso Farawo, umwami wa Egiputa, umuvugishweko hamwe n’abantu bose ba Egiputa. <verse eid="EZK 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 29:3" />Umubwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">Nzokugwanya yewe Farawo, mwami wa Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:3">wa gisizimwe kiryamye hagati y’inzuzi zawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:3">Kuko wibwira uti: Uruzi Nili ni urwanje;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:3">ni jewe narwiremeye.<verse eid="EZK 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 29:4" />Ariko nzoshira igera mu mibangabanga yawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:4">amafi yo mu nzuzi zawe ndayomeke mu bigaragamba vyawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:4">Nzogukwega ndagukure hagati y’izo nzuzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:4">uko wakabaye amafi yose yometse mu bigaragamba vyawe.<verse eid="EZK 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 29:5" />Nzoguterera mu bugaragwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">mwe n’amafi yo mu nzuzi zawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Uzogwa mu gahinga, kandi nta wuzoguhamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">nta n’uwuzokwegeranya ibisigarira vyawe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 29:5">Nzokugaburira ibikoko vyo kw’isi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 29:5">n’inyoni zo mu kirere.<verse eid="EZK 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 29:6" />Maze abo muri Egiputa bose bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 29:6" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:6">mwabereye inzu ya Isirayeli icishimikizo kimeze nk’inkoni y’irenga. <verse eid="EZK 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 29:7" />Igihe bagufata ngo bakwishimikize wavunikiye mu maboko yabo, maze ubakomeretsa igitugu; igihe bakwegamira, waravunitse baca bagwira umugongo, bavunika amafyigo.<verse eid="EZK 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 29:8" />None rero uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Nzoguteza inkota, mponye abantu bawe n’ibitungwa vyabo. <verse eid="EZK 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 29:9" />Egiputa hazocika agahinga, habe amashamba. Ni ho bazomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 29:9">Kuko wavuze uti: Uruzi Nili ni urwanje, ni urwo niremeye, <verse eid="EZK 29:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 29:10" />ni co gituma nzokugwanya, nkagwanya n’inzuzi zawe, igihugu ca Egiputa nkakigira agahinga, kuva i Migidoli gushika muri Asuwani no ku mbibe za Etiyopiya. <verse eid="EZK 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 29:11" />Nta maguru y’abantu canke y’ibikoko azosubira kugicamwo; kizomara imyaka mirongo ine atabakibamwo. <verse eid="EZK 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 29:12" />Egiputa nzokigira umusaka, kibe agahinga hagati mu bindi bihugu vyabaye agahinga, umugwa waho ube umusaka hagati mu yindi migwa yabaye imisaka. Abanyegiputa na bo nzobashwiragiza mu mahanga, basabagire mu bindi bihugu.<verse eid="EZK 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 29:13" />Ariko uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Inyuma y’imyaka mirongo ine nzokwegeranya Abanyegiputa ndabakure iyo bashwiragiriye. <verse eid="EZK 29:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 29:14" />Nzobakura mu buja, ndabasubize ruguru muri Egiputa, igihugu ca ba sekuruza babo. Ariko bazoguma ari ubwami butoya. <verse eid="EZK 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 29:15" />Buzokwama ari ubwami butoya mu bundi bwami, ntibuzokwigera busubira kwishira hejuru y’ayandi mahanga. Nzobugira ubwami buto cane, butazigera busubira kuganza ayandi mahanga. <verse eid="EZK 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 29:16" />Egiputa ntikizosubira kuba ivyizigiro vy’Abisirayeli, ariko kizoba icibutso c’icaha bakoze mu kugihindukirira ngo kibatabare. Maze Abisirayeli bazomenya ko ari jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji jenyene.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Impera ya Nebukadineza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 29:17" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri n’indwi, mu kwezi kwa mbere, ku musi wa mbere, umwami Yehoyakini ari mu kinyago, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe, riti: <verse eid="EZK 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 29:18" />“Mwana w’umuntu, Umwami Nebukadineza, umwami w’i Babiloni, yakoresheje igikorwa kigoye ingabo ziwe mu kugwanya Tiro. Ingabo ziwe zahatobokeye ubuhanza, ibitugu vyabo vyuzurako inguma. Ariko yaba umwami, yaba ingabo ziwe, nta wagize ico akura muri Tiro ku bw’ibitero bagize kuri ico gisagara. <verse eid="EZK 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 29:19" />None rero uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Ngiye guha Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni Egiputa, atware ubutunzi bwaho. Azonyaga ivyo muri ico gihugu bibe impembo y’ingabo ziwe. <verse eid="EZK 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 29:20" />Nzomuha Egiputa nk’impera ku bw’igikorwa we n’ingabo ziwe bankoreye, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 29:21" />Ico gihe nzokwongera inkomezi Abisirayeli, kandi nawe Ezekiyeli, nzoguha ububasha kugira ngo ushobore kuvugana na bo. Ni ho bazomenyera ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="EZK 29:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="EZK 30" />
  <para style="s2">Intimba ku bwa Egiputa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 30:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 30:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, vugishwa maze uvuge uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:2">‘Koma induru uvuga uti:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:2">Ese umusi mubi!<verse eid="EZK 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 30:3" />Kuko uwo musi uri hafi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:3">umusi w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uri hafi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:3">umusi wuzuye ibicu n’igipfungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:3">umusi wo gucira imanza amahanga.<verse eid="EZK 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 30:4" />Inkota izotera Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">Etiyopiya hazokwuzura imibabaro.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:4">Abasogoswe bazogwa muri Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">ubutunzi bwaho buzonyagwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:4">imfatiro zaho zisenyurwe.<verse eid="EZK 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 30:5" />Etiyopiya, Libiya, Ludi na Arabiya hose hamwe n’ayandi mahanga yari yifatanije na yo, azomarwa n’inkota hamwe na Egiputa.<verse eid="EZK 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 30:6" />Kuko ibi ari vyo jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> mvuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Amahanga yifatanije na Egiputa azotemba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:6">n’inkomezi bishimiye zizohinduka ubusa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:6">Kuva i Migidoli gushika muri Asuwani</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:6">bazomarwa n’inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:6">ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 30:7" />Hazohinduka agahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:7">nk’ibindi bihugu vyahindutse agahinga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:7">ibisagara vyaho bizotemba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:7">bibe nk’ibindi bisagara vyabaye imisaka.<verse eid="EZK 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 30:8" />Maze bazomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:8">ninamara guturira Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:8">ngatikiza abifatanije na co.<verse eid="EZK 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 30:9" />Uwo musi intumwa zizova imbere yanje, zifate amato zije gutera ubwoba Etiyopiya bibaza ko bari mu mahoro. Bazogira agahinda kuri uwo musi w’ivyago vya Egiputa, kandi uwo musi nta nkeka urashitse.<verse eid="EZK 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 30:10" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:10">Nzozimanganya ingabo za Egiputa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:10">nkoresheje ukuboko kwa Nebukadineza umwami w’i Babiloni.<verse eid="EZK 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 30:11" />We n’ingabo ziwe ziteye ubwoba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:11">bazozanwa gutikiza igihugu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:11">Bazosokora inkota zabo bagwanye Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:11">igihugu cose bacuzuze imivyimba.<verse eid="EZK 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 30:12" />Nzokamya imigende y’uruzi Nili,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:12">igihugu na co ndakidandaze ku nkozi z’ikibi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:12">Nkoresheje ukuboko kw’abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:12">igihugu cose n’ibikirimwo nzobihindura ruhebwa,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="EZK 30:12">ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 30:13" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Nzotikiza ibigirwamana vyabo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:13">nkureho ibishushanyo vy’i Memfisi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:13">Nta muganwa azosubira kurangwa muri Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:13">kandi nzokwiragiza ugucika ivutu mu gihugu cose.<verse eid="EZK 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 30:14" />Amajaruguru ya Egiputa nzoyagira agahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:14">ncane umucanwa i Zowani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:14">ntange igihano kuri Tebesi.<verse eid="EZK 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 30:15" />Nzosuka uburake bwanje kuri Pelusiyumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:15">no ku nzitiro za Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:15">n’abantu b’i Tebesi ndabakureho.<verse eid="EZK 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 30:16" />Nzoturira Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:16">Pelusiyumu yicwe n’iminiho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:16">Tebesi hazofatwa n’igihuhusi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:16">Memfisi na ho hagume mu kabonge.<verse eid="EZK 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 30:17" />Imisore y’i Heliyopolisi n’i Bubasitisi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:17">izokwicwa n’inkota,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:17">kandi abanyagisagara na bo batwarwe nk’inyagano.<verse eid="EZK 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 30:18" />Umusi w’umwijima uzoshika i Tafanihesi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">igihe nzovuna ingogo ya Egiputa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">aho ni ho inkomezi zaco zizoherera.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 30:18">Hazotwikirwa n’ibipfungu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:18">imihana yaho yose itwarwe nk’inyagano.<verse eid="EZK 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 30:19" />Uko ni ko nzoshitsa igihano kuri Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 30:19">kandi bazomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Amaboko ya Farawo azovunagurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 30:20" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi na kabiri, mu kwezi kwa mbere, ku musi w’indwi umwami Yehoyakini ari mu kinyago, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 30:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 30:21" />“Mwana w’umuntu, navunye ukuboko kwa Farawo umwami wa Egiputa. Kandi ukuboko kwiwe ntikwunzwe ngo gukire gushobore gufata inkota. <verse eid="EZK 30:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 30:22" />Ni co gituma, ibi ari vyo jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Nzogwanya Farawo Umwami wa Egiputa. Nzomuvunagura amaboko yompi, ugukomeye n’ugusanzwe kuvunitse, maze inkota yiwe ive mu kuboko kwiwe ikorokere hasi. <verse eid="EZK 30:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 30:23" />Nzoshwiragiriza Abanyegiputa mu mahanga, ndabasanzarize mu bindi bihugu. <verse eid="EZK 30:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 30:24" />Nzokomeza ukuboko kw’umwami w’i Babiloni, ndamufatishe inkota yanje mu kuboko kwiwe, ariko nzovunagura amaboko ya Farawo, maze azonihira imbere yiwe nk’uwugira yicwe n’inguma. <verse eid="EZK 30:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 30:25" />Nzokomeza amaboko y’umwami w’i Babiloni, ariko amaboko ya Farawo nzotuma adendebukirwa. Maze bazomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ninashira inkota yanje mu kuboko kw’umwami w’i Babiloni, maze akayibangurira kugwanya Egiputa. <verse eid="EZK 30:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 30:26" />Nzoshwiragiriza Abanyegiputa mu mahanga, ndabasanzaze mu bihugu. Ni ho bazomenyera ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="EZK 30:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="EZK 31" />
  <para style="s2">Farawo agereranywa n’isederi ry’i Libani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 31:1" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi na rimwe, mu kwezi kwa gatatu, ku musi wakwo wa mbere umwami Yehoyakini ari mu kinyago, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 31:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, barira Farawo umwami wa Egiputa n’isinzi ry’abantu biwe uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:2">‘Ni nde yogereranywa nawe mu bukuru bwawe?<verse eid="EZK 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 31:3" />Umeze nk’uko Ashuri hahora hameze hari nk’isederi ry’i Libani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:3">amashami yaryo meza yapfuka ishamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:3">ryagera mu kirere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:3">agasunwa karyo kagakora kw’ijuru.<verse eid="EZK 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 31:4" />Ryavomererwa amazi ava mu mariba agera i bwina,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">bigatuma rikura rikaba rirerire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:4">inzuzi zarica hirya no hino y’imizi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:4">imigende yazo ikavomera ibindi biti vyo muri iryo shamba.<verse eid="EZK 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 31:5" />Ni co catumye uburebure bwaryo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">buruta ubw’ibindi biti vyo mw’ishamba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:5">Amashami yaryo yabaye menshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">kandi aba maremare,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:5">riratagarara, kubera amazi menshi.<verse eid="EZK 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 31:6" />Ibisiga vyo mu kirere vyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">vyaritse mu mashami yaryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">na vyo bivyarira musi y’amashami yaryo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:6">Amahanga akomakomeye yose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:6">yibera mu gitutu caryo.<verse eid="EZK 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 31:7" />Uko ni ko ryabaye irihambaye mu bwiza,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:7">hamwe no mu gusagarara kw’amashami yaryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:7">kuko imizi yaryo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:7">yashoreye mu mazi menshi.<verse eid="EZK 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 31:8" />Amasederi yo mw’itongo ry’Imana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">ntiyashobora kwigereranya na ryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">canke ngo amapinusi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">agereranye amashami yayo n’ayaryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">canke ibiti vyo mu kiyaya ngo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">bigereranye amashami yavyo n’ayaryo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:8">Nta giti co mw’itongo ry’Imana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:8">canganya ubwiza na ryo.<verse eid="EZK 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 31:9" />Narigize ryiza cane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:9">ndariha amashami menshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 31:9">rikipfuzwa n’ibiti vyose vyo muri Edeni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 31:9">itongo ry’Imana.<verse eid="EZK 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 31:10" />None rero uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Ko ryaduze hejuru cane, rigashitsa agasunwa hejuru y’ibicu, rikishimira uburebure bwaryo, <verse eid="EZK 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 31:11" />narirekuriye mu maboko y’uwuganza amahanga ngo aryishure ibihwanye n’ivyaha vyaryo. Jewe ubwanje nararyirukanye. <verse eid="EZK 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 31:12" />Ingabo ziteye ubwoba z’abanyamahanga ziraryiciye, zisiga riryamye hasi. Amashami yaryo agwa ku misozi no mu biyaya, ayandi avunagurikira ku migende y’amazi yose yo mu gihugu. Amahanga yose yari mu gitutu caryo avayo aragenda. <verse eid="EZK 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 31:13" />Ibisiga vyo mu kirere biraza biba ku mutumba waryo uryamye hasi, n’inyamaswa zo mw’ishamba ziraza zibera mu mashami yaco. <verse eid="EZK 31:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 31:14" />Ni co gituma ata giti co hafi y’amazi kizokwirata uburebure bwaco, canke ngo kiduze agasunwa kaco gushika hejuru y’ibicu. Nta n’ibikomeye vyo muri vyo bivomerewe neza bizoshikira ubwo burebure, kuko vyose bigenewe gupfa bikaja i kuzimu, co kimwe n’abamanuka baja mu rwobo.<verse eid="EZK 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 31:15" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Ku musi Ashuri yamanuwe ajanwa mu mva, iwabo w’abapfuye, amariba nayapfukishije ukumugandarira; nahagaritse imigende yaho, n’amazi menshi ndayagomera. Kubera we, nambitse Libani umwijima, n’ibiti vyo mw’ishamba vyose birakabirana. <verse eid="EZK 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 31:16" />Natumye amahanga ahinda agashitsi yumvise ukugwa kwiwe, igihe namumanura mu mva, iwabo w’abapfuye ngo aje kubana n’abamanutse bakaja mu rwobo. Maze ibiti vyose vyo muri Edeni, ivyiza kurusha ibindi vyose vyo muri Libani, ibiti imizi yavyo ishorera mu mazi, vyarahumurijwe no kumusanga i bwina mu kuzimu. <verse eid="EZK 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 31:17" />Na vyo nyene, co kimwe n’amasederi, vyaragiye iwabo w’abapfuye, aho abishwe n’inkota bari, aho bari kumwe n’abagabo bari bafise ibigwanisho, bakibera mu gitutu ciwe mu mahanga.<verse eid="EZK 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 31:18" />Mu biti vyo muri Edeni ni ikihe munganya ubwiza no gukomera? Ariko na wewe uzocishwa bugufi co kimwe n’ibiti vyo muri Edeni, mujanwe i kuzimu. Uzorambarara hagati y’abatakebwe, hamwe n’abicishijwe inkota.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 31:18">Abo ni Farawo hamwe n’amasinzi y’ingabo ziwe, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 31:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="EZK 32" />
  <para style="s2">Amarira ku bwa Farawo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 32:1" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi na kabiri, mu kwezi kw’icumi na kabiri, ku musi wakwo wa mbere umwami Yehoyakini ari mu kinyago, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 32:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, cura intimba uririre Farawo umwami wa Egiputa, umubwire uti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">‘Umeze nk’intare mu yandi mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">umeze nk’igisizimwe co mu biyaga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:2">Wasimbagurika mu nzuzi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">ukavurungisha amazi yazo ibirenge vyawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:2">ugatoba inzuzi.<verse eid="EZK 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 32:3" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:3">Ndi kumwe n’ikoraniro ry’abantu benshi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:3">nzogutera urusenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:3">na bo bazogukwegesha urwo rusenga rwanje.<verse eid="EZK 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 32:4" />Nzogushiburira i musozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:4">ngute mu gahinga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:4">Nzoreka ibisiga vyo mu kirere bikugweko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:4">inyamaswa zo mw’ishamba na zo zikurye zihage.<verse eid="EZK 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 32:5" />Nzosanzaza inyama zawe ku misozi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:5">ibisigarira vyawe ndavyuzuze mu biyaya.<verse eid="EZK 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 32:6" />Amaraso yawe atemba nzoyavomeresha igihugu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:6">gushika ku misozi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:6">kandi ibiyaya bizokwuzura inyama zawe.<verse eid="EZK 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 32:7" />Ninakuzimya, nzotwikira ijuru,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:7">inyenyeri zaho ntizizokwaka;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:7">izuba nzoritwikiriza igicu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:7">kandi ukwezi ntikuzobonesha.<verse eid="EZK 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 32:8" />Ibimurika vyo kw’ijuru vyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:8">nzobizimya hejuru yawe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:8">nzane umwijima hejuru y’igihugu cawe, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze.<verse eid="EZK 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 32:9" />Nzohagarika imitima y’abantu benshi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:9">ninakurandurira mu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:9">no mu bihugu utigeze umenya.<verse eid="EZK 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 32:10" />Nzotuma amahanga menshi ajorerwa kubera wewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">kandi abami bayo bazokwicwa n’ubwoba kubera wewe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">ninakubangurirako inkota imbere yabo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:10">Ku musi wo gutemba kwawe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">umuntu wese azohinda agashitsi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:10">umwanya wose atinyirira ubuzima bwiwe.<verse eid="EZK 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 32:11" />Kuko uku ari ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:11">Inkota y’umwami w’i Babiloni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:11">izokuzako.<verse eid="EZK 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 32:12" />Nzotuma ingabo zawe amasinzi zitemba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">zimarwe n’inkota z’abagabo bakomeye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">bamwe ba ruburakigongwe kurusha abo mu mahanga yose.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:12">Bazohindura ubusa ubwibone bwa Egiputa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:12">kandi amasinzi y’ingabo zaho azotikira.<verse eid="EZK 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 32:13" />Nzotikiza ibitungwa vyose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:13">biri i ruhande y’amazi menshi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:13">nta kirenge c’umuntu canke ibinono vy’ibikoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:13">bizosubira gutoba ayo mazi.<verse eid="EZK 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 32:14" />Maze nzoheza ntume amazi ya Egiputa atekana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:14">inzuzi zaho zitembe nk’amavuta ya Elayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:14">ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 32:15" />Ninamara guhindura Egiputa agahinga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:15">ngakuraho ivyari muri co vyose,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EZK 32:15">ngatikiza abakibamwo bose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EZK 32:15">ni ho bazomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 32:16" />Iyi ni yo ntimba bazocura. Abakobwa bo mu mahanga ni yo ntimba bazocura; ni yo bazocurira Egiputa n’amasinzi y’ingabo zayo, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ukumanuka kwa Egiputa mu rwobo rw’abapfuye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 32:17" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi na kabiri, ku musi w’icumi na gatanu w’ukwezi kw’icumi na kabiri, ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryatumwe kuri jewe riti: <verse eid="EZK 32:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 32:18" />“Mwana w’Umuntu, borogera amasinzi y’ingabo za Egiputa, n’ayandi mahanga akomeye. Kuko nzobarungika i kuzimu mw’isi y’abapfuye hamwe n’abamanuka baja muri rwa rwobo. <verse eid="EZK 32:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 32:19" />Ubabwire uti: ‘Mbega hari ico musumbije abandi? Manuka murambararane n’abatakebwe.’ <verse eid="EZK 32:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 32:20" />Abanyegiputa bazogwa hagati mu bishwe n’inkota. Inkota irasokowe, reka Abanyegiputa bakweganwe n’amasinzi y’ingabo zabo. <verse eid="EZK 32:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 32:21" />Hariya i kuzimu, iwabo w’abapfuye, abandi batware bakomeye bazovugira i kuzimu ivya Egiputa n’abifatanije na ho bavuge bati: ‘Baraje i kuzimu kurambararana n’abatakebwe, ari bo batikijwe n’inkota.’<verse eid="EZK 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 32:22" />Ashuri arambarayeyo ari kumwe n’ingabo ziwe zose; akikujwe n’imva z’abo yishe bose, abo yaririkishije inkota. <verse eid="EZK 32:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 32:23" />Imva zabo ziri i bwina mu rwobo, kandi ingabo ziwe zandagaye i ruhande y’imva yiwe. Abari bakwije iterabwoba kw’isi y’abazima bose, barishwe, barigitwa n’inkota.<verse eid="EZK 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 32:24" />Elamu ni yo ari, akikujwe n’imva z’ingabo ziwe. Bose barishwe, barigiswe n’inkota. Abari bakwije iterabwoba kw’isi y’abazima bamanutse i kuzimu badakebwe. Bajanyeyo ibimaramare vyabo bari kumwe n’abaja mu rwobo i kuzimu. <verse eid="EZK 32:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 32:25" />Yateguriwe uburiri hagati y’abandi bishwe, imva yiwe ikikujwe n’isinzi ry’ingabo ziwe. Bose ntibari barakebwe, kandi bishwe n’inkota. Kubera ko iterabwoba ryabo ryakwiye kw’isi y’abazima, bajanyeyo ibimaramare vyabo, bajana n’abaja mu rwobo i kuzimu; barambaraye hamwe n’abishwe.<verse eid="EZK 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 32:26" />Mesheki na Tubali ni yo bari, imva zabo zikikujwe n’amasinzi y’ingabo zabo. Bose ntibari barakebwe, kandi barigiswe n’inkota, kuko bakwije iterabwoba ryabo kw’isi yose y’abazima. <verse eid="EZK 32:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 32:27" />Ariko ntibahambanywe iteka nk’abandi bahizi ba kera bamanutse i kuzimu batwaye ibigwanisho vyabo, bagaseguzwa inkota zabo, bakagerekwako n’inkinzo zabo; naho abo bahizi na bo nyene bari barateye ubwoba isi yose y’abazima.<verse eid="EZK 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 32:28" />None, na wewe nyene Farawo, uzovunagurwa, urambikwe mu batakebwe, hamwe n’abarigiswe n’inkota.<verse eid="EZK 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 32:29" />Edomu ni yo ari, ari kumwe n’abami biwe, n’abaganwa biwe; naho bari abahambaye, barambaraye hamwe n’abishwe n’inkota. Barambararanye n’abatakebwe, abamanutse baja muri rwa rwobo i kuzimu.<verse eid="EZK 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 32:30" />Abaganwa bo mu buraruko hamwe n’ab’i Sidoni bose ni yo bari; bamanukanyeyo n’abishwe urw’agashinyaguro, naho inkomezi zabo zari ziteye ubwoba. Barambaraye batakebwe, bari kumwe n’abishwe n’inkota, buzuye ibimaramare hamwe n’abaja muri rwa rwobo i kuzimu.<verse eid="EZK 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 32:31" />Farawo, hamwe n’ingabo ziwe zose, azobabona ahumurizwe ku bw’amasinzi y’ingabo ziwe zishwe n’inkota, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze. <verse eid="EZK 32:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 32:32" />Ariko naho natumye atera ubwoba abari mw’isi y’abazima, Farawo n’ingabo ziwe zose bazogwa hamwe n’intakebwa, hamwe n’abo barigiswe n’inkota, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze.”<verse eid="EZK 32:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="EZK 33" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekiyeli yongera guhamagarirwa kuba Umuteramyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 33:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 33:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, barira abo bantu bo mu bwoko bwawe uti: ‘Ninazana inkota ku gihugu, hanyuma abantu bo muri co bagatoranya umwe muri bo ngo ababere umuteramyi, <verse eid="EZK 33:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 33:3" />hanyuma uwo muntu akabona iyo nkota ije akavuza inzamba aburira abantu, <verse eid="EZK 33:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 33:4" />maze hakagira abamwumva ariko bakirengagiza iyo mburi, ya nkota ikaza igatwara ubuzima bwabo, amaraso yabo azobaharurwako. <verse eid="EZK 33:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 33:5" />Kubera yuko bumvise ijwi ry’inzamba ariko bakirengagiza iyo mburi, amaraso yabo azobaharurwako, kuko iyo baza kwumvira iyo mburi bari kwikingira bagakira. <verse eid="EZK 33:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 33:6" />Ariko uwo muteramyi niyabona inkota ije hanyuma ntavuze inzamba ngo aburire abantu, maze ya nkota ikaza igatwara ubuzima bw’umwe muri bo, uwo muntu azopfira mu vyaha vyiwe, ariko uwo muteramyi nzomuharurako amaraso y’uwo muntu.’<verse eid="EZK 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 33:7" />Nawe mwana w’umuntu, nakugize umuteramyi w’inzu ya Isirayeli; none rero niwumve amajambo nkubwira, uheze ubaburire. <verse eid="EZK 33:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 33:8" />Ninabwira umunyakibi nti: ‘Ewe wa munyakibi, nta kabuza uzopfa,’ hanyuma nawe ntumuburire ngo ahindukire ave mu bibi vyiwe; uwo munyakibi azopfira mu vyaha vyiwe, ariko amaraso yiwe nzoyaguharurako. <verse eid="EZK 33:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 33:9" />Ariko niwaburira umunyakibi ngo ave mu nzira ziwe mbi hanyuma akanka, azopfira mu vyaha vyiwe, ariko weho uzoba ukijije ubugingo bwawe.<verse eid="EZK 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 33:10" />Mwana w’umuntu, barira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Muvuga muti: Ibibi n’ivyaha vyacu biraturemereye, kandi biratwishe. Mbega tuzokira dute?’ <verse eid="EZK 33:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 33:11" />Babwire uti: ‘Indahiro ni jewe nyene, ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze, sinezerezwa n’urupfu rw’umunyakibi, ariko ico ngomba ni uko yohindukira akava mu vyaha vyiwe akabaho. Nimuhindukire! Nimuhindukire muve mu nzira zanyu mbi! Ni igiki cotuma mwemera gupfa ga yemwe bwoko bwa Isirayeli?’<verse eid="EZK 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 33:12" />Ku bw’ivyo, mwana w’umuntu, bwira abantu bo mu bwoko bwawe uti: ‘Nimba umuntu asanzwe agororotse hanyuma agacumura, ubugororotsi bwiwe bwa mbere ntibuzomukiza niyasubira mu vyaha vyiwe. Kandi umuntu w’umunyakibi niyihana, ububi bwiwe bwa mbere yagendeyemwo ntibuzomutsindisha. Umugororotsi niyacumura, ntazokwemererwa kubaho naho yoba yahora ari umugororotsi. <verse eid="EZK 33:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 33:13" />Ninabwira umugororotsi ko azobaho, ariko akishimira ukugororoka kwiwe, agakora ivyaha, nta gikorwa na kimwe c’ubugororotsi yakoze kizokwibukwa; azopfa azize ivyaha yakoze. <verse eid="EZK 33:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 33:14" />Kandi ninabwira umunyakibi nti: Nta kabuza uzopfa, maze agahindukira akava mu vyaha vyiwe, agakora ibitunganye n’ibigororotse, <verse eid="EZK 33:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 33:15" />agasubiza ivyo yatse kw’ingwati ku ngurane, agasubiza ivyo yivye, agakurikiza ivyo nihanikiririje bitanga ubugingo, akirinda gukora ikibi; nta kabuza azobaho, ntazopfa. <verse eid="EZK 33:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 33:16" />Ivyaha vyose yakoze nta na kimwe kizomuharurwako; niyakora ibitunganye n’ibigororotse, azobaho.’<verse eid="EZK 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 33:17" />Yamara, ubwoko bwawe buravuga buti: ‘Inzira y’Imana ntigororotse.’ Ariko inzira zabo ni zo zitagororotse. <verse eid="EZK 33:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 33:18" />Umugororotsi niyava mu nzira ziwe agakora icaha, azokizira. <verse eid="EZK 33:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 33:19" />Kandi umunyakibi niyava mu vyaha vyiwe, agakora ibitunganye n’ibigororotse, bizomubeshaho. <verse eid="EZK 33:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 33:20" />Ariko mwebwe Abisirayeli muravuga muti: ‘Inzira y’Imana ntigororotse.’ Ariko nzobacira urubanza yemwe Bisirayeli, umwe wese agererwe ibihwanye n’ivyo yakoze.”<verse eid="EZK 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Insiguro y’ingene Yerusalemu hazosenyuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 33:21" />Mu mwaka ugira icumi na kabiri turi mu kinyago, mu kwezi kw’icumi, ku musi ugira gatanu, hariho umuntu yahunze avuye i Yerusalemu, aza aho ndi, ambwira ati: “Igisagara carasenyutse!” <verse eid="EZK 33:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 33:22" />Ariko uwo muntu buca ashika, ukuboko kw’Uhoraho kwari kuri jewe, yugurura akanwa kanje imbere y’uko uwo muntu anshikira mu gitondo. Akanwa kanje karuguruka, sinaba ngisubira kuguma mu gacerere.<verse eid="EZK 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 33:23" />Maze ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> rimbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 33:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 33:24" />“Mwana w’umuntu, ababa mu bihomoke vyo muri ico gihugu ca Isirayeli bavuga bati: ‘Aburahamu yari umugabo umwe wenyene akaganza iki gihugu cose. Ariko twebwe turi benshi, kandi igihugu twaragihawe ngo tucegukire kibe icacu.’ <verse eid="EZK 33:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 33:25" />None rero genda ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ko murya inyama zikirimwo amaraso, mukarangamiza ibishushanyo, mugasesa amaraso, ico gihugu mwocegukira gute? <verse eid="EZK 33:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 33:26" />Mwishimira inkota zanyu, mugakora ibizira, umuntu wese agahumanya umugore wa mugenziwe. None mwokwegukira ico gihugu gute?’<verse eid="EZK 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 33:27" />Babwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, abasigaye mu bihomoke bazomarwa n’inkota, abari mu gihugu nzobaterera inyamaswa zibatabagure, abari mu mazu azitiriwe cane n’abari mu mazu yo mu kuzimu bazokwicwa n’icago. <verse eid="EZK 33:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 33:28" />Nzosiga igihugu ari agahinga, nkureho ivyizigiro vy’inkomezi zabo, kandi imisozi y’i Yerusalemu izosigara igaragara, nta n’uwuzosubira kuyicako. <verse eid="EZK 33:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 33:29" />Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ninamara gusiga igihugu kigaragara kubera ibizira bakoze.’<verse eid="EZK 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 33:30" />Na we mwana w’umuntu, abantu bo mu bwoko bwawe bariko barakuvuganako bari ku nzitiro no ku miryango y’amazu, umwe wese abwira mugenziwe ati: ‘Nimuze tuje kwumviriza ico <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> avuga.’ <verse eid="EZK 33:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 33:31" />Abantu banje nk’uko bama, baza bafise ishusho yo kwicisha bugufi, bakicara imbere yawe ngo bumvirize amajambo yawe, ariko ntibayakurikiza. Batuza akanwa kabo ukwiyegurira Imana, ariko imitima yabo yuzuyemwo urukundo rw’amahera. <verse eid="EZK 33:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 33:32" />Kuri bo, nta ho utaniye n’umuririmvyi aririmba indirimbo z’urukundo, afise akajwi karongorotse, azi no gucuraranga neza, kuko barumva amajambo yawe ariko ntibayakurikiza.<verse eid="EZK 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 33:33" />Igihe ivyo vyose n’ayo makuba bizobashikako, bazomenya ko higeze kuba umuvugishwa hagati muri bo.”<verse eid="EZK 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="EZK 34" />
  <para style="s1">
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> azoba umwungere wa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 34:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 34:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, burira abungere ba Isirayeli, ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Muragowe mwa bungere ba Isirayeli, mwebwe mwitaho ubuzima bwanyu gusa! Mbega umwungere ntiyari akwiye kwitwararika ibitungwa vyiwe? <verse eid="EZK 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 34:3" />Murya ibinure vyavyo, mukambara ubwoya bwavyo, mukabaga vyizavyiza gusumba ibindi, ariko mutavyitaho. <verse eid="EZK 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 34:4" />Ntimwafashije izifise intege nke gukomera, ngo muvure izigwaye canke ngo mwunge izavunitse. Ntimwagaruye izashwiragiye, canke ngo murondere izazimiye. <verse eid="EZK 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 34:5" />Zarashwiragiye kuko zabuze umwungere, hanyuma zicika ivyokurya vy’ibikoko. <verse eid="EZK 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 34:6" />Intama zanje zayerereye ku misozi no ku mitumba miremire. Zashwiragiriye kw’isi hose, kandi nta wagiye kuzirondera.<verse eid="EZK 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 34:7" />None rero, yemwe bungere, nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>: <verse eid="EZK 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 34:8" />Ni ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze, ko intama zanje zabuze umwungere, zikaba iminyago n’ivyokurya vy’ibikoko, kandi ko abungere batazirondeye ariko bakitaho ubuzima bwabo aho kwitwararika intama zanje, <verse eid="EZK 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 34:9" />nimwumve yemwe bungere ijambo ryanje jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>: <verse eid="EZK 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 34:10" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Nzogwanya abo bungere kandi nzobaharurako intama zanje. Nzobakura mw’ibango ryo kuragira intama zanje babure ico barya. Nzokiza intama zanje akanwa kabo, ntizizoba zikiba ivyokurya vyabo.<verse eid="EZK 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 34:11" />Kuko uku ari ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Nzokwironderera intama zanje ndaziragirire. <verse eid="EZK 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 34:12" />Nzozirondera nk’uko umwungere arondera intama zamuzimiranye. Nzozikiza ndazikuye ahantu hose zashwiragiriye ku musi w’ibipfungu n’umwijima. <verse eid="EZK 34:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 34:13" />Nzozizana ndazikuye mu mahanga, ndazegeranye ndazikuye mu bindi bihugu, ndazizane mu gihugu cazo. Nzoziragira ku misozi ya Isirayeli, ku nzuzi no mu mihana yose yo mu gihugu. <verse eid="EZK 34:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 34:14" />Nzoziragira mu bwatsi bwiza, n’imitumba miremire ya Isirayeli izoba uburagiro bwazo. Zizovyagira mu gihugu gitotahaye, zirishe ubwatsi bwiza bwo mu mitumba ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 34:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 34:15" />Jewe ubwanje ni jewe nzokwiragirira intama zanje, nongere ndazivyagize, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 34:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 34:16" />Nzorondera izatakaye, ngarure izazimiye.<verse eid="EZK 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 34:17" />Namwe busho bwanje, Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: nzoca urubanza hagati y’igitungwa n’ikindi, hagati y’impfizi y’intama n’impfizi y’impene. <verse eid="EZK 34:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 34:18" />Mbega ntimuhagijwe no kurisha mu buragiro bwiza? None muca muhonyanga n’ubwatsi busigaye? Mbega kunywa amazi meza ntibihagije? None ni ngombwa ngo mutobe ayasigaye? <verse eid="EZK 34:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 34:19" />None ubusho bwanje buzorya ubwatsi mwahonyanze, bunywe amazi mwatovye n’ibirenge vyanyu?’ ”<verse eid="EZK 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 34:20" />None rero uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji azibwiye: “Nzoca urubanza hagati y’izinamvye n’izivyibushe. <verse eid="EZK 34:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 34:21" />Kuko izivyubushe zasunuje ibitugu izinamvye, zikazisekesha amahembe yazo gushika zizisohoye hanze. <verse eid="EZK 34:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 34:22" />Nzorokora intama zanje, kandi ntizizosubira kunyagwa. Kandi nzocira urubanza intama n’iyindi. <verse eid="EZK 34:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 34:23" />Nzoziha umumwungere umwe, umusavyi wanje Dawidi, na we azoziragira; azoziragira abe umwungere wazo. <verse eid="EZK 34:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 34:24" />Jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nzoba Imana yazo, umusavyi wanje Dawidi na we azoba umuganwa muri zo. Ni jewe ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 34:25" />Nzogirana isezerano ry’amahoro na zo, nirukane ibikoko mu gihugu, kugira ngo zishobore kuba mu bugaragwa kandi ziryame mu mashamba zitekanye. <verse eid="EZK 34:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 34:26" />Nzozihezagira, mpezagire n’imitumba izikikuje. Nzozirungikira imvura mu gihe kibereye, imvura y’umugisha. <verse eid="EZK 34:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 34:27" />Ibiti vyo mu mirima bizokwama ivyamwa, isi na yo yeze ibiterwa; abantu bazoba amahoro mu gihugu cabo. Kandi bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ninamara kuvunagura ivyuma vy’ingogo zabo, nkabakiza mu maboko y’ababagize abagurano. <verse eid="EZK 34:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 34:28" />Ntibazosubira kunyagwa n’amahanga, kandi n’ibikoko ntibizosubira kubarya. Bazoba amahoro, kandi nta n’umwe azosubira kubatera ubwoba. <verse eid="EZK 34:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 34:29" />Nzobaha igihugu kizwi ko cimbuka cane, ntibazosubira kwicwa n’ikigoyi muri ico gihugu kandi nta gitutsi c’ayandi mahanga kizongera kubabako. <verse eid="EZK 34:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 34:30" />Ni ho bazomenyera ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo, ko ndi kumwe na bo, kandi ko Abisirayeli ari abantu banje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 34:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 34:31" />Yemwe busho bwanje, ntama zo mu buragiro bwanje, muri abantu banje, nanje ndi Imana yanyu, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.”<verse eid="EZK 34:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="EZK 35" />
  <para style="s1">Imburi kuri Edomu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 35:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 35:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 35:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, hindukira urabishe amaso ku musozi Seyiri, uvugishwe ibibi biherekeye, <verse eid="EZK 35:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 35:3" />uvuga uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nzokugwanya yewe wa musozi Seyiri, kandi nzokuramvurirako ukuboko kwanje, ndakurandure ndaguherengeteze. <verse eid="EZK 35:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 35:4" />Ibisagara vyawe nzobisiga ari imisaka, nawe usigare uri agahinga. Ni ho uzomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 35:5" />Ko mwagiriye urwanko rudashira Abisirayeli mu kabatanga ngo bamarwe n’inkota igihe bari bageze kugesezwa, uguhanwa kwabo kwuzuye, <verse eid="EZK 35:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 35:6" />ndabarahiye ukuri nk’ukubaho kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze, amaraso yawe azoseseka, kandi uguseseka kwayo kuzokwomako. Ko utagwanije ugusesa amaraso, uguseseka kw’ayawe kuzokwomako. <verse eid="EZK 35:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 35:7" />Umusozi Seyiri nzowusiga ugaragara, nice abagerageza guhunga hamwe n’abagaruka. <verse eid="EZK 35:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 35:8" />Imitumba yaho nzoyuzuza imivyimba; abishwe n’inkota bazogwa ku dusozi, mu biyaya no mu nzuzi. <verse eid="EZK 35:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 35:9" />Nzohagira umusaka ibihe vyose; ibisagara vyaho ntibizosubira kwubakwa. Ni ho bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 35:10" />Ko muvuga muti: Ibihugu vya Isirayeli na Yuda bizoba ivyacu kandi tuzovyegukira, naho <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ari ho ari, <verse eid="EZK 35:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 35:11" />none rero ndahiye ukubaho kwanje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze, nzobasubiriza mu nkoko ibihwanye n’ishavu n’akazikira mwerekanye mu rwanko mubanka, kandi nzokwimenyekanisha muri bo ninaguhana. <verse eid="EZK 35:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 35:12" />Ni ho muzomenyera ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> numvise ibitutsi mwatutse imisozi ya Isirayeli. Kuko mwibwiye muti: Yahindutse agahinga none twayihawe nk’indya ngo tuyishihagure. <verse eid="EZK 35:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 35:13" />Mwarampagurukiye mu majambo yanyu muntuka ubudahumeka, maze nanje ndavyumva. <verse eid="EZK 35:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 35:14" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Isi yose izonezerwa ninakurandura nkaguherengeteza. <verse eid="EZK 35:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 35:15" />Ko wahimbawe igihe amatongo ya Isirayeli yacika agahinga, uko ni ko nawe nzokugira. Uzosigara uri agahinga, yewe wa musozi Seyiri, hamwe na Edomu hose. Maze muzomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’<verse eid="EZK 35:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="EZK 36" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyizigiro vy’imisozi ya Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 36:1" />Mwana w’umuntu, vugishwa, ubwire imisozi ya Isirayeli uti: ‘Yemwe mwa misozi ya Isirayeli, nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 36:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 36:2" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Abansi banyu bavuze bati: Awa! Imitumba miremire yanyu ya kera yahindutse iyacu. <verse eid="EZK 36:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 36:3" />None rero vugishwa, ubabwire uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Kubera yuko babasanganguye bakabasya, bavuye impande zose, kugira ngo mube inyegu z’ayandi mahanga, kandi mube akabarore, muvugwe nabi, <verse eid="EZK 36:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 36:4" />nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, yemwe misozi ya Isirayeli: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji abariye imisozi n’udutumba, inzuzi n’ibiyaya, ahabaye imisaka n’ibisagara bitakibamwo abantu vyanyazwe bikicwa n’isoni kandi bigateterezwa n’ayandi mahanga abikikuje; <verse eid="EZK 36:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 36:5" />uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Mu burake bwanje bururumba nk’umuriro naravuze ngwanya ayandi mahanga, hamwe na Edomu, kubera mu gakengerwe kenshi karimwo umunezero w’intsinzi, bigaruriye igihugu canje bongera baragisahura ahari uburagiro hose. <verse eid="EZK 36:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 36:6" />None rero nuvugishwe ku gihugu ca Isirayeli, ubarire imisozi n’udutumba, inzuzi n’ibiyaya, uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Mvuganye uburake kuko mwateterejwe bikwiye imbere y’amahanga abakikuje. <verse eid="EZK 36:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 36:7" />Ni co gituma jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze nti: Ndahiye manitse ukuboko, ko ayo mahanga na yo azoremerwa n’ibiteterwe.<verse eid="EZK 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 36:8" />Ariko mwebwe, misozi ya Isirayeli, muzogira amashami, mwamire ivyamwa ubwoko bwa Isirayeli, kuko mu gihe gito bazotahuka i muhira. <verse eid="EZK 36:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 36:9" />Ehe ndabitwararitse kandi nzokwama ndabafasha. Muzorimwa mwongere mubibweko. <verse eid="EZK 36:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 36:10" />Nzogwiza abazobabako, ari bo Bisirayeli. Ibisagara bizosubira kugira ababibamwo, kandi amazu yasenyutse azosubira yubakwe. <verse eid="EZK 36:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 36:11" />Nzogwiza igitigiri c’abantu bazokubako n’ibitungwa bizokubako, bigwire bibe vyinshi cane. Nzozana abantu bababeko nka mbere. Ni ho muzomenyera ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. <verse eid="EZK 36:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 36:12" />Nzotuma abantu banje, abantu banje b’Abisirayeli bababako. Muzobegukira, mube iragi ryabo; ntimuzosubira kumiragura abana babo.<verse eid="EZK 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 36:13" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Ko ayandi mahanga yagutwenze avuga ati: “Wamiraguye abantu bawe, igihugu cawe ukimarirako abana baco,” <verse eid="EZK 36:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 36:14" />ntuzosubira kumiragura abantu b’igihugu cawe canke ngo ukimarireko abana baco, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 36:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 36:15" />Sinzosubira kwemera ko ayandi mahanga agucokora, kandi nta mahanga azosubira kugutuka, kandi ihanga ryawe sinzosubira kurigwisha, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imana isezerana kuzonagura Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 36:16" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 36:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 36:17" />“Mwana w’umuntu, igihe Abisirayeli bari bakiba mu gihugu cabo, bihumanishije ibikorwa vyabo bibi. Ingeso zabo zari zimereye nk’uguhumana kw’umugore ari mu mihango. <verse eid="EZK 36:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 36:18" />Vyatumye ndabasukako uburake bwanje kuko bari basheshe amaraso mu gihugu, bongera bagihumanisha ibigirwamana vyabo. <verse eid="EZK 36:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 36:19" />Nabashwiragirije mu mahanga, basabagirira mu bihugu vyose; nabahanye ibihwanye n’ingeso zabo n’ibikorwa vyabo. <verse eid="EZK 36:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 36:20" />Kandi mu bihugu vyose bagiyemwo, batukishije izina ryanje, kuko abababona bavuga bati: ‘Aba bantu bitirirwa <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ariko bataye igihugu ciwe.’ <verse eid="EZK 36:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 36:21" />Ariko nitwararitse izina ryanje ryera, iryo Abisirayeli bononye mu mahanga bagiyemwo.<verse eid="EZK 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 36:22" />None rero bwira Abisirayeli uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Si ku bwanyu ngiye gukora ivyo, yemwe Bisirayeli, ahubwo ni ku bw’izina ryanje ryera, iryo mwahumanirije mu mahanga mwashwiragiriyemwo. <verse eid="EZK 36:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 36:23" />Nzokwerekana ukwera kw’izina ryanje rihambaye, iryo mwahumanirije mu yandi mahanga. Kandi ninagaragaza ukwera kwanje imbere yabo ndabicishije kuri mwebwe, bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 36:24" />Kuko nzobakura muri ayo mahanga, ndabegeranye ndabakuye mu bihugu vyose, ndabagarukane mu gihugu canyu. <verse eid="EZK 36:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 36:25" />Nzobamijako amazi meza, namwe muzokwezwa; nzobakurako imyanda yose, ndabakuremwo n’ibigirwamana vyanyu vyose. <verse eid="EZK 36:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 36:26" />Nzobaha umutima mushasha, ndabashiremwo n’impwemu nshasha; nzobakuramwo umutima w’ibuye, ndabahe umutima w’inyama. <verse eid="EZK 36:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 36:27" />Nzobashiramwo impwemu nshasha, ntume mukurikiza ivyo nashinze, mwitondere n’ivyagezwe vyanje. <verse eid="EZK 36:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 36:28" />Muzoba mu gihugu nahaye ba sogokuruza banyu; muzoba abantu banje, nanje nzoba Imana yanyu. <verse eid="EZK 36:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 36:29" />Nzobakiza uguhumana kwose. Nzobaha umwimbu mwinshi, nzobarinda inzara mu gihugu. <verse eid="EZK 36:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 36:30" />Nzogwiza ivyamwa ku biti, n’ivyimburwa mu matongo, kugira ngo ntimuzosubire kumaramara mu yandi mahanga kubera inzara. <verse eid="EZK 36:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 36:31" />Maze muzokwibuka ingeso zanyu mbi n’ivyaha mwakoze, mumaramazwe n’ibizira mwakoze. <verse eid="EZK 36:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 36:32" />Ariko mumenye neza ko ntagiye gukora ivyo ku bwanyu, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. Nimumaramazwe n’ingeso zanyu, yemwe Bisirayeli!<verse eid="EZK 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 36:33" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Ku musi nzoberezako ivyaha vyanyu vyose, nzobasubiza mu bisagara vyanyu, n’amazu yasenyutse azosubira yubakwe. <verse eid="EZK 36:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 36:34" />Ahari harabaye agahinga hazorimwa kugira ngo hoye kuguma gutyo mu maso y’abahita. <verse eid="EZK 36:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 36:35" />Bazovuga bati: “Iki gihugu cahora ari agahinga none cahindutse itongo rya Edeni; ibisagara vyahora ari imisaka, ata wubibamwo, vyarasambutse, ubu vyarubakiwe inzitiro zikomeye, kandi abantu barabibamwo.” <verse eid="EZK 36:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 36:36" />Maze amahanga azoba asigaye abakikuje azomenya ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> yubatse ivyari vyarasambuwe, agasibura ahari harasivye. Ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabivuze, kandi nzobikora.’<verse eid="EZK 36:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 36:37" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Nzosubira nemerere Abisirayeli bansabe, nanje nzobakorera ivyo bazonsaba. Nzobagwiza bangane n’ubusho bw’intama, <verse eid="EZK 36:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 36:38" />bangane n’imikuku yashikanwa i Yerusalemu mu gihe c’imisi mikuru. Ibisagara vyabaye imisaka bizosubira vyuzuremwo ubusho bw’abantu. Ni ho bazomenyera ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.”<verse eid="EZK 36:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="EZK 37" />
  <para style="s1">Ezekiyeli yerekwa ikiyaya c’amagufa yumye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 37:1" />Ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuramfata, kunsohokana hanze ndi muri Mpwemu w’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, anshira hagati mu kiyaya cari cuzuye amagufa. <verse eid="EZK 37:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 37:2" />Antembereza muri ayo magufa, mbona ari menshi cane yandagaye muri ico kiyaya, kandi yari yumye cane. <verse eid="EZK 37:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 37:3" />Arambaza ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, mbega aya magufa yosubira akavamwo abantu bazima?” Ndamwishura nti: “<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji, ni wewe wenyene wobimenya.”<verse eid="EZK 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 37:4" />Maze arambarira ati: “Vugishwa kuri ayo magufa uyabwire uti: ‘Mwa magufa yumye mwe, nimwumve ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>! <verse eid="EZK 37:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 37:5" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji abwiye mwebwe amagufa yumye ati: Ngiye kubahumekeramwo impwemu, maze nsubire ndabagire bazima. <verse eid="EZK 37:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 37:6" />Ngiye kubashirako imitsi n’inyama hanyuma ndabarenzeko umubiri; ndabahumekeremwo, maze namwe mube bazima. Ni ho muzomenyera ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 37:7" />Maze ndavugishwa nk’uko mbwiwe kubikora. Nkiriko ndavuga ayo majambo, numva urwamo, hamwe n’ijwi ry’ugusekana, ya magufa ariko aregerana, rimwerimwe ryegerana na rigenzi raryo. <verse eid="EZK 37:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 37:8" />Ngize gutya mbona imitsi n’inyama biyajeko, umubiri na wo uraza urayapfuka, ariko nta mpwemu zari bwayajemwo.<verse eid="EZK 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 37:9" />Maze arambwira ati: “Vugishwa, ubwire impwemu, vugishwa, mwana w’umuntu uzibwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Yemwe mwa mpwemu mwe, nimuze, muzanane impande zine, muhuhe muri bano bishwe kugira ngo babe bazima.’ ” <verse eid="EZK 37:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 37:10" />Nuko mvugishwa nk’uko mbwiwe, impwemu zinjira muri bo; baca baba bazima, bahagarara ku maguru yabo: baba isinzi ry’ingabo.<verse eid="EZK 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 37:11" />Maze arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, ayo magufa yumye ni Abisirayeli bose. Bavuga bati: ‘Amagufa yacu yarumye, twarataye ivyizigiro; ihanga ryacu ryarazimanganye.’ <verse eid="EZK 37:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 37:12" />None rero babwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Yemwe bwoko bwanje, ngiye kwugurura imva zanyu ndabakureyo, ndabagarukane mu gihugu ca Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 37:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 37:13" />Maze, mwebwe abantu banje, muzomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, igihe nzoba nuguruye imva zanyu nkabazura ndabakuye muri zo. <verse eid="EZK 37:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 37:14" />Nzobashiramwo Mpwemu wanje kugira ngo mubeho, nanje nzobashira mu gihugu canyu. Maze muzomenya ko ari jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nabivuze, nkongera nkabishitsa, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ihanga rimwe rizogira umwami umwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 37:15" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 37:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 37:16" />“Mwana w’umuntu, fata inkoni uyandikeko uti: ‘Ni iya Yuda n’Abisirayeli bifatanije na we.’ Uce ufata iyindi, uyandikeko uti: ‘Ni iya Yosefu, inkoni ya Efurayimu, hamwe n’Abisirayeli bose bifatanije na we.’ <verse eid="EZK 37:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 37:17" />Hanyuma uzifatanye zibe inkoni imwe mu kiganza cawe.<verse eid="EZK 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 37:18" />Maze abantu bo mu bwoko bwawe nibakubwira bati: ‘Tubwire ivyo ugize ico bisigura,’ <verse eid="EZK 37:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 37:19" />uze ubabwire uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ngiye gufata inkoni ya Yosefu iri mu kuboko kwa Efurayimu n’imiryango ya Isirayeli yifatanije na we, ndayifatanye n’inkoni ya Yuda, zihinduke imwe mu kiganza canje.’ <verse eid="EZK 37:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 37:20" />Izo nkoni wanditseko uzifatire mu biganza vyawe babona, <verse eid="EZK 37:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 37:21" />uheze uvuge uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nzokura Abisirayeli mu mahanga basabagiriyemwo. Nzobegeraniriza hamwe ndabagarukane mu gihugu cabo. <verse eid="EZK 37:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 37:22" />Nzobagira ihanga rimwe mu gihugu cabo, ku mitumba ya Isirayeli. Bazoganzwa n’umwami umwe, kandi ntibazokwongera kuba amahanga abiri, canke ngo bagaburwemwo ubwami bubiri. <verse eid="EZK 37:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 37:23" />Ntibazosubira kwihumanisha ibigirwamana n’ibishushanyo, canke ibindi vyaha vyabo, kuko nzobakiza ivyaha vyabo vyose, nongere ndabeze. Bazoba abantu banje, nanje nzoba Imana yabo.<verse eid="EZK 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 37:24" />Umusavyi wanje Dawidi azoba umwami wabo, kandi bazogira umwungere umwe. Bazokurikiza ivyagezwe vyanje, bagendere mu mabwirizwa yanje. <verse eid="EZK 37:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 37:25" />Bazoba mu gihugu nahaye umusavyi wanje Yakobo, igihugu ba sogokuruza babayemwo. Bo n’abuzukuruza babo bazokibamwo ibihe vyose, kandi umusavyi wanje Dawidi azoba umuganwa wabo ibihe bidashira. <verse eid="EZK 37:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 37:26" />Nzogirana na bo isezerano ry’amahoro; rizoba isezerano ry’intahava. Nzobashira mu gihugu, ndabagwize, nongere ndabubakemwo Ingoro yanje y’ibihe vyose. <verse eid="EZK 37:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 37:27" />Ingoro yanje izoba muri bo; nzoba Imana yabo, na bo bazoba abantu banje. <verse eid="EZK 37:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 37:28" />Maze ninamara kububa Ingoro yanje y’ibihe vyose hagati muri bo, amahanga azomenya ko ari jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> natoranije Isirayeli ngo babe abera.”<verse eid="EZK 37:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="EZK 38" />
  <para style="s1">Intsinzi ihambaye y’Uhoraho ku mahanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 38:1" />Ijambo ry’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ryongera kumbwira riti: <verse eid="EZK 38:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 38:2" />“Mwana w’umuntu, hanga amaso yawe i Gogi, ho mu gihugu ca Magogi, umutware mukuru wa Mesheki na Tubali. <verse eid="EZK 38:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 38:3" />Uvuge uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nzokugwanya yewe Gogi, umuganwa mukuru wa Mesheki na Tubali. <verse eid="EZK 38:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 38:4" />Nzogucuranguza, ndagutere igera mu mibangabanga ndagusohore uri kumwe n’ingabo zawe zose; amafarasi yawe, abayagenderako bafise ibigwanisho, biteguriye intambara, hamwe n’amasinzi y’ingabo zitwaje inkinzo nininini na ntonto, bose babanguye inkota. <verse eid="EZK 38:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 38:5" />Ubuperesi, Etiyopiya na Puti vyose bizokwifatanya na we, bose baze bafise inkinzo n’inkofero z’ivyuma ku mitwe, <verse eid="EZK 38:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 38:6" />nayo Gomeri hamwe n’ingabo ziwe bazokwifatanya nawe, hamwe na Beti h’i Togaruma bavuye kure mu buraruko n’ingabo zabo zose, eka amahanga menshi azokwifatanya nawe.<verse eid="EZK 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 38:7" />Nuko rero ikazanure; witegure, mwe n’ingabo zose zifatanije nawe, kandi uzibere umukuru. <verse eid="EZK 38:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 38:8" />Inyuma y’igihe kirekire uzohamagarirwa kuja ku rugamba. Mu myaka izoza uzotera igihugu cigeze guca mu ntambara, abantu baco begeranijwe bava mu mahanga menshi, bazanwa mu misozi ya Isirayeli, yari imaze igihe kinini igaragara. Baje bakuwe mu mahanga, ubu bose bakaba bahabaye impore. <verse eid="EZK 38:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 38:9" />Nawe uzodugana n’ingabo zawe muri kumwe n’amahanga menshi, ugende kurya kw’igihuhusi; muzoba mumeze nk’igipfungu gipfutse isi.<verse eid="EZK 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 38:10" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Kuri uwo musi ivyiyumviro bizokuza mu mutwe, maze utegure imigambi y’ikibi. <verse eid="EZK 38:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 38:11" />Uzokwibwira uti: “Reka ngire igitero kuri ico gihugu kitazitiye; nzotera ubu bwoko butekanye ata co bwinona, bose biberaho batagira inzitiro, ata marembo n’ivyugazo. <verse eid="EZK 38:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 38:12" />Nzohakura iminyago, ndabasahure. Nzoramvurira ukuboko kwanje ahahoze ari umusaka, no ku bantu begeranijwe bavuye mu mahanga menshi, bafise ibitungwa n’ubundi butunzi, baba hagati na hagati mu gihugu.” <verse eid="EZK 38:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 38:13" />Sheba na Dedani n’abadandaza b’i Tarushishi hamwe n’imihana ihakikuje, bazokubaza bati: Mbega wazanywe no gusahura? Wakoranije amasinzi y’ingabo zawe ngo muze gusahura no kunyaga ifeza n’inzahabu, kwiba ibitungwa hamwe n’ayandi matungo, musahure n’iyindi minyago myinshi?’<verse eid="EZK 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 38:14" />None rero, mwana w’umuntu, vugishwa kuri Gogi uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Kuri uwo musi, igihe ubwoko bwanje bwa Isirayeli buzoba butekanye, mbega ntuzobimenya? <verse eid="EZK 38:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 38:15" />Maze uzoca uza uvuye mu gihugu cawe ca kure mu buraruko, uzananye n’ayandi mahanga menshi, bose baze bagendera ku mafarasi, ari igitero c’ingabo isinzi kandi zikomeye. <verse eid="EZK 38:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 38:16" />Muzotera abantu banje ba Isirayeli, mumeze ng’igipfungu gipfutse isi. Yewe Gogi, mu gihe kigiye kuza nzokuzana utere igihugu canje, kugira ngo amahanga yose azobone ingene ndakwerekanirako ko ndi uwera mu maso yabo.<verse eid="EZK 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 38:17" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Mbega si wewe nari naravuzeko mu misi ya kera nciye ku bavugishwa ba Isirayeli? Bavugishijwe imyaka myinshi ko nzokuzana kubatera. <verse eid="EZK 38:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 38:18" />Ng’ibi ibizoba kuri uwo musi: Gogi niyatera igihugu ca Isirayeli, uburake bwanje bw’inkazi buzoziriringa, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 38:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 38:19" />Mu burake no mu bushangashirwe, ndabamenyesheje ko hazoba ugutigita kw’isi gukomeye mu gihugu ca Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 38:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 38:20" />Amafi yo mu biyaga, ibisiga vyo mu kirere, ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba, ivyikwega hasi vyose, hamwe n’abantu bo kw’isi bose bizohinda agashitsi imbere yanje. <verse eid="EZK 38:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 38:21" />Nzohamagaza inkota kuri Gogi ku misozi yanje yose, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. Umuntu wese azohindukiririza inkota kuri mugenziwe. <verse eid="EZK 38:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 38:22" />Nzobashitsako igihano canje mu kubatera icago c’akaranda n’ico gusesa amaraso; nzobacuncuburirako imvura y’isegenya, ivanze n’urubura n’amazuku, wewe n’ingabo zawe hamwe n’amahanga yose azoba yifatanije nawe. <verse eid="EZK 38:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 38:23" />Uko ni ko nzokwerekana ubukuru bwanje n’ukwera kwanje, kandi nzokwimenyekanisha imbere y’amahanga menshi. Ni ho bazomenyera ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 38:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="EZK 39" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 39:1" />“Mwana w’umuntu, vugishwa kuri Gogi uti: ‘Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ngiye kukugwanya yewe Gogi, umutware mukuru w’i Mesheki n’i Tubali. <verse eid="EZK 39:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 39:2" />Nzoguhindukiza ndagukwege, ndakuzane ngukuye kure mu buraruko, nkurungike ku misozi ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 39:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 39:3" />Nzovunagura umuheto wawe uri mu kuboko kw’ukubamfu, imyampi ikoragurike iva mu kuboko kw’i buryo. <verse eid="EZK 39:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 39:4" />Muzogwa ku misozi ya Isirayeli, mwe n’ingabo zawe n’amahanga yose. Nzobagaburira ibisiga n’ibikoko vyo mw’ishamba bibarye. <verse eid="EZK 39:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 39:5" />Muzogwa mu gahinga, kuko ari ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 39:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 39:6" />Nzokororera umuriro kuri Magogi hamwe no ku bantu bibereye impore mu mazinga, ni ho bazomenya ko jewe ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 39:7" />Izina ryanje nzorigira Rurangiranwa mu Bisirayeli. Sinzokwemera ko izina ryanje risubira gutukwa, kandi amahanga azomenya ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ndi Uwera wa Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 39:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 39:8" />Ivyo birashitse! Nta kabuza bizoba, ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze. Uwo ni wo musi nari naravuze.<verse eid="EZK 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 39:9" />Maze ababa mu bisagara vya Isirayeli bazosohoka begeranye ibigwanisho vyabo babikoreshe nk’inkwi: uri inkinzo ntonto na nininini, imiheto n’imyampi, inkoni n’amacumu. Bazobicana imyaka indwi. <verse eid="EZK 39:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 39:10" />Ntibazosubira kuja gusenya canke ngo bicire ibiti mw’ishamba, kuko bazokoresha ivyo bigwanisho nk’inkwi. Bazonyaga abari barigeze kubanyaga, basahure abigeze kubasahura, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 39:11" />Uwo musi Gogi nzomwimbira imva muri Isirayeli, mu kiyaya kirimwo inzira y’abava mu Buseruko baja ku Kiyaga. Iyo mva izozibira inzira y’abarengana, kuko Gogi n’amasinzi y’ingabo ziwe bazohambwa aho. Hazokwitwa Ikiyaya ca Hamoni Gogi.<verse eid="EZK 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 39:12" />Abisirayeli bazomara amezi indwi babahamba, kugira ngo basukure igihugu cabo. <verse eid="EZK 39:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 39:13" />Abantu bose muri Isirayeli bazokoranira kubahamba, kandi uwo musi nzokwerekanirako icubahiro canje uzoba umusi w’intibagirwa, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 39:14" />Abantu bazohabwa igikorwa co kuguma basukura igihugu. Bazoguma banyuragirana mu gihugu, hanyuma bari kumwe n’abandi, bazohamba imivyimba yandagaye hasi. <verse eid="EZK 39:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 39:15" />Abo bantu bazonyuragira mu gihugu, aho bazobona ibisigarira vy’umuntu hose bahashire ikimeyetso kugira ngo abahamba bazobahambe mu kiyaya ca Hamoni Gogi. <verse eid="EZK 39:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 39:16" />Hazobaho n’igisagara citwa Hamona, bisigura “amasinzi”. Uko ni ko bazohumanura ico gihugu.<verse eid="EZK 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 39:17" />Mwana w’umuntu, uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Hamagara ibisiga vyose vyo mu kirere n’ibikoko vyose vyo mw’ishamba, ubibwire uti: Nimukorane muvuye mu mihingo yose, muze ku kimazi nabateguriye, ikimazi gihambaye kiri ku misozi ya Isirayeli. Muzoriraho inyama munywereho n’amaraso. <verse eid="EZK 39:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 39:18" />Muzorya inyama z’abagabo bahambaye, munywe n’amaraso y’abatware b’isi nk’aho ari amapfizi y’intama canke imyagazi y’intama, impene canke amapfizi y’inka vyororewe i Bashani. <verse eid="EZK 39:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 39:19" />Kuri ico kimazi ndiko ndabategurira, muzorya inyama zibaduhire, mwongere munywe amaraso gushika muborerwe. <verse eid="EZK 39:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 39:20" />Kuri ayo mazimano nzobaha, muzohaga inyama z’amafarasi n’abayagenderako, abahizi hamwe n’ingabo z’ubwoko bwose, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 39:21" />Nzokwerekana icubahiro canje ku mahanga, kandi abantu bose bazobona uguhana kwanje, babone n’ububasha naberekanyeko. <verse eid="EZK 39:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 39:22" />Uhereye uwo musi, Abisirayeli bazomenya ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo. <verse eid="EZK 39:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 39:23" />Kandi amahanga azomenya ko ubwoko bwa Isirayeli bwigeze gutwarwa mu kinyago kuko bancumuyeko. Vyatumye ndabanyegeza mu nyonga hanje, ndabarekurira mu maboko y’abansi babo, babamarisha inkota. <verse eid="EZK 39:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 39:24" />Nabishuye ibihwanye n’ukwononekara kwabo hamwe n’ivyaha vyabo, maze ndabanyegeza mu nyonga hanje.<verse eid="EZK 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 39:25" />None rero uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Ngiye gukura Yakobo mu kinyago, ngirire impuhwe ubwoko bwose bwa Isirayeli, kandi nzogirira ipfuhe izina ryanje ryera. <verse eid="EZK 39:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 39:26" />Bazokwibagira ibimaramare n’isoni, no kubura ubwizigirwa mu vyo bankoreye, igihe baba ata nkomanzi mu gihugu cabo ata wubatera ubwoba. <verse eid="EZK 39:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 39:27" />Ninamara kubagarukana ndabakuye mu mahanga, nkabegeranya ndabakuye mu bihugu vy’abansi babo, nzokwerekana ukwera kwanje nciye kuri bo imbere y’amahanga menshi. <verse eid="EZK 39:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 39:28" />Ni ho bazomenyera ko ndi <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana yabo, kuko n’aho nabarungitse mu kinyago mu yandi mahanga, nzobegeraniriza mu gihugu cabo, ata n’umwe nsize inyuma. <verse eid="EZK 39:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 39:29" />Sinzoba nkibanyegeza mu nyonga hanje, kuko nzosuka Mpwemu wanje ku Bisirayeli, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 39:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="EZK 40" />
  <para style="s1">Ikibanza c’Ingoro kizosubira gutunganywa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 40:1" />Mu mwaka ugira mirongo ibiri na gatanu turi mu kinyago, mu ntango z’umwaka, ku musi w’icumi w’ukwezi, hari mu mwaka ugira icumi na kane igisagara ca Yerusalemu gisenyutse, uwo musi ukuboko kw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> kuza kuri jewe, anjana muri ico gisagara. <verse eid="EZK 40:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 40:2" />Ndiko nderekwa, Imana injana mu gihugu ca Isirayeli, impagarika ku musozi muremure, ku ruhande rwo hepfo yawo hari amazu yubatse nk’igisagara. <verse eid="EZK 40:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 40:3" />Anjanayo, maze mbona umuntu yari afise ishusho ikayangana imeze nk’umwakaka; yari ahagaze mw’irembo ry’igisagara, afise umukanda wera, afise n’inkoni yo gupima mu kuboko kwiwe. <verse eid="EZK 40:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 40:4" />Wa muntu arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, raba neza, wongere utege amatwi cane, ushire umutima ku vyo ngira nkwereke, kuko ni co catumye uzanwa hano. Maze uzobwire Abisirayeli ivyo uja kubona vyose.”<verse eid="EZK 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Irembo ryo mu Buseruko amaja mu rugo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 40:5" />Ngize gutya mbona uruhome rukikuje ahari Ingoro hose. Wa muntu afata ya nkoni yiwe yo gupima, yari ifise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 3,2.</char></note>, apima rwa ruhome, rwari rufise ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe y’uburebure bw’igihagararo n’imetero zitatu z’ubwaguke.<verse eid="EZK 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 40:6" />Hanyuma aja kw’irembo riraba mu buseruko. Yurira ku ngazi apima igishimaryango caco, <verse eid="EZK 40:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 40:7" />icumba c’abateramyi bo kuri iryo rembo cari gifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,7.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’amakika, imetero zitatu z’uburebure bw’igihagararo, n’imetero zitatu z’ubwaguke.<verse eid="EZK 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 40:8" />Yongera apima icumba co kw’irembo. <verse eid="EZK 40:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 40:9" />Cari gifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko umunani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 4,2.</char></note> z’uburebure uhereye ku rwinjiriro, kandi kuva ku rwinjiriro gushika ku ruhome cari gifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1.</char></note>. Icumba cari cegeranye n’irembo carabana n’Ingoro.<verse eid="EZK 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 40:10" />Imbere winjiye mw’irembo ryo mu buseruko, hari utwumba dutatudutatu ku mpande zose. Twose twarangana, kandi inkingi zatwo zose zarangana. <verse eid="EZK 40:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 40:11" />Agera ubwaguke bw’urwinjiriro, zari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 5,3.</char></note>, ariko imiryango y’urwinjiriro yari ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi na zitatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 6,9.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 40:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 40:12" />Imbere y’akumba kamwekamwe kose hari uruhome rufise ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe y’uburebure, kandi icumba cose cagira ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitandatu ku ruhande rwose, impande zarangana. <verse eid="EZK 40:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 40:13" />Maze apima irembo ahereye ku gisenge c’akumba kamwe, ahereza ku gisenge c’akandi, uburebure bwaho bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 13.</char></note> hagati y’amarembo arabana. <verse eid="EZK 40:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 40:14" />Apima n’icumba kiri ahakikujwe n’impome z’urugo rwo hanze y’Ingoro. Cari gifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 27.</char></note>. <verse eid="EZK 40:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 40:15" />Kuva ku rwinjiriro rwo kw’irembo gushika ku rwinjiriro rw’inzu hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 27.</char></note>. <verse eid="EZK 40:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 40:16" />Hari amadirisha ariko ivyuma yari ku mpande zo ku nyubakwa zose, no kuri twa twumba two ku rwinjiriro, no ku mpome zidutandukanya. Ayo madirisha yari no ku mpome z’ivyumba vyo mu nzu. Izo mpome zari zisharijwe n’amashami y’ibigazi akorogoshowe ku nkingi yose.<verse eid="EZK 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Mu kigo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 40:17" />Wa muntu anjana mu rugo rw’inyuma y’Ingoro, ndahasanga utwumba n’imbuga ishashemwo amabuye, utwo twumba twari mirongo itatu, twubakiye ku ruhome rw’inyuma, dukikuje ku rugo impande zose. <verse eid="EZK 40:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 40:18" />Ku mpande z’amarembo ni ho iyo mbuga ishashemwo amabuye yari iri, ihuye n’uburebure bw’amarembo. Iyo ni imbuga yo hepfo. <verse eid="EZK 40:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 40:19" />Maze apima ubwaguke kuva imbere y’irembo rija hanze n’iry’imbere, hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 53.</char></note>, uko ari habiri, ku ruhande rwo mu buseruko no ku rwo mu buraruko.<verse eid="EZK 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Irembo ryo mu Buraruko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 40:20" />Apima n’uburebure bw’irembo riraba mu buraruko, rija ku mbuga yo hanze, apima n’ubwaguke bwaryo. <verse eid="EZK 40:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 40:21" />Utwumba two kuri ryo twari dutatudutatu ku ruhande rumwerumwe. Ibikingi vyaryo n’amabaraza yaryo vyarareha n’ivya rya rembo rya mbere. Irembo ryo mu buraruko ryari rifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 23.</char></note> z’uburebure n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 11,5.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 40:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 40:22" />Amadirisha yo kuri ryo, n’amabaraza hamwe n’ibigazi vyari bihasharije vyanganya uburebure n’ivyo kuri rya rembo ry’aharabana no mu buseruko. Bajayo baciye aho buririra hari hafise amatambwe indwi, baja no ku mabaraza arabana na ryo. <verse eid="EZK 40:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 40:23" />Irembo ry’aharabana no mu buraruko n’iry’aharabana no mu buseruko yarabana n’amarembo y’urugo rw’imbere. Apima ahaherereye kw’irembo rimwe gushika ku rindi, hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 45.</char></note>.<verse eid="EZK 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Irembo ryo mu Bumanuko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 40:24" />Maze anjana ahaherereye mu bumanuko, mbona irembo rija mu bumanuko. Apima ibikingi vyaryo n’amabaraza yaryo. Vyari bifise uburinganire nk’ivya mbere. <verse eid="EZK 40:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 40:25" />Ryari rifise amadirisha co kimwe n’amabaraza yo kuri ryo, ahakikije ameze nk’amwe ya mbere. Uburebure bwaryo bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 23.</char></note>, n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri na zitanu z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 40:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 40:26" />Mu kuhashika umuntu yaca ku ngazi y’amatambwe indwi, kandi amabaraza yo kuri ryo, yararabana na ryo; ryari risharijwe n’ibigazi ku mpome zo ku mpande zose. <verse eid="EZK 40:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 40:27" />Urugo rw’imbere na rwo nyene rwari rufise irembo riraba mu bumanuko, apima kuva kuri iryo rembo gushika ku rindi ry’urugo rw’inyuma, hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 45.</char></note>.<verse eid="EZK 40:27" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Amarembo yo mu kigo c’imbere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 40:28" />Hanyuma anjana mu rugo rw’imbere, ancishije mw’irembo riraba mu bumanuko, apima iryo rembo; ryangana n’ayandi marembo. <verse eid="EZK 40:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 40:29" />Utwumba, impome hamwe n’ibaraza vyaryo vyari bifise uburinganire bungana n’ubw’ivya mbere. Irembo hamwe n’ibaraza vyaho vyari bifise amadirisha impande zose. Irembo ryari rifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 23.</char></note> z’uburebure na mirongo ibiri na zitanu z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 40:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 40:30" />Amabaraza yari ahakikuje yari afise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 11,5.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’amakika na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:30 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 40:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 40:31" />Ayo mabaraza yaraba ku rugo rw’inyuma; impome zayo zari zisharijwe n’ibigazi, mu kuhashika umuntu yaca ku ngazi y’amatambwe indwi.<verse eid="EZK 40:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 40:32" />Maze antwara mu rugo rw’imbere ahaherereye mu buseruko, apima irembo ryaho. Ryari rifise uburinganire nk’ayandi marembo. <verse eid="EZK 40:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 40:33" />Utwumba, impome hamwe n’ibaraza vyaryo vyari bifise uburinganire bungana n’ubw’ivya mbere. Irembo hamwe n’ibaraza vyaho vyari bifise amadirisha impande zose. Irembo ryari rifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 23.</char></note> z’uburebure na mirongo ibiri na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 11,5.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 40:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 40:34" />Amabaraza yaryo yarabana n’ikigo c’inyuma; impome zose zari zisharijwe n’ibigazi, kandi mu kuhashika umuntu yurira ku ngazi y’amatambwe umunani.<verse eid="EZK 40:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 40:35" />Maze anjana kw’irembo rya ruguru, araripima. Ryari rifise uburinganire bungana n’ubw’ayandi marembo. <verse eid="EZK 40:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="EZK 40:36" />Utwumba, impome hamwe n’amabaraza na vyo nyene vyari bifise uburinganire bungana n’ubw’ahandi, kandi ryari rifise amadirisha impande zose. Iryo rembo ryari rifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 23.</char></note> z’uburebure na mirongo ibiri na zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 11,5.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 40:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="EZK 40:37" />Amabaraza yaryo yarabana n’ikigo c’inyuma; impome zose zari zisharijwe n’ibigazi kandi mu kuhashika umuntu yurira ku ngazi y’amatambwe umunani.<verse eid="EZK 40:37" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ivyumba vyo guteguriramwo ibimazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="EZK 40:38" />Hariho akumba kari gafise umuryango uri hagati y’inkingi z’irembo, aho bogereza ibimazi vyo guturirwa. <verse eid="EZK 40:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="EZK 40:39" />Mw’ibaraza ryo kuri iryo rembo hari hateretse imeza zibiri ku mpade zose, aho bacumitira ibimazi vyo guturirwa, ivy’ivyaha hamwe n’ivyo gukuraho urubanza. <verse eid="EZK 40:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="EZK 40:40" />Mu ruhande rumwerumwe ruherereye hanze, aho umuntu adugana mu guca mw’irembo riraba amaja mu buraruko, hari imeza zibirizibiri. <verse eid="EZK 40:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="EZK 40:41" />Zose hamwe zari imeza umunani, zine ku ruhande rumwe, zindi zine ku rundi. Ni ho ibimazi vyabagirwa, bigategurwa neza. <verse eid="EZK 40:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="EZK 40:42" />Hariho n’izindi meza zine zabajwe mu mabuye, zafasha mu gushikana ibimazi vyo guturira. Imwe yose yaba ifise ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe n’igice<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 68.</char></note> y’uburebure, n’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe n’igice y’ubwaguke, hamwe n’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 45.</char></note> y’igihagararo. Ni zo bashirako ivyo bakoresha mu gucumita ibimazi vyo guturirwa hamwe n’ibindi bimazi. <verse eid="EZK 40:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="EZK 40:43" />Imeza yose yaba ifise urubiga rungana n’ikiganza c’umuntu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:43 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 9.</char></note> mu burebure ruyizungurutse. Kuri izo meza ni ho bashira inyama z’ibimazi.<verse eid="EZK 40:43" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Ivyumba vy’abaherezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="EZK 40:44" />Inyuma y’irembo ry’imbere, mu rugo rw’imbere, hari utwumba tubiri, kamwe ku ruhande rwo haruguru karaba epfo, akandi ku ruhande rwo hepfo karaba ruguru. <verse eid="EZK 40:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="EZK 40:45" />Arambarira ati: “Akumba karaba epfo ni ak’abaherezi bajejwe Ingoro, <verse eid="EZK 40:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="EZK 40:46" />akaraba ruguru na ko ni ak’abaherezi bajejwe igicaniro. Abo ni abahungu ba Sadoki, akaba ari na bo Balewi bonyene bemerewe kwegera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> no kumukorera.”<verse eid="EZK 40:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="EZK 40:47" />Maze apima urugo; rwari rufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 45.</char></note> ku ruhande rwose kandi impande zose zarangana. Nongera mbona igicaniro cari imbere y’Ingoro.<verse eid="EZK 40:47" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ingoro nshasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="EZK 40:48" />Aca anjana mw’ibaraza ry’Ingoro, apima uburebure bw’inkingi. Zari zifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,3.</char></note> z’ubwaguke ku ruhande rumwerumwe. Ubwaguke bw’urwinjiriro bwari nk’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi na zine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 7,4.</char></note> kandi impome na zo zari zifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1,6.</char></note>. <verse eid="EZK 40:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="EZK 40:49" />Uburebure bw’amakika bw’ibaraza bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 11.</char></note>, n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi na zibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">40:49 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 6,4.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. Umuntu yarishikako aciye ku ngazi, kandi irembo ryari rishigikiwe n’inkingi, imwe ku ruhande rumwe, iyindi ku rundi.<verse eid="EZK 40:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="EZK 41" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 41:1" />Hanyuma wa muntu anjana mu cumba gikuru c’Ingoro, apima impome zari ku mpande zompi z’inzira yaja muri ico cumba: zapima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 3,2.</char></note> z’ubwaguke, <verse eid="EZK 41:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 41:2" />n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 5,3.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’amakika, hamwe n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,7.</char></note> kuva ku ruhome rumwe gushika ku rundi. Iyo Ngoro yari ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ine z’uburebure bw’amakika, n’ubwaguke bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 21 z’uburebure n’imetero 11 z’ubwaguke.</char></note>.<verse eid="EZK 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 41:3" />Maze yinjira mu cumba co haruguru, apima inkingi z’umuryango; imwimwe yose yari ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1,1.</char></note> z’ubwaguke, n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 3,2.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’amakika, kandi uburebure bwo kuva ku muryango gushika ku zindi mpome bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko indwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 3,7.</char></note>. <verse eid="EZK 41:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 41:4" />Apima ubwaguke bw’ico cumba c’imbere, asanga kingana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 11.</char></note> ku ruhande rwose kandi impande zose zarangana. Maze aca ambarira ati: “Aha ni Ahera Cane.”<verse eid="EZK 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 41:5" />Yongera apima uruhome rw’Ingoro, asanga rupima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 3,2.</char></note> z’ubwaguke, utwumba tw’ububiko twari dufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,1.</char></note> z’ubwaguke, dukikuje urusengero impande zose. <verse eid="EZK 41:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 41:6" />Kandi utwo twumba two ku ruhande twari tugerekeranye ku buryo tuba amagorofa atatu, umurongo wose uriko utwumba mirongo itatu. Impome zatwo zari zegeranye n’uruhome rw’inyuma rw’Ingoro ariko zikikuje impande zose z’Ingoro, kugira ngo ntitwegamire kuri rwo. <verse eid="EZK 41:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 41:7" />Utwo twumba twari dukikuje Ingoro, uko twari tugerekeranye ni ko twarutana. Inyubako ikikuje urusengero yari yubatswe mu buryo igenda iraduga, ku buryo utwo twumba twagenda twaguka uko umuntu aduga. Hariho ingazi iyo uriko uraduga ujana igenda iduga kandi izunguruka ikikuje urusengero, mu kuja mu twumba two hejuru ugaca mu two hagati.<verse eid="EZK 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 41:8" />Hanyuma mbona ko iyo ngoro ifise urufatiro rurenze gatoya ku ruhome, rukaba n’urufatiro rwo ku ruhande rw’utwo twumba. Uburebure bw’igihagararo bw’urwo rufatiro rwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitandatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 3,2.</char></note>. <verse eid="EZK 41:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 41:9" />Ubwaguke bw’urwo ruhome rw’inyuma rwariko utwo twumba bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,7.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. Umwanya wasigara hagati y’utwo twumba two ku ruhande <verse eid="EZK 41:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 41:10" />n’utwumba tw’abaherezi wari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 11.</char></note> z’ubwaguke uzungurutse urusengero. <verse eid="EZK 41:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 41:11" />Imiryango y’utwo twumba yari iraba ku mbuga, umuryango umwe uraba mu buraruko, uwundi uraba mu bumanuko. Ahari hatubatse hagati y’amazu hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,7.</char></note> z’ubwaguke.<verse eid="EZK 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 41:12" />Inzu yari imbere y’ahatubatse haherereye mu burengero bw’urusengero, yari ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko indwi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 37.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. Impome zayo zari zifise intimba ingana y’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,7.</char></note>, uburebure bw’iyo nzu na bwo bwangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo icenda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 48.</char></note>.<verse eid="EZK 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 41:13" />Maze apima urusengero; rwari rufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 53.</char></note> z’uburebure bw’amakika, kandi kuva kuri rwo ugaca ku mbuga yari irukikuje harimwo n’impome z’uruzitiro, hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana z’uburebure. <verse eid="EZK 41:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 41:14" />Imbuga yo ku ruhande rwo mu buseruko bw’urusengero ifatanye n’imbere y’urusengero hari hafise ubwaguke bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 53.</char></note>.<verse eid="EZK 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 41:15" />Maze apima uburebure bw’inyubakwa irabana n’imbuga y’imbere y’urusengero, harimwo n’amabaraza yarwo ku mpande zose; yari ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 53.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 41:15">Mu rusengero, ahanini habera amakoraniro, n’ibaraza vyose vyaraba kuri iyo mbuga, <verse eid="EZK 41:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 41:16" />hamwe rero n’urugi n’amadirisha vyari imbere mu rusengero, no mu mabaraza akikuje ku mazu agerekeranye atatu atatu, no mu muryango hose, igisenge caho cari gikozwe mu mbaho, kandi uhereye hasi, ukaduga ku mpome gushika ku madirisha no hejuru yayo hari hapfukishije imbaho. <verse eid="EZK 41:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 41:17" />Inyuma n’imbere mu Ngoro, kuva mu rwinjiriro gushika ku cumba c’inyuma, impome zari zishushanijweko ibisharizo. <verse eid="EZK 41:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 41:18" />Vyari bishushanijweko abakerubi, n’ibigazi. Ikigazi cose cakurikirana n’umukerubi, kandi umukerubi wese yari afise mu maso habiri. <verse eid="EZK 41:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 41:19" />Mu maso hamwe hari hameze nk’ah’umuntu, hakaraba ku kigazi co ku ruhande rumwe, ahandi hari hameze nk’ah’intare hakaraba ku kindi kigazi co ku rundi ruhande. Vyari bishushanije ku mpande zose z’Ingoro. <verse eid="EZK 41:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 41:20" />Kuva hasi gushika hejuru y’umuryango hari hashushanije abakerubi n’ibigazi. Uko ni ko impome zose z’Ingoro zari zishushanijweko.<verse eid="EZK 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 41:21" />Ibishimaryango vy’umuryango w’Ingoro vyari bifise impande zingana, kandi n’ivy’urugi ruja Ahera Cane vyangana n’ivyo. <verse eid="EZK 41:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 41:22" />Hariho igicaniro cabajwe mu giti, cari gifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zitatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1,5.</char></note> z’uburebure, n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">41:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1.</char></note> z’ubwaguke, kandi impande zose zarangana: imfuruka zaco, aho giterekwa hamwe n’impande zaco vyari bikozwe mu mbaho. Uwo muntu arambarira ati: “Iyi ni imeza iri imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.” <verse eid="EZK 41:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 41:23" />Kandi Ingoro hamwe n’Ahera Cane vyari bifise inzugi zibiri. <verse eid="EZK 41:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 41:24" />Urugi rumwerumwe rwose rwari rugabuwemwo zibiri zugururwa zija ku mpande zose. <verse eid="EZK 41:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 41:25" />Inzugi zo ku Ngoro zari zishushanijeko abakerubi n’ibigazi nka bimwe bishushanije ku mpome, kandi imbere y’umuryango hari ubwicaro bukozwe mu mbaho. <verse eid="EZK 41:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 41:26" />Kandi ku mpande zose z’umuryango hari amadirisha matomato akingiwe n’ivyuma, hamwe n’ibigazi bishushanije.<verse eid="EZK 41:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="EZK 42" />
  <para style="s1">Ivyumba vy’abaherezi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 42:1" />Maze ankura aho, anjana inyuma ahaherereye mu buraruko, anshikana ku twumba turabana n’imbuga y’Ingoro iri imbere y’uruhome rw’inyuma rwo mu buraruko. <verse eid="EZK 42:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 42:2" />Inzu yari ifise umuryango waraba mu buraruko yari ifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 53.</char></note> z’uburebure na mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 27.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 42:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 42:3" />Hari ku ngero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 11.</char></note> uvuye ku rugo rw’imbere, hakaba ku mbuga ishasheko amabuye y’urugo rw’inyuma, n’aho amabaraza y’utwumba twari tugerekeranye dutatudutatu yari ari. <verse eid="EZK 42:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 42:4" />Imbere y’utwo twumba hari inzira ipima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko cumi z’ubwaguke n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 5,3 z’ubwaguke n’imetero 53 z’uburebure.</char></note> z’uburebure, kandi imiryango yatwo yaraba mu buraruko. <verse eid="EZK 42:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 42:5" />Utwumba two hejuru twari dutoduto ku two musi n’utwo hagati, kuko twagabanywa n’amabaraza yatwo. <verse eid="EZK 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 42:6" />Utwumba two hejuru nta nkingi twari dufise, ni co gituma twari dutoduto amaja hasi kurusha utwo hagati n’utwo musi. <verse eid="EZK 42:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 42:7" />Uruhome rwo hanze rubangabanganye n’utwumba hamwe n’intangaro rwari rufise uburebure bw’amakika bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 27.</char></note>. <verse eid="EZK 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 42:8" />Mu gihe uburebure bw’amakika bw’utwumba tw’aharaba mu rugo rw’inyuma bwari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu, utwegereye Ingoro two twari dufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ijana. <verse eid="EZK 42:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 42:9" />Utwumba two hasi twari dufise umuryango uraba mu buseruko, abawucamwo ni ababa bavuye mu rugo rw’inyuma.<verse eid="EZK 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 42:10" />Ku ruhande rwo hepfo ahabangabanganywe n’urugo rw’inyuma, ahahurira imbuga y’imbere y’Ingoro n’uruhome rw’inyuma hari utwumba tubiri. <verse eid="EZK 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 42:11" />Inzira yari imbere yarwo yasa n’inzira y’imbere y’utwumba tw’ahaherereye mu buraruko. Twose twarangana mu burebure no mu bwaguke. Imiryango yatwo yarangana, n’inzugi zatwo zarangana n’iy’amaja mu buraruko. <verse eid="EZK 42:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 42:12" />Inzugi z’utw’ahaherereye mu bumanuko na zo ni ko zari zimeze. Aho inzira iherera hari urugi, kandi iyo nzira yari ibangabanganywe n’uruhome rw’ahaherereye mu buseruko, iyo abantu bacamwo bagiye mu twumba.<verse eid="EZK 42:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 42:13" />Maze arambwira ati: “Utu twumba na two tw’ahaherereye mu buraruko n’utw’ahaherereye mu bumanuko turaba ku mbuga y’Ingoro, ni utwo abaherezi begera <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bazoriramwo ibimazi vyejejwe cane. Ni ho bazotereka amashikanwa, ari ay’ifu, ari amashikanwa yo guhonga ivyaha, ari ayo gukurako urubanza, kuko ari ikibanza cejejwe. <verse eid="EZK 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 42:14" />Abaherezi bavuye Ahera, ntibazoca basohoka ngo baje mu rugo rwo hanze. Bazobanza kwambura imyambaro bari bambaye bariko barakora igikorwa c’ubuherezi, kuko ico kibanza barimwo ari icera. Bazokwambara izindi mpuzu imbere yo kwegera ibindi bibanza abandi bantu bose bazoba barimwo.”<verse eid="EZK 42:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 42:15" />Ahejeje gupima ivy’imbere mu Ngoro, aransohokana duciye mw’irembo ry’aharaba mu buseruko, apima urugo impande zose. <verse eid="EZK 42:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 42:16" />Apima uruhande rw’ahaherereye mu buseruko, akoresheje ya nkoni. Rwari rufise uburebure bw’amakika bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana atanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">42:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 265.</char></note>. <verse eid="EZK 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 42:17" />Apima uruhande rw’amaja mu buraruko. Rwari rufise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana atanu. <verse eid="EZK 42:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 42:18" />Apima n’uruhande rw’amaja mu bumanuko. Rwari rufise uburebure bw’amakika bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana atanu. <verse eid="EZK 42:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 42:19" />Hanyuma arahindukira apima urw’amaja mu buseruko. Rwari rufise uburebure bw’amakika bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana atanu. <verse eid="EZK 42:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 42:20" />Yongera apima n’imbuga ikikuje izo mpande zine, na yo ikaba yari ikikujwe n’uruhome. Hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana atanu ku ruhande rumwerumwe, kandi hatandukanya ahera n’ahasanzwe.<verse eid="EZK 42:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="EZK 43" />
  <para style="s1">Ubwiza bw’Imana bugaruka mu Ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 43:1" />Maze wa muntu antwara ku muryango uraba mu buseruko, <verse eid="EZK 43:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 43:2" />nca mbona ubwiza bw’Imana ya Isirayeli, buje buva mu buseruko. Ijwi ryayo ryari rimeze nk’iry’amazi asuma, kandi isi yakayangana ubwiza bwayo. <verse eid="EZK 43:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 43:3" />Ivyo nabonye vyari bimeze nk’ivyo neretswe igihe yaza gutikiza igisagara, canke ivyo nerekewe ku ruzi Kebari, maze nikubita hasi nubamye. <verse eid="EZK 43:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 43:4" />Ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwinjira mu Ngoro, buzananye mw’irembo ry’amaja mu buseruko. <verse eid="EZK 43:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 43:5" />Maze Mpwemu andugana mu cumba co haruguru, ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> na bwo bwuzura Ingoro.<verse eid="EZK 43:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 43:6" />Wa muntu agihagaze i ruhande yanje, numva uwundi muntu amvugishije ari mu rusengero. <verse eid="EZK 43:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 43:7" />Avuga ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, iki ni co kibanza c’intebe yanje y’ubwami, hamwe n’ikibanza c’indava y’ibirenge vyanje. Ni ho nzoba ibihe vyose, mbane n’Abisirayeli. Abisirayeli ntibazigera basubira guhumanya izina ryanje; baba bo canke abami babo; mu busambanyi bwabo no mu mashikanwa y’imivyimba y’abami babo batangira ku mpinga z’imisozi. <verse eid="EZK 43:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 43:8" />Igihe bashinga ibicaniro vy’ibigirwamana vyabo hafi y’igicaniro canje, bigatandukanywa n’uruhome rumwe gusa, bahumanije izina ryanje ryera mu bizira bakora. Ni co gituma nabaranduranye uburake bwanje. <verse eid="EZK 43:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 43:9" />Noneho rero nibate kure yanje ubusambanyi bwabo hamwe n’ibigirwamana bitagira ubuzima vy’abami babo, nanje nzoba muri bo ibihe vyose.<verse eid="EZK 43:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 43:10" />Mwana w’umuntu, ereka ubwoko bwa Isirayeli iyo Ngoro, kugira ngo baterwe isoni n’ivyaha vyabo. Baze barupime bakurikije ishusho yarwo. <verse eid="EZK 43:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 43:11" />Nibamaramazwa n’ivyaha vyose bakoze, ubereke uko iyo Ngoro imeze n’uko itunganijwe, ubereke imiryango isohoka n’iyinjira, ishusho yayo yose hamwe n’ivyagezwe n’amabwirizwa bijanye na yo. Uvyandikire imbere yabo, kugira ngo bazokurikize iyi nteguro yayo bakurikize n’amabwirizwa ajanye na yo.<verse eid="EZK 43:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 43:12" />Ng’iki icagezwe kigenga Ingoro: ahakikuje impinga y’umusozi hose, hazoba ahera cane. Ico ni co cagezwe kigenga Ingoro.<verse eid="EZK 43:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Igicaniro gikuru gisubira kwubakwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 43:13" />Ibi ni vyo bipimo vy’igicaniro hakurikijwe ibipimo bisanzwe bikoreshwa: intebe y’igicaniro izokikuzwa n’umuvo ufise ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 53.</char></note> y’ubwaguke, n’imwe umanuka, hamwe n’ingero imwe y’intoke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 23.</char></note> kuva kuri uwo muvo gushika ku ntebe y’igicaniro. <verse eid="EZK 43:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 43:14" />Kuva hasi ku ntebe yaco gushika ku nkikuro y’ahahera hepfo hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 1,1.</char></note> z’amaduga n’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 53.</char></note> y’ubwaguke. Kuva kuri iyo nkikuro gushika hejuru hari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,1.</char></note>, ubwaguke na bwo bukaguma bungana n’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko imwe. <verse eid="EZK 43:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 43:15" />Igicaniro ubwaco, uburebure bw’igihagararo bwaco ni ingero z’igice c’ukuboko zine, kikagira amahembe ane araba hejuru ari mu mfuruka zose uko ari zine. <verse eid="EZK 43:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 43:16" />Hejuru ku gicaniro harangana mu burebure no mu bwaguke; hafise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko icumi na zibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 6,4.</char></note> ku ruhande rwose. <verse eid="EZK 43:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 43:17" />Iyindi nkikuro yo hejuru na yo nyene impande zayo zose zarangana zifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko icumi na zine<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 7,4.</char></note> ku ruhande rwose kandi urubiga rw’iyo nkikuro rwari igice c’ingero y’igice c’ukuboko<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">43:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’isantimetero 27.</char></note>. Ingazi zari imbere y’igicaniro zari zitumbereye mu buseruko.”<verse eid="EZK 43:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 43:18" />Maze arambwira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Ibi ni vyo bizoba ivyashinzwe vyo gushikana ibimazi bituriwe hamwe no kumijagira amaraso ku gicaniro nibamara kucubaka: <verse eid="EZK 43:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 43:19" />Ico gihe, abaherezi bo mu bakomoka kuri Lewi, bo mu muryango wa Sadoki, bakorera imbere yanje, bazohabwa impfizi y’inka kugira ngo bayitange ibe ikimazi c’ivyaha, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 43:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 43:20" />Uzokwakire ku maraso yayo, uyasige ku mahembe ane y’ico gicaniro, no ku mfuruka zine zaco hejuru, uzoba ucejeje ugitangiye impongano. <verse eid="EZK 43:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 43:21" />Uzoheze ufate iyo mpfizi, uyituririre mu kibanza cabigenewe co mu Ngoro, inyuma y’Ahera.<verse eid="EZK 43:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 43:22" />Ku musi ugira kabiri uzoshikane impfizi y’impene, itagira agasembwa, ibe ikimazi c’ivyaha, kandi igicaniro kize cezwe nk’uko cejejwe na ya mpfizi y’inka. <verse eid="EZK 43:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 43:23" />Niwaheza kuceza, uzotange ikimazi c’ishuri y’inka ikiri ntoya hamwe n’impfizi y’intama, vyompi bizobe bitagira agasembwa. <verse eid="EZK 43:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 43:24" />Uzobitangire imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, kandi abaherezi bazobishireko umunyu, bazobitange nk’amashikanwa y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 43:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 43:25" />Uzomare imisi indwi ushikana impfizi y’impene ku musi nk’ikimazi c’ivyaha; kandi uze wame ushikana n’impfizi y’inka y’umukangara hamwe n’impfizi y’intama, vyompi bitagira agasembwa. <verse eid="EZK 43:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 43:26" />Uzomare imisi indwi utanga impongano y’igicaniro, uceze; uko ni ko uzokigira icera. <verse eid="EZK 43:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 43:27" />Inyuma y’iyo misi indwi, kuva ku musi ugira umunani kubandanya, abaherezi bazobe ari bo bashikana ibimazi vyanyu vyo guturirwa, hamwe n’ivy’amashimwe, babizane ku gicaniro. Nanje nzoheza ndavyakire, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.”<verse eid="EZK 43:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="EZK 44" />
  <para style="s1">Ibango ry’ubuherezi risubizwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 44:1" />Maze uwo muntu angarukana mw’irembo ryo hanze y’Ingoro, riraba mu buseruko, ryari ryugaye. <verse eid="EZK 44:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 44:2" /><char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca ambarira ati: “Iri rembo rizokwame ryugaye; ntihazogire uwuryinjiriramwo. Rizokwame ryugaye kuko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Imana ya Isirayeli ari ryo yinjiriyemwo. <verse eid="EZK 44:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 44:3" />Umuganwa wenyene ubwiwe, ni we ashobora kuryicaramwo, akarira imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Aze yinjire aciye mu nzira y’ibaraza y’iryo rembo, kandi aho nyene azobe ari ho asohokera.”<verse eid="EZK 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 44:4" />Maze anjana mu nzira y’irembo riraba mu buraruko, anshikana imbere y’Ingoro. Ngize gutya mbona ubwiza bw’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> bwuzuye Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, maze nikubita hasi nubamye.<verse eid="EZK 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 44:5" />
    <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> aca arambarira ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, ihweze neza, kandi wumvirize neza, ushire umutima ku vyo ndakubwira bijanye n’ivyashinzwe ko bitegerezwa gukorwa mu ngoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Wumvirize neza ingene amarembo y’Ingoro azokoreshwa haba mu kwinjira canke mu gusohoka. <verse eid="EZK 44:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 44:6" />Ubwire abagarariji ari bo Bisirayeli, uti: Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Geza aho gukora ibizira, yemwe Bisirayeli! <verse eid="EZK 44:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 44:7" />Ku bindi bizira mwakoze mwongeyeko kuzana abanyamahanga batakebwe haba ku mutima canke ku mubiri mu Ngoro yanje, muhumanya urusengero rwanje, mukiriko muranshikanira ivyokurya, ibinure n’amaraso, maze muva mw’isezerano ryanje. <verse eid="EZK 44:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 44:8" />Aho gukora ibikorwa nabajeje bijanye n’ivyejejwe vyanje, mwabihaye abanyamahanga ngo abe ari bo bitaho Ingoro yanje. <verse eid="EZK 44:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 44:9" />Uku ni ko <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji avuze: Nta munyamahanga atakebwe ku mutima no ku mubiri yemerewe kwinjira mu Ngoro yanje, naho yoba uwuba mu Bisirayeli.<verse eid="EZK 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 44:10" />Abalewi bagiye kure yanje igihe Abisirayeli bashwiragira, bakanta bagakurikira ibigirwamana vyabo bategerezwa gushikwako n’ingaruka z’ivyaha vyabo. <verse eid="EZK 44:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 44:11" />Boshobora gukora ku Ngoro nk’abarinzi b’amarembo yayo bakongera bagakora ibikorwa vyo gucumita ibimazi vyo guturira, no guhagarara imbere y’abantu babakorera. <verse eid="EZK 44:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 44:12" />Ariko, kubera bafashije abantu banje gukorera ibigirwamana, bagatuma Abisirayeli bagwa mu caha, ni co catumye ndahira manitse ukuboko, ko bategerezwa gushikwako n’ingaruka z’icaha cabo, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 44:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 44:13" />Ntibaze banyegere ngo bankorere nk’abaherezi, canke ngo begere ivyejejwe vyanje canke amashikanwa yanje yejejwe; bazokwamane isoni z’ibizira bakoze. <verse eid="EZK 44:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 44:14" />Ariko nzobagira abarinzi b’urusengero, mbahe no gukora ibikorwa bindi vyose birukorerwamwo.<verse eid="EZK 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 44:15" />Ariko abaherezi, ari bo Balewi bamuka kuri Sadoki, bagumye mu bikorwa vy’Ingoro igihe Abisirayeli bamvako, baze begere, bankorere; bazohagarare imbere yanje banshikanire ibimazi vy’ibinure n’amaraso, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 44:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 44:16" />Ni bo bonyene bazokwinjira mu Ngoro yanje; ni bo bonyene bazokwegera imeza yanje bankorere, bashitse ivyo nategetse.<verse eid="EZK 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 44:17" />Nibinjira mw’irembo ryo mu rugo rw’imbere, baze bambare imyambaro yera; ntihaze hagire ico bambara kirimwo ubwoya mu gihe bazoba bariko barankorera ku marembo y’urugo rw’imbere canke imbere mu Ngoro. <verse eid="EZK 44:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 44:18" />Bazohore bambara ibitambara vyera ku mitwe, bambare n’amabutura yera. Ntihazogire ico bambara cobatera kubira ivyuya. <verse eid="EZK 44:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 44:19" />Nibasohoka baja aho abantu bari mu rugo rwo hanze, bazokwambure iyo myambaro bankoreye bambaye, bayisige mu vyumba vyabigenewe, baheze bambare iyindi myambaro, kugira ngo ntihagire uwo bakwegera kuba inyegu bitewe no gukorwako n’iyo myambaro.<verse eid="EZK 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 44:20" />Ntibazokwimoshe umushatsi wose canke ngo batereke umushatsi wabo ube muremire, bazokwame bawugabanya gusa. <verse eid="EZK 44:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 44:21" />Ntihazogire umuherezi yinjira mu rugo rw’imbere yanyoye umuvinyu. <verse eid="EZK 44:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 44:22" />Ntibazorongore abapfakazi canke ngo bahukane; bazorongore inkumi zo mu Bisirayeli gusa, canke abapfakazi b’abandi baherezi. <verse eid="EZK 44:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 44:23" />Bazokwigishe ubwoko bwanje itandukaniro ry’ahera n’ahasanzwe, babigishe gutandukanya ibihumanye n’ivyejejwe.<verse eid="EZK 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 44:24" />Nihagira abagira ico bapfa, abaherezi bazobe ari bo bababera abacamanza, babatunganiririze bakurikije amategeko yanje. Bazokurikize ivyagezwe vyanje n’ivyo nihanikirije ku misi mikuru nategetse, kandi baze beze Isabato yanje.<verse eid="EZK 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 44:25" />Umuherezi ntaze yihumanishe kwegera ikiziga. Ariko nimba uwapfuye ari se, nyina canke uwo bavukana, aho arashobora kumwegera. <verse eid="EZK 44:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 44:26" />Inyuma yo kwiyeza, azorindire imisi indwi. <verse eid="EZK 44:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 44:27" />Umusi azokwinjira mu rugo rwo haruguru gukora ibikorwa vy’ahera ho mu rusengero, aze yitangire ikimazi, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 44:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 44:28" />Ni jewe nzoba umugabane wabo. Ntimuzobahe amatongo muri Isirayeli; ni jewe nzoba umugabane wabo. <verse eid="EZK 44:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 44:29" />Bazorya ku mashikanwa y’ifu, ibimazi vy’ivyaha n’ivy’indishi; kandi ivyeguriwe Uhoraho vyose muri Isirayeli bizoba ivyabo. <verse eid="EZK 44:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 44:30" />Ivyeze imbere y’ibindi vyose n’amashikanwa mushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>, bizoba ivy’abaherezi. Muzobahe umugabane wa mbere w’ivyo mwimbuye, kugira ngo umugisha ube ku ngo zanyu. <verse eid="EZK 44:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 44:31" />Umuherezi ntihazogire ikintu na kimwe arya yaba inyoni canke ikindi asanze capfuye canke cishwe n’inyamaswa.<verse eid="EZK 44:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="EZK 45" />
  <para style="s1">Ukunagurwa kwa Isirayeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 45:1" />Nimwagabura amatongo nk’ishamvu zanyu, muzokureko aho mwegurira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>. Hazobe ari ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 13.</char></note> vy’uburebure n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 11.</char></note> vy’ubwaguke. Aho hose hazobe ahejejwe. <verse eid="EZK 45:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 45:2" />Kuri aho hantu, muzopime ahangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana atanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 265.</char></note> kuri izo nyene, impande zose zize zingane, hazobe ah’urusengero. Ingoro izokikuzwe n’ahatubatse hafise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 27.</char></note> z’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 45:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 45:3" />Ico kibanza cejejwe, muzopime ahangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu vy’uburebure, ku ngero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi icumi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 5,3.</char></note> vy’ubwaguke ahazoba ikibanza cejejwe cane. <verse eid="EZK 45:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 45:4" />Ni ho hazoba umugabane wera w’abaherezi, bakorera mu Ngoro yanje, kandi begera ngo bakorere imbere yanje. Ni ahantu bashobora kwubakamwo amazu yabo, hakongera kandi hakaba ikibanza cejejwe c’Ingoro yanje. <verse eid="EZK 45:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 45:5" />Ikindi gice kingana ukwo nyene kizohabwe Abalewi bakora mu Ngoro, habe inyegu yabo, abe ari ho bubaka ibisagara vyabo.<verse eid="EZK 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 45:6" />I ruhande y’umugabane wanje wera, hazobe ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 2,7.</char></note> vy’uburebure n’ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu vy’ubwaguke. Aho hazoba ari ah’uwo ari we wese w’Umwisirayeli.<verse eid="EZK 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 45:7" />Umuganwa azohabwe umugabane ku mpande zose z’aho hantu hanje hera, no ku mpande z’igisagara, mu ruhande rwo mu burengero baja mu burengero, no ku ruhande rwo mu buseruko uja mu buseruko, uburebure bwaho burehe n’ubw’umugabane umwe, uhereye mu ruhande rwo mu burengero uja mu buseruko. <verse eid="EZK 45:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 45:8" />Uwo mugabane uzobe umugabane wiwe muri Isirayeli. Gutyo abami banje ntibazosubira kurenganya ubwoko bwanje, bazogaburira igihugu Abisirayeli, bakurikije uko imiryango yabo iri.<verse eid="EZK 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 45:9" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Birahagije, yemwe bami ba Isirayeli! Nimureke akarenganyo n’agacinyizo, mukore ibitunganye n’ibigororotse. Nimureke kwambura abantu banje, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 45:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 45:10" />Mukoreshe iminzane itunganye n’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ingero efa 1 yapima ivyumye biseseka; yari nk’amalitiro 22.</char></note> na batu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ingero batu 1 yapima ibiseseka nk’amazi; yari nk’amalitiro 22.</char></note> zitunganye. <verse eid="EZK 45:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 45:11" />Ingero yitwa homeru izobe ari yo ngero mufatirako mu gupima. Ingero efa na batu zizobe zingana. Efa ibe ic’icumi c’ingero homeru, na batu nyene ibe ic’icumi ca homeru. <verse eid="EZK 45:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 45:12" />Ingero shekeli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shekeli 1 yapima nk’amagarama 12.</char></note> izobe ingana n’ingero gera mirongo ibiri. Shekeli mirongo ibiri ushizeko shekeli mirongo ibiri na zitanu, ugashirako shekeli cumi na zitanu bingana ingero mina imwe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Shekeli 60 ni nk’amagarama 690.</char></note><verse eid="EZK 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 45:13" />Iri ni ryo shikanwa muzoshikana: ku ngero homeru imwe y’ingano, muzokureko ica gatandatu c’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 2,7.</char></note> imwe, no kuri homeru imwe ya sayiri na ho nyene muzokureko ica gatandatu ca efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 2,3.</char></note> imwe. <verse eid="EZK 45:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 45:14" />Icashinzwe cerekeye amavuta ya Elayo apimishijwe ingero batu, ni ic’icumi ca batu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 2,2.</char></note> mukuye ku ngero koru imwe yose. Iyo na yo ingana n’ic’icumi c’ingero batu canke homeru imwe, kuko ingero batu icumi zingana na homeru imwe. <verse eid="EZK 45:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 45:15" />Kandi intama imwe ni yo ikwiye gutoranywa mu zindi amajana abiri zo mu buragiro butotahaye bwa Isirayeli. Ivyo ni vyo bizokoreshwa mu gushikana ibimazi vy’ifu n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa, ivy’amashimwe hamwe n’ivy’impongano, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze. <verse eid="EZK 45:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 45:16" />Abanyagihugu bose bazotange ayo mashikanwa adasanzwe, ashikanirwe umwami wa Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 45:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 45:17" />Umwami ni we azotanga ibikenewe vyose bijanye n’ibimazi vyo guturirwa, ivy’ifu, n’ivy’ibinyobwa, mu misi mikuru y’imboneko z’ukwezi no kw’Isabato, no mu misi mikuru yose yategekanijwe mu nzu ya Isirayeli. Azotanga amashikanwa atangirwa ivyaha, amashikanwa y’ifu, amashikanwa yo guturirwa, hamwe n’amashikanwa y’ishimwe, vyo gutangira Abisirayeli.<verse eid="EZK 45:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 45:18" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: Ku musi wa mbere w’ukwezi kwa mbere, muzofate ishuri y’inka ikiri ntoya, itagira agasembwa, yo kweza Ingoro. <verse eid="EZK 45:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 45:19" />Umuherezi aze yakire ku maraso y’ikimazi catangiwe ivyaha ayasige ku bishimaryango vy’Ingoro, no ku mfuruka zine z’igicaniro, no ku bikingi vy’irembo ry’urugo rw’imbere. <verse eid="EZK 45:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 45:20" />Muzobigenze mutyo no ku musi ugira indwi w’ukwezi bikorerwe uwacumuye atabishaka canke atabizi. Uko ni ko muzoba mutangiye impongano urusengero.<verse eid="EZK 45:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 45:21" />Ku musi ugira cumi na kane w’ukwezi kwa mbere, muzogire umusi mukuru wa Pasika, bizomara imisi indwi, iyo muzomara murya imikate itarimwo umwambiro. <verse eid="EZK 45:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 45:22" />Kuri uwo musi umwami azotange impfizi ibe ikimazi gitangiwe ivyaha, acitangire we ubwiwe, hamwe n’abo mu gihugu ciwe bose. <verse eid="EZK 45:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 45:23" />Ku musi wose muri iyo misi indwi y’imisi mikuru, azotange amashuri indwi n’amapfizi y’intama indwi atagira agasembwa, ashikanirwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> nk’ibimazi bituriwe, hamwe n’impfizi y’impene y’ikimazi gitangiwe ivyaha. <verse eid="EZK 45:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 45:24" />Azotange ingero efa y’ishikanwa ry’ifu rijana n’ishuri yose, hamwe n’iyindi imwe ijana n’impfizi y’intama, kandi efa imwe izojane n’ingero yitwa hini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">45:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 3,8.</char></note> y’amavuta ya elayo.<verse eid="EZK 45:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 45:25" />Muri iyo ndwi y’imisi mikuru, itangura ku musi w’icumi na kane w’ukwezi kw’indwi, azotange ibingana bityo ku mashikanwa atangirwa ivyaha, ku mashikanwa yo guturirwa, ku mashikanwa y’ifu, no ku mavuta ya elayo.”<verse eid="EZK 45:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="EZK 46" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 46:1" />“Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: ‘Irembo ry’urugo rw’imbere riraba mu buseruko rizokwugarwe mu misi itandatu y’akazi, ariko ku musi w’Isabato canke ku musi w’imboneko z’ukwezi rize ryugururwe. <verse eid="EZK 46:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 46:2" />Umwami aze yinjire aciye mw’ibaraza y’iryo rembo, ahagarare ku bikingi vy’irembo. Abaherezi bazoshikane amashikanwa yiwe yo guturirwa, hamwe n’ay’ishimwe. Azokubite amavi hasi mu rwinjiriro asenge, aheze asohoke, ariko umuryango ntuzokwugarwe gushika ku mugoroba. <verse eid="EZK 46:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 46:3" />Ku musi w’Isabato no ku mboneko z’ukwezi, abanyagihugu bose bazosengere imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku rwinjiro rw’iryo rembo. <verse eid="EZK 46:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 46:4" />Amashikanwa yo guturirwa kw’Isabato azozanwa n’umwami azobe amasuguru y’imyagazi y’intama atandatu hamwe n’impfizi y’intama, vyose bizobe bitagira agasembwa. <verse eid="EZK 46:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 46:5" />Ishikanwa ry’ifu ryo gutangana n’impfizi y’intama rizobe ingero efa imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 16.</char></note>, na yo iy’ifu ijana n’umwagazi, azotange iyingana uko ashatse, iri kumwe n’ingero hini imwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’amalitiro 3,8.</char></note> ihwana n’ingero efa imwe. <verse eid="EZK 46:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 46:6" />Ku musi mukuru w’imboneko z’ukwezi na ho azotange impfizi y’inka y’umukangara, imyagazi itandatu, impfizi imwe y’intama, kandi vyose bizobe ibitagira agasembwa. <verse eid="EZK 46:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 46:7" />Iyo mpfizi y’inka azoyitangane n’ingero efa imwe y’ishikanwa ry’ifu, umwagazi w’intama azowutangane n’ingero efa imwe y’ishikanwa ry’ifu, impfizi y’intama na yo azoyitangane n’ingero ashaka y’ishikanwa ry’ifu, kandi ingero efa yose azoyitangane n’ingero hini imwe y’amavuta ya elayo. <verse eid="EZK 46:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 46:8" />Umwami niyinjira azoce mw’ibaraza ryo kw’irembo, kandi abe ari ho azoca mu gusohoka.<verse eid="EZK 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 46:9" />Abantu bo muri iki gihugu nibaza imbere y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ku misi mikuru itegekanijwe, uwuzokwinjirana umuryango wa ruguru aje gusenga azosohokane uwo hepfo, uwuzokwinjirira mu wo hepfo na we azosohokane mu wo haruguru. Ntihazogire uwusohoka aciye mu wo yinjiriyemwo, ahubwo azoce mu wo ku rundi ruhande birabana. <verse eid="EZK 46:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 46:10" />Umwami azobe ari hagati muri bo, aze yinjirane n’abandi yongere asohokane na bo. <verse eid="EZK 46:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 46:11" />Ku misi mikuru itegekanijwe, ishikanwa ry’ifu rizobe ingero efa imwe ijana n’impfizi y’inka, ingero efa imwe ijana n’impfizi y’intama, ariko ku yijana n’umwagazi azobikore uko ashatse, n’ingero hini imwe y’amavuta ya elayo ize ijane n’ingero efa imwe.<verse eid="EZK 46:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 46:12" />Umwami niyashaka gushikanira <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ishikanwa rivuye ku gushaka kwiwe, ryaba ari ishikanwa ryo guturirwa canke iry’ishimwe, aze yugururirwe irembo ry’amaja mu buseruko. Azotange ishikanwa ryiwe ryo guturirwa canke ry’ishimwe, nk’uko ahora abigenza ku musi w’Isabato. Ahejeje asohoke, hanyuma umuryango usubire wugarwe.<verse eid="EZK 46:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 46:13" />Ku musi muzotange umwagazi w’intama umaze umwaka umwe, utagira agasembwa nk’ikimazi co guturirwa gishikaniwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>; muzogitange mu gitondo. <verse eid="EZK 46:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 46:14" />Muzowutangane n’ishikanwa ry’ifu igitondo cose, na ryo rizoba rigizwe n’ica gatandatu c’ingero efa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilo 2,7.</char></note> n’ica gatatu c’ingero hini<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ilitiro 1,3.</char></note> y’amavuta ya elayo yo gutosa iyo fu. Iki ni icagezwe c’intahava ibihe vyose. <verse eid="EZK 46:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 46:15" />Nuko rero umwagazi, ishikanwa ry’ifu hamwe n’amavuta bizotangwe igitondo cose nk’ikimazi co guturirwa co ku musi.’<verse eid="EZK 46:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 46:16" />Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: ‘Umwami niyaha ingabire umuhungu wiwe mu vyo yarazwe, izobe n’iy’uruvyaro rw’uwo muhungu; izobe inyegu y’umuryango. <verse eid="EZK 46:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 46:17" />Ariko umwami niyaha ingabire umushumba wiwe mw’iragi ryiwe, ize yegukire uwo mushumba mu myaka azoba agikorera uwo mwami, ageze ku mwaka wo kwidegemvya, iyo ngabire izosubire ibe iy’umwami. Iragi ryiwe ni iry’abana biwe; ni iry’abaragwa biwe. <verse eid="EZK 46:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 46:18" />Umwami ntiyemerewe gutwara iragi ry’umuntu n’umwe, mu kubakura mw’itongo ryabo. Azohe abahungu biwe iragi kw’itongo yatoranye, kugira ngo abantu banje ntibasanzarire kure y’amatongo yabo.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 46:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 46:19" />Maze wa muntu arantwara ancisha mu rwinjiriro rwo ku ruhande rw’umuryango uja ku vyumba vyatoranijwe biraba mu buraruko, ari vyo vy’abaherezi, anyereka ikibanza cari mu mfuruka y’amaja mu burengero. <verse eid="EZK 46:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 46:20" />Arambwira ati: “Aha ni ho abaherezi bazotekera ibimazi vyo gukuraho urubanza, n’ibimazi bitangirwa ivyaha, no gukaranga amashikanwa y’ifu, mu kwanka ko bobizana mu kigo c’inyuma bikagira abantu inyegu.”<verse eid="EZK 46:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 46:21" />Maze aca anjana mu kigo c’inyuma, anzungurukana mu mfuruka zaco zose, maze mu mfuruka zaco zose mbonayo ikindi kigo. <verse eid="EZK 46:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 46:22" />Mu mfuruka zine zose hari ibindi bigo bizitiye, bifise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko mirongo ine z’uburebure na mirongo itatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">46:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 21 z’uburebure n’imetero 16 z’ubwaguke.</char></note> z’ubwaguke, ivyo bigo vyose vyo mu mfuruka zine vyarangana. <verse eid="EZK 46:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 46:23" />Imbere mu kigo cose hari hakikujwe n’ahantu batekera ivyokurya. <verse eid="EZK 46:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 46:24" />Arambwira ati: “Aha ni aho bazohora batekera ibimazi vyashikanywe.”<verse eid="EZK 46:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="EZK 47" />
  <para style="s1">Uruzi ruva mu Ngoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 47:1" />Wa muntu ansubiza inyuma ku rwinjiriro rw’Ingoro, mbona amazi ava musi y’umuryango w’Ingoro, atemba aja mu buseruko, kuko iyo nzu yaraba mu buseruko. Ayo mazi yatemba aca musi y’uruhande rwo mu bumanuko, musi y’igicaniro. <verse eid="EZK 47:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 47:2" />Aca aransohokana ancishije mw’irembo ryo mu buraruko, antwara kw’irembo riraba mu buseruko. Ni ho nabona ko ayo mazi atemba aca musi y’uruhande rwo mu bumanuko.<verse eid="EZK 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 47:3" />Maze uwo muntu agenda aja mu buseruko, apimisha umugozi yari afise mu ntoke. Apima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko igihumbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">47:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 530.</char></note> z’umugende wa ya mazi amanuka. Ayancishijemwo, yagera ku jisho ry’ikirenge. <verse eid="EZK 47:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 47:4" />Yongera apima izindi ngero z’igice c’ukuboko igihumbi, yongera ayancishamwo, angera mu mavi. Yongera apima izindi ngero z’igice c’ukuboko igihumbi, ayancishijemwo angera mu rukenyerero. <verse eid="EZK 47:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 47:5" />Arasubira apima izindi ngero z’igice c’ukuboko igihumbi, amazi aca angera aho ntashobora kujabuka, kuko yari yabaye menshi, vyasaba ko noga, rwari rwabaye uruzi runini aho ata worucamwo atambuka. <verse eid="EZK 47:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 47:6" />Arambaza ati: “Mwana w’umuntu, mbega urabona ivyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 47:6">Araheza ansubiza ku nkombe y’uruzi.<verse eid="EZK 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 47:7" />Ndahashitse mbona ibiti vyinshi cane ku mpande zose z’uruzi. <verse eid="EZK 47:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 47:8" />Arambwira ati: “Uru ruzi rutemba ruja mu ntara yo mu buseruko, rukamanuka rugashika muri Araba, aho rwisesera mu kiyaga. Nirwashika mu kiyaga, amazi yaco azoca aba meza. <verse eid="EZK 47:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 47:9" />Aho urwo ruzi ruzotembera hose, ibinyabuzima vyo mu mazi bizobaho. Hazoba amafi menshi, kuko aya mazi aratemba agatuma amazi arimwo umunyu acika meza; aho ruzoshika hose, ruzohazana ubuzima. <verse eid="EZK 47:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 47:10" />Abarovyi bazohagarara ku nkengera z’ikiyaga c’Umunyu, kandi kuva muri Eni-Gedi gushika muri Eni-Egulayimu hazobaho ibibanza vyo kwanikira insenga. Hazoba amafi y’ubwoko bwinshi nk’ayo mu kiyaga Mediterane. <verse eid="EZK 47:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 47:11" />Ariko imyonga n’inkengera zayo ntibizokira bizogumana umunyu. <verse eid="EZK 47:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 47:12" />Ibiti vy’ubwoko bwose bitanga ivyamwa bizomera ku mpande zose z’uruzi. Amababi yavyo ntazigera yuma, kandi ntibizigera bireka kwama. Amezi yose bizokwama vyamye, kuko amazi azova mu Ngoro ibihe vyose abitemberamwo. Ivyamwa vyavyo bizoba ivyokurya, amababi yavyo na yo avure ingwara.”<verse eid="EZK 47:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imbibe z’igihugu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 47:13" />“Uku ni ko jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji mvuze: ‘Izi ni zo zizoba imbibe zerekana igihugu uzogaburira imiryango cumi n’ibiri ya Isirayeli nk’iragi ryabo harimwo n’imigabane ibiri ya Yosefu ingene kingana. <verse eid="EZK 47:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 47:14" />Uzokibagaburira ku rugezo rungana. Kuko narahiye manitse ukuboko ko nzogiha ba sekuruza, kikazoba iragi ryabo.<verse eid="EZK 47:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 47:15" />Imbibe z’ico gihugu zizobe izi:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 47:15" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZK 47:15">Mu buraruko urubibe ruzove ku kiyaga Kinini kw’ibarabara rya Hetiloni rurengane Lebo-Hamati gushika i Sedadi, <verse eid="EZK 47:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 47:16" />ruce i Berota n’i Sibirayimu, biri hagati y’urubibe rwa Damasiko na Hamati, rushike i Hezeri-Hatikoni, hari ku rubibe rwa Hawurani. <verse eid="EZK 47:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 47:17" />Urwo rubibe ruzova ku kiyaga rugende gushika i Hazari-Enoni, ruce ruguru y’urubibe rwa Damasiko, hamwe n’urubibe rwa Hamati mu buraruko. Urwo ni rwo ruzoba urubibe rwo mu buraruko.<verse eid="EZK 47:17" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 47:18" />Mu buseruko urubibe ruzoca hagati ya Hawurani na Damasiko rujane Yorodani hagati ya Gileyadi na Isirayeli, gushika ku kiyaga co mu buseruko, no gushika i Tamari. Uru ni rwo ruzoba urubibe rwo mu buseruko.<verse eid="EZK 47:18" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 47:19" />Mu bumanuko ruzova i Tamari, rushike ku mazi y’i Meriba Kadeshi, ruheze ruce ku kagezi ka Egiputa, rushike ku Kiyaga Kinini. Urwo ni rwo rubibe rwo mu bumanuko.<verse eid="EZK 47:19" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 47:20" />Mu burengero, ikiyaga kinini ni co kizoba urubibe aharabana n’i Lebo-Hamati. Urwo ni rwo rubibe rwo mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 47:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 47:21" />Uzogabure iki gihugu uko imiryango ya Isirayeli ingana. <verse eid="EZK 47:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 47:22" />Muzokigabure nk’iragi ryanyu mwe n’abanyamahanga baba muri mwebwe, bahavyariye abana, na bo nyene muzobafate nk’Abisirayeli ba kavukire. Bazohabwe iragi mu miryango y’Abisirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 47:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 47:23" />Mu miryango abanyamahanga bazoba babamwo azobe ari yo batoranamwo iragi, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.’ ”<verse eid="EZK 47:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="EZK 48" />
  <para style="s1">Ingene igihugu cagaburiwe Abisirayeli</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EZK 48:1" />“Iyi ni yo miryango ya Isirayeli, uko amazina yabo ari:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 48:1" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZK 48:1">Dani azohabwa intara imwe, izoba mu buraruko. Urubibe rwayo ruzoba ibarabara rya Hetiloni, rugenda rugashika i Hamati, rukabandanya gushika i Hazari-Enani no ku rubibe rwa Damasiko rwo mu buraruko, hafi ya Hamati. Intara ya Dani izova ku ruhande rwo mu buseruko ishike mu burengero bw’igihugu ca Isirayeli.<verse eid="EZK 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EZK 48:2" />Asheri azoronka intara imwe, ihana urubibe n’iya Dani, ive mu buseruko ishike mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EZK 48:3" />Nafutali azohabwa intara imwe, ihana urubibe n’iya Asheri, ive mu buseruko igere mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EZK 48:4" />Manase azohabwa intara imwe, ihana urubibe n’iya Nafutali, ive mu buseruko igere mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EZK 48:5" />Efurayimu azoronka intara imwe, ihana urubibe n’iya Manase, ive mu buseruko igere mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EZK 48:6" />Reyubeni azohabwa intara imwe, ihana urubibe n’iya Efurayimu, ive mu buseruko igere mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EZK 48:7" />Yuda azoronka intara imwe, ihana urubibe n’iya Reyubeni, ive mu buseruko igere mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EZK 48:8" />Ahahana urubibe n’intara ya Yuda, hazoba ari ahantu hateguriwe igikorwa kidasanzwe. Hazoba hangana ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 13.</char></note> vy’uburebure, ubwaguke bwaho na bwo buzova ku rubibe rwa Isirayeli mu buseruko, rushike mu burengero nk’uko intara z’imiryango zimeze. Ingoro yanje izoba hagati muri ico kibanza.<verse eid="EZK 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EZK 48:9" />Umugabane wera muzoha <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> uzoba ufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu z’uburebure hamwe n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko igihumbi z’ubwaguke<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 5,3.</char></note>. <verse eid="EZK 48:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EZK 48:10" />Umugabane wera muzoha abaherezi uzogira uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu z’uburebure n’ibihumbi icumi vy’ubwaguke ku ruhande rwo mu burengero. Ingoro y’<char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> izoba hagati na hagati muri wo. <verse eid="EZK 48:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EZK 48:11" />Uwo uzoba uw’abaherezi bejejwe, bakomoka kuri Sadoki, bankoreye mu bwizigirwa, batantaye nk’Abalewi igihe Abisirayeli banta. <verse eid="EZK 48:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EZK 48:12" />Uzobe umugabane wabo udasanzwe, ukuwe ku mugabane wejejwe wo muri ico gihugu, umugabane wera cane, uhana urubibe n’intara y’Abalewi.<verse eid="EZK 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EZK 48:13" />Abalewi bazohabwa intara ihana urubibe n’umugabane w’abaherezi, hazoba hangana ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu z’uburebure n’ibihumbi icumi vy’ubwaguke. <verse eid="EZK 48:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EZK 48:14" />Ntibazohagurishe canke ngo bagire ico bahakaba. Ntihazohabwe abandi kuko ari isi nziza cane, kandi hakaba herejwe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char>.<verse eid="EZK 48:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EZK 48:15" />Ahasigaye hangana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bitanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 2,7.</char></note> z’uburebure, n’ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu vy’ubwaguke hazohabwa Abisirayeli, bahubake amazu hongere habe uburagiro, igisagara kibe hagati. <verse eid="EZK 48:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EZK 48:16" />Ico gisagara kizoba gipima ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 2,4.</char></note> ku ruhande rwose. <verse eid="EZK 48:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EZK 48:17" />Uburagiro buzogire ingero z’igice c’ukuboko amajana abiri na mirongo itanu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’imetero 135.</char></note> ku mpande zine zabwo. <verse eid="EZK 48:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EZK 48:18" />Ahasigaye, hahana urubibe n’umugabane wera, hazoba hafise uburebure bungana n’ubw’uwo mugabane wera, hazoba hafise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi icumi n’ubwaguke bw’ibihumbi icumi nyene. Indimiro zaho zizovamwo ivyokurya vy’abakora mu gisagara. <verse eid="EZK 48:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EZK 48:19" />Abazoba bakora mu gisagara barima izo ndimiro, bazoba bava mu miryango yose ya Isirayeli. <verse eid="EZK 48:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EZK 48:20" />Uwo mugabane wera wose uzoba ufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na bitanu uruhande rwose. Muzowutoranye nk’ingabire idasanzwe, hamwe n’ahubatse igisagara.<verse eid="EZK 48:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EZK 48:21" />Ahasigaye ku mpande zompi z’umugabane wera n’igisagara, hazobe ah’umwami. Hazongana n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na zitanu kuva ku mugabane wera uja mu buseruko, n’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi mirongo ibiri na zitanu kuva ku mugabane wera uja mu burengero. Iyo migabane yose uko ari ibiri, izoba ihana urubibe rurerure n’imigabane yahawe imiryango, izoba iy’umwami; kandi umugabane wera hamwe n’urusengero bizoba hagati na hagati y’aho. <verse eid="EZK 48:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EZK 48:22" />Nuko rero umugabane w’Abalewi uzoba ugizwe n’ahantu hose hari hagati y’intara ya Yuda n’intara ya Benyamini, ukuyemwo ahatoranirijwe kuba umugabane wera n’igisagara.<verse eid="EZK 48:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EZK 48:23" />Ku miryango isigaye:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 48:23" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZK 48:23">Benyamini azohabwa intara imwe, izova mu buseruko ishike mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="EZK 48:24" />Simeyoni azohabwa intara imwe, izoba ihana urubibe n’iya Benyamini, ikava mu buseruko igashika mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EZK 48:25" />Isakari azohabwa intara imwe, izoba ihana urubibe n’iya Simeyoni, izova mu buseruko ishike mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="EZK 48:26" />Zebuloni azohabwa intara imwe, izoba ihana urubibe n’iya Isakari, kandi izova mu buseruko ishike mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="EZK 48:27" />Gadi azohabwa intara imwe, izoba ihana urubibe n’iya Zebuloni, izova mu buseruko ishike mu burengero.<verse eid="EZK 48:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="EZK 48:28" />Urubibe rwo mu bumanuko bw’intara ya Gadi ruzova i Tamari rushike mu mazi y’i Meriba Kadeshi, rugere no ku kagezi ka Egiputa, rushike no ku Kiyaga Mediterane.<verse eid="EZK 48:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="EZK 48:29" />Ng’uko uko muzogabura igihugu, kikaba ishamvu ry’Abisirayeli, izo zikaba intara zabo, ni jewe <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> Nyeninganji ndabivuze.<verse eid="EZK 48:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Amarembo y’igisagara gishasha</para>
  <para style="lh">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="EZK 48:30" />Aya azobe ari yo marembo asohoka ava mu gisagara:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 48:30" />
  <para style="li1" vid="EZK 48:30">Uhereye ku ruhande rwo mu buraruko, rufise ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu z’uburebure, <verse eid="EZK 48:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EZK 48:31" />hazoba amarembo atatu rimwe ryose rigire izina ry’umuryango umwe wa Isirayeli. Irya mbere rizokwitwe irembo rya Reyubeni, irya kabiri ryitwe irembo rya Yuda, irya gatatu ryitwe irembo rya Lewi.<verse eid="EZK 48:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="EZK 48:32" />Ku ruhande rwo mu buseruko; na ho nyene rufise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu, hazoba amarembo atatu: Irembo rya Yosefu, irembo rya Benyamini n’irembo rya Dani.<verse eid="EZK 48:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="EZK 48:33" />Ku ruhande rwo mu bumanuko, na ho nyene rufise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu, hazoba amarembo atatu: irembo rya Simeyoni, irembo rya Isakari, n’irya Zebuloni.<verse eid="EZK 48:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="EZK 48:34" />Ku ruhande rwo mu burengero, na ho nyene rufise uburebure bw’ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi bine n’amajana atanu, hazoba amarembo atatu: irembo rya Gadi, irembo rya Asheri n’irembo rya Nafutali.<verse eid="EZK 48:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="lf">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="EZK 48:35" />Inkikuro y’ico gisagara izobe ingero z’igice c’ukuboko ibihumbi icumi n’umunani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">48:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ni nk’ibilometero 9,5.</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="EZK 48:35" />
  <para style="p" vid="EZK 48:35">Kandi kuva ico gihe, izina ry’ico gisagara rizobe iri: <char style="nd">Uhoraho</char> ni ho ari.”<verse eid="EZK 48:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EZK 48" />
</usx>